<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">Sam</book>
  <para style="h">Sam</para>
  <para style="toc1">Sam</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sam</para>
  <para style="mt">Sam</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian limsakloute hoihsak bang a om ngeilou a, mikhialte lampi a leng ding lou a, musitte tutphah a leng tu ngeilou mi a hampha hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kipahna uh Toupa Dan ah ahizaw a; a danthu sun leh zan in a ngaihtuah ngitnget hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah zaw tui luang kiang a sing suan, a hun a gahzel, a nah leng kau ngeilou bang ahi; a thilhih peuhmah a lamzang zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian limsakloute huchibang ahi kei ua; buhsi huih in a mut lengmang bang ahizaw uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaiziak in mi Pathian limsakloute zaw vaihawmna ma ah a ding theikei ding uh, mikhialte leng mi diktatte kikhopna ah ading thei sam kei ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n mi diktatte lampi a thei naknak ngal a; mikhialte lampi bel a mangthang ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bang achia namchih heh uh ahia, bang achia michih in thil phatuamlou ngaihtuah uh ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leitung a kumpipate a kisa duamduam ua, heutute’n leng Toupa leh a thaunilh a sawm chiat ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A gaknate uh hihtat in, a khauhualte uh ei a kipan i paimang ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Van a tupa a nui dia: Toupa’n amau a nuihsan ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaikhit chiang in heh in a kiang uah thu a gen ding a, thangpai tak in amau a hih mangbangta ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keimahmah in ka tang siangthou Zion ah ka kumpipa ka tusak hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thusehsa ka gen ding hi: Toupa’n ka kiang ah, Nang zaw ka tapa na hi a; tuni in ka hon neikhia ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Honngen in, huchi in na gouluah ding in namchih k’on pedia, kawlmong tawp tan in na gou ding in leng k’on pe ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaute sik chiang in na hihkham dia; belvelte’n bel a paih khap bang un na pai kham ding a, A chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipate aw, pilta unla: leitung a vaihawmte aw, thuzoh in omta un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Laudan siam in Toupa nna sem unla, ling kawm in kipak un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tapa tawp unla, huchi kei leh a heh dia, lam lak ah na mangthang kha ding uh, a thangpai zok ding hi. Amah a ginna koih tengteng a hampha uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa , kei hondoute pung hina mahmah u e! Kei honsualte tampi ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah ading in Pathian ah panpihna himhim a omkei, chi a, ka hinna tungtang thugente tampi a om uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh, Toupa aw, nang ka thupina leh ka kim ka vel in ka phaw na hi a; ka lu dom kangpa na hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka aw in Toupa ka sam a, a tang siangthou a kipan in a hon dawng zel hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei ka lum ka na ihmuta a; ka khanglou nawn a; Toupa’n a hon na len gige ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hondou a, hon um suakte, mi sing khat nangawn ka kihta kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa aw, thou inla; ka Pathian aw, hon hondam in: kei hondoute teng a biang guh uah na khen pah a; Pathian limsaklou mite ha na kikhong sak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hotdamna tuh Toupa a ahi: Na vualzawlna na mite tung ah om hen. Selah
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka diktanna Pathian aw, k’on sap chiang in hon dawng in; ka mangbat chiang in, nang n’on hih navak zel a: hon hehpih inla, ka thumna hon ngaihkhiak sak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tate aw, ka thupina bangtan ahia zahlakna a na suahsak ding uh? Bang tan ahia thil bangmahlou na thupi sak ua, zuauthu na zon ding uh? Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa Pathian limsak mi amah ading in a koihtuam chih theizaw un: Amah ka sap peuhmah chiang in, Toupa’n a hon ngaikhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kihta unla, thil hihkhial kei un: na lupna tung uah na lungtang uah na lungtang un ngaihtuah unla, dai sipsip un. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Diktatna kithoihna lan unla, Toupa gingta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hoihna himhim kuan ahia hon musak ding chite tampi a om uhi. Toupa , nangmah mah in na mel vak in honsun vak in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A buh leh a uain uh a hong khan chiang a a kipahna sang ua, kipahna thupizaw ka lungtang ah na omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khamuangtak in ka lum dia, ka ihmu ding hi: Toupa , nangmah mah na hi, kei kia a leng bittak a hon omsak gige.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, ka thute ah na bil hondoh inla, ka ngaihtuahnate ngaihtuah in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka kumpipa leh ka Pathian, Ka kikou aw ngaikhia in: na kiang a thum ka hi ngal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa aw, zingsang in ka aw na naza zel ding a; Zingsang in ka thumna na ma ah ka gel hoih dimdiam ding a, k’on na hungaih zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gilou salou kipahpih Pathian na hi ngal kei a: mikhialte tuh na kiang a tung kei ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi kiuangsakte na mitmuh in ading theikei ding ua: gitlouhna na semte tengteng na hua hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zuau genhatte na hihmang ding a: Toupa’n sisan suahhat leh khemhat mi a kih nilouhlouh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei bel, na hoihna phatna in, na inn ah ka honglut ding a: laudansiam kawm in na biakin siangthou lam nga in k’on be zel ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa aw, ka melmate ziak in na diktatna in honpi inla; na lampi ka ma ah ki chiansak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kam uah ginomna himhim a omkei a; a sunglam uh gitlouh satlouhna ngen ahi: a gawl uh han kihong ahi a; a lei un mi a phat khempeuh uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian aw, amaute siamlouh tangsak in amau hoihsaknate ngei pukna in zang uhen; a tatlekna tampi ziak un sawnkhia in; na tung ah a hel ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangmah a ginna koihte nangmah ah kipak uhenla, na humbit zel ziak in nuam in kikou nilouhlouh uhen; na min itte leng nangmah ah kipaktak in om uhen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi diktat na vualzawl ding a; Toupa aw, amah phaw bang in, Deihsakna in na umsuak ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, heh in honsal kenla, thangpai in honsawi sam ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa aw, hon hehpih in, ka gim gawpta a: Toupa aw, hon damsakin; ka guhte lah a na vekta ngal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka hinna leng nakpitak a hihmangbat in a om hi: Toupa aw, nang bang tan ahia n’on etsim ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa aw, hongkik nawn inla, ka hinna hondam in: na hoihna phatna ziak in hon hondam in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sih nung in nang theihgigena a om ngal kei a: Sheol ah kuan ahia na tung a kipahthu gen ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mauna lam ah ka bahta; zan teng in ka lupna tui ah ka kilam sak a; ka lupna ka khitui in ka kawt sak zel hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mit lungkhamna ziak in a se hulhul a; hondoute ziak in a hongtek deuhdeuhta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nou, na gilou sem tengteng aw, hon paisan vek un; Toupa’n ka kah ging a zata ngal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa’n hehpihna ka nget lah a ngaikheta a; Toupa’n ka thumna a kipahpih ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hondoute tengteng a zahlak un a mangbang mahmah ding ua; a kiknawn ding ua, thakhat in a hong zahlak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa ka Pathian aw, nangmah ah ka ginna ka nga a: hondelh tengteng lak ah hon hondam in hon humbit in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchilou in zaw, humbitpa omlou in humpinelkai bang in, ka hinna a bot nen kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa ka Pathian aw, huchibang a hih ka na hih a, ka khut a khelhna a om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lawm khelhna a thuk ka na hihleh, Ahi, bangmahlou a hondou ka humbit a na hi zaw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Melma in ka hinna delh in, delh pha mai hen aw; ahi, ka hinna lei ah chilpuk in, ka thupina leivui lak ah koihmai hen. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa aw, heh in thou inla, hondoute thangpaihna dou din kisa inla: kei a ding in kihihhalh inla; vaihawmna ding thu na peta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in michih kikhawm khawmte’n hon umsuak uhen: huan, nang a tung uah sangpi in kiknawn in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n michih vai a hawmsak hi: Toupa aw, keimah a ka diktatna leh ka lungsim hoihna om bangzel in vai hon hawmsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Giloute gitlouhna hong tawpta leh aw, mi diktatte hihkip in: Pathian diktat in lungtangte leh lungsimte a enchian hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka phaw Pathian kiang ah a om, amah zaw lungtang dikpu hondampa ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian vaihawmpa diktat ahi, ahi, ni teng in migiloute tung a lunghihlouhna nei Pathian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi a kihei kik kei leh aman a namsau tat-hiam in; thalpeu a lai a, a manta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sihna vanzatte amah thahna ding in leng a bawl dimdiam a; a thalte kuangthei in a bawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />En in, gitlouhna a zinpih; ahi, thilhihkhelhna a pai a, zuauthu a piangsakta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kawkhuk a bawl a, thukpi in a tou a, amah khuk toh ah a keta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A thilhihkhelhna amah lutung mah ah a hongkik nawn ding, hiamgam tak a a thilhih amah sipmah ah a ke ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa a diktatna ziak in, a kiang ah kipahthu ka gen ding: Toupa tungnungpen min phat in la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa ka Toupa aw, leitung tengteng ah na min hoih hina tel e! Na thupina thu vantungte ah na koih a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Melma leh phulami daihsakna ding in, Hondoute ziak in naungek leh nawine laite kam a pawt in hatna na hihkip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na van, na khutsuakte, kha leh aksi na sehte, ka ngaihtuah chiang in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihing bang ahia, huchitel a na limsak? Mihing tapa leng bang ahia, huchitel a na veh? ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah zaw Pathian sang a nuaizaw phet in na bawl a, thupina leh pahtawina na khusak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na khutsuak tungte ah thu na neisak a; a khenuai ah bangpeuh na koih a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Belam leh bawng tengteng toh, ahi, gamsate toh leng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tung a leng vasa leh tuipi ngasate, tuipi a lampi tawn peuhmahte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa kou Toupa aw, leitung tengteng ah Na min hoih hina tel e!
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa kiang ah ka lungtang tengteng in kipahthu ka gen ding a; na thillamdang hih tengteng ka theisak ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmah ah ka kipak in ka nuam ding a: Tungnungpen aw, na min phat in la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hondoute a taizak tak un, na ma ah a kipalpuk ua, a mangthang uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei adia kilawm himahleh ka thu ah nang kei n’on gum ngal a; diktak a vaihawm in mangtutphah ah na tu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Namchih na thuhilh a, gilou saloute na hih mangthang a, a min uh leng Tangtawn tangtawn in na thaimangta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Doumite a mangbang vek ua, tangtawn a ding in bangmah neilou in a omta uhi; na khaw sukgamsate amaute theihgigena nangawn toh a mangthang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa tangtawn in kumpipa in a tu dia; a mangtutphah vaihawmna in a bawlta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman khovel kizentak in vai a hawmsak ding a, khentuam neilou in michih vai a hawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nuaisiahte adin Toupa bukna ahi ding, buai hun chiang a bukna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi in na min theite’n a honmuang ding ua; nang zaw Toupa , nangmah honzongte na paisan ngei ngal kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa , Zion a om phat in lasa unla; mite lak ah a thilhihte hilh un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sisan suah thu dongtel zelpa’n amau lah a theigige ngal a; mi genthei kikou aw a mangngilh ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa aw, hon hehpih inla; sihna kongkhak apan hon kaikhepa, hon hawte ziak a ka mangbatna en in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangmah phatna tengteng ka theih sak theihna ding in: Zion tanu kongpi ah, n’on hotdamna ah ka nuam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Namchih a kawkhuk bawl uah a tum ua; a guk a a len zak uah amau khe mah a awkta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa a kihilta a, vai a hawmta a: migilou salou amah khutsuak mah ah a awk hi. Higgaion. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Migilou saloute Sheol ah a kiknawn ding uh. Namchih Pathian mangngilh hatte tengteng toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tagahte mangngilh in a om nilouh louh kei ding ua, gentheite lametna tangtawn in a mang sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa aw, thou dihve; mihing peuhmah vualzou kei hen: namchih na mitmuh ah vaihawm sak in om hen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa aw, amau lausak in; namchih in mihing lel ahi uh chih kithei uhen. Selah
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, bang achia gamlapi a ding nak na hia? Bang achia mangbat lai bang a kisel nak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Migilou salou kisaktheihna ziak in mi gentheite delh in a om uhi, a thil gilou ngaihtuah khiakte uah amau mah awk uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Migilou salou in a lungtang utlam a suang, mi huaiham in Toupa a paikhia a, a musit hi. Toupa a paikhia a, a musit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Migilou salou in kisaktheih melpu in, A phut kei ding, a chi hi. A ngaihtuahna tengteng tuh, Pathian a omkei, chih ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A omdante tuh chiklaipeuh in leng a kip a; na vaihawmnate tunglam gamlapi ah, a muh bat louh ah, a om hi: Amah doute tengteng lah a nuihsan maimah ngal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lungsim in, Ka ling kei ding; khang tengteng tan in mangbang in ka omkei ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kam hamse lohnate, khemnate, engbawlnate in a dim a; a lei nuai ah thilhihkhelhna leh siatna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khawteng a guktanna munte ah a tu zel a; mun dai ah khelhna neilou mite a that zel hi: a mit in genthei mite a guktan nak ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Humpinelkai in a kua a a guktan bang in aman mundai ah a guktan zel hi; mi genthei man ding in a tang zel a: mi genthei a man ngei a, huchin a len in a kaimang nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A khupboh a, a kun a, bangmah hih theilou A mihatte uh hihpuk in a om nak uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A lungsim ah, Pathian in a mangngilh ahi: a mai a sel a, chikmah chiang in a mu kei ding, a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa aw, thou in; Pathian aw, na khutlik in: mi gentheite mangngilh ken;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangziak in ahia migilou salou in Pathian a muhsit, a lungsim a, Na phut kei ding, a chih nak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Muh zaw na mu khin tham a; na khut a thuk ding thil hihkhial leh hihvuina na en a: migentheite na kiang ah a ki kemsak ua; Pa neilou panpihpa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Migilou salou ban sutan inla, migilou, gitlouhna zongkhia in, na muh het louh mateng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa tangtawn tangtawn adin Kumpipa ahi a: namte amah gam a pan in a mangthang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa , kingainiamte deihna na ngaikhia a: a lungtang uh na kisa sak ding a, A bil un leng na za sak ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pa neiloute leh engbawlte, leitung min a engbawl nawnlouhna ding un, a vai uh hawmsak in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa ah ka ginna ka nga zel a: bangchidan ahia ka hinna kiang a, Na mual ah vasa bang in leng mang in chi na hi ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />En dih ua, lungtang diktakpu mial nuai a a kap theihna ding un, migilou saloute’n thalpeu a lai ua, a thal uah a khau ah a bulh chiat uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Suangphumte hihsiat a om leh, mi diktat in bang ahia a hih theih ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa a biakin siangthou ah a om a, Toupa mangtutphah leng van ah a om; mihing tate a mit in a en a, a mitvun in a enchian zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n midiktat a enchian zel a: migilou salou leh hiamgamna deihte bel a hinna in a hua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Migilou saloute tung ah thang a kesak ding a; mei leh kat leh huih mulkimhuai tak a nou tan ding uh ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa lah a diktat ngal a; diktatna a deih naknak hi; mi diktatte’n a mel a mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa , hon panpih in; Pathian limsakmi lah a om nawnta ngal kei ua; mihing tate lak a kipan mi ginom lah a mangta ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Michih in a invengte kiang ah thu bangmahlou maimai a gengen uhi: maitang phatna leh khemna lungtang pu in thu a gen nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa’n maitang phatna muk tengteng a atkhe ding a, thu kisathei genna lei toh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau, i lei in i zou ding ua; i mukte eimah a ngei a ka, kua ahia itunga lal om? a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n , Gentheite a simmawh ziak uleh, tagahte thum ziak in, ka thou pah dia; a nuihsan uh bittak in ka omsak ding, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa thute thu siangthou tak ahi a; dangka leitung a haltuina mei a etkhiak a, sagihvei hihsiangthou zohsa bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang amau na kem hoih ding a, hiai khangte lak ah chiklaipeuh in leng na humbit ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihing tate lak ah khelhna pahtawi a a om in, migilou salou a vialvak nak uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, bang tan ahia n’on mangngilh nilouh louh ding? Bang tan ahia kei a kipan a na mai na sel ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nitum in ka lungtang a lungkhamna nei in bang tan ahia ka lungsim a ka gelgel ding? Bang tan ka melma ka tung a tawisan hi ding ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa ka Pathian aw, ngaihtuah inla, hon dawng in: ka mit hon hihvak inla, huchilou in zaw sihna ihmut in ka ihmu kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka melma in, Amah ka zouta, a chi kha ding hi; ka lin leh kei hondoute a kipak kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh ken zaw na zahngaihna ka muang ahi; n’on hotdamna ah ka lungtang a kipak ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka tung a hoihtak a a hihtak ziak in: Toupa pahtawi in la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihai in a lungsim in, Pathian a omkei, a chi a. A kigawp khin ua, thil kihhuai tak a hih ua; thil hoih hih a omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Theisiam a Pathian zong a om u hiam, chi in Toupa’n van a kipan in mihing tate a ensuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hiloulam ah a pial vekta ua, nintak in a na om chiatta ua; kuamah thil hoih hih a omkei ua, khat lel leng a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thil hihkhialte tengteng in theihna himhim a neikei ua hia? Tanghou a nek bang un ka mite a nezou vek ua, Toupa a sam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai ah lau tuntun in a om ua; Pathian, mi diktat suante lak a a om ziak in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi genthei suangtuahnate na selphou ua, Toupa a kihumbitna a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israelte hotdamna Zion a kipan in hongpawt mahleh aw! Toupa’n a mite sal a a om uh a pi kiknawn chiang in, huai hun in Jakobte a nuam ding ua, Israelte a kipakta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa , na puanin ah kua a hong zintung dia? Na tang siangthou ah kua hongom ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Diktak a om, kizen tak a hih a, a lungtang a thutak gen mi pen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lei a mi gense ngeilou a, a lawm tung a thil hihkhial ngeilou a, a invengte min leng gense ngeilou mi pen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Migilou muhsit in a om nak hi; Toupa laudan siamte a pahtawi hi. Amah ading a poi ding na ngawn kichiam khin a hih lamdang ngeilou mi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A pung delh ding a a sum leitawi saklou mi, a siam zaw siamlou tangsak ding a golhna leng la ngeilou mi pen. Huchibang thil hihmi, Bangchik mah in a ling kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, hon humbit in: nangmah ah ka ginna ka koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa kiang ah, Nang tuh ka Toupa na hi a; Nang loungal thil hoih himhim ka neikei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lei a Mi Siangthou omte zaw, amau zaw mi hoih, ka kipahna teng omna ahi uh, ka chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />pathian dangte kiang a taite zaw, a lungkhamnate uh a pung ding: a sisan dawn kithoihna uh ken zaw ka lan kei ding a, ka muk in a minte uh ka lou sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa ka goutan leh ka nou tan ahi: nang ka tantuam n’on hihkip sak zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tehna khaute mun nuamtak ah ka tuam ding in a keta ahi; ahi, gou hoih tak ka luahta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa , suangtuahsakpa, ka phat ding a: ahi, zanchiang in ka lungsim hon hilhpil zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa ka ma ah ka omsak gige a; ka taklam a a om ziak in ka ling kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka lungtang a kipak a, ka thupina a nuam hi: ka sa leng bittak in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka kha Sheol ah na nuse kei ding a: Na Mi Siangthou muatna mu ding in na phal sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang hinna lampi n’on theisak ding a; na ma ah nuam dimletna a om hi; na khut taklam ah tangtawn kipahna ding a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, ka dikna thu za inla, ka kikou husa ngaikhia inla, ka thumna, zuauthu genhat muk a pawt hilou ah, bil na doh in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka tung a thupukna na ma a kipan a pawt hi henla; na mit in khentuam neih louhna en hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka lungtang na enchian a; zan in na hongpha a; n’on endikta a bangmah na mu hetkei a; ka kam in a genkhial kei ding ka chi chiltel ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihing thilhih ah zaw, na muk a thupawt ziak in mihing ngongtat lampi a pailou ding in ka kikem hoih ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka kalsuante’n na lampi a tawn ziahziah a, ka khete a tal ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian aw, ka honsam zel a, nang lah n’on dawng ding a: kei lam ah na bil hondoh inla, ka thugen ngaikhia in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmah a ginna koih peuhmahte kiang a, na khut taklam a amau sualte hondam zelpa aw, na chitna lamdang kilang sak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mit laimu bang in honkem inla, na kha nuai ah hon busak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Migilou salou hon hihsia a, hondou a hon um kim lak ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaute thau a um in a om ua, a kam un kisatheitak in thu a gen uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin ka kalsuanna peuhmah a hon umsuak a, hon hihpuk ding in a mitte uh ka tung uah a tu sak uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amah humpinelkai sa keih ut bang leh humpinelkai lunlai mun dai peuh a buk nilouhlouh bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa aw, thou inla, amah maituah pih inla, kunsak in: ka hinna migilou salou lak ah na namsau in humbit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa aw, na khut in mihingte lak ah, khovel mihingte lak ah, humbit in; amau tuam zaw tu damsung a a neih uh ahi a, a gil uh na gou in na dimsak naknak a; tate lungkim huntak in a nei ua, a sum zat val uh a tangekte uh ading in a sihsan zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ken zaw diktatna nei in na mel ka mu ding a; nangmah batna nei a ka hah chiang in ka lungkim hun mahmah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa ka hatna aw, ka hon it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa ka suangpi leh ka kulhpi, Hon humbitpa ahi; ka Pathian ka suangpi kiptak ahi a, amah ah ginna ka koih ding; ka phaw, ka hotdamna ki leh ka insang ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Phat tuak Toupa ka sam ding a, Hondoute lak ah hotdam in ka om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sihna khauhualte’n a hon gak a, Pathian limsaklouhna tuihual in hontum a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sheol khauhualte’n a hon gaksuak a: sihna thangte ka kimvel in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka lungkham a Toupa ka sam a, ka Pathian ka sam hi. Aman a biakin apan ka aw a za a, a ma a ka kikou husa a bil ah a lutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaitak in lei a ling a, a kisatta a, a heh ziak in tangte leng a kingakna nangawn toh a kisat in a lingta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nak a kipan in meikhu a zamtou a, a kam a pawt mei in a kang zuazua a, meihol leng a kuangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman vante kunsak in, a hohsuk a; A khenuai ah mial bikbek a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cherub tung ah a tuang a, a lengta hi, ahi, huih khuate ah a leng vengveng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mial bukna mun ah, amah umna bukta in, a bawl a; tui a mialna, van a meipite mah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ma a vakna ziak in a meipite a theng a, gialte leh meiamte a ke toktok uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa van tung ah a ging dodop a, Tungnungpen in a aw a suaksak a; gialte leh meiamte a ke toktok uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thalte a kapkhia a, amau a hihzak hi; ahi, khua a phe zolzol nilouh a, a hihbuai vengvung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huaitak in, Toupa aw, na tai ding a, na nak a hu pawt in a mut ziak in, tui luannate a hong kilang a, leilung kingaknate hihlat in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman tunglam a kipan in a honsawk a, honlen a; tui tampi a kipan hon kaikhia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei galhattak lak ah hon humbit a, hon hawte lak ah leng; kei ding in a hat lawzen ngal ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amau ka vangtah ni’n honsual ua, himahleh Toupa ka ginpi pen ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman mun awngthawl ah hon pikhia a; ka tung a a kipah ziak in hon humbitta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Toupa’n ka diktatdan bang in ka tung ah a hih a; ka khutte a siangthou dan bang ngei in a hondin ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa lampite ka tawn a, ka Pathian kiang a kipan gilou tak in ka pai mang ngei ngal kei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A vaihawmna tengteng ka ma ah a om a, a thusehte ka pai ngei ngal kei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amah lak ah gensiatbei ka hi a, ka siatna a kipan ka kihuikhe zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa’n ka dikdan bang in hon na dinta a, ka khutte a mitmuh a a sianthou bangzel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihehpihthei takte lak ah hehpihthei tak in na kilang ding a; mi hoihkimte lak ah hoihkim in na kilang ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Misiangthoute lak ah siangthou in na kilang ding a; huan, genhakte lak ah genhak in na kilang ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gimthuak mite hondam ding na hi ngal a; mi kisatheite bel na hihniam ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nang ka khawnvak n’on detsak ding ahi ngal a: Toupa ka Pathian in ka mialna a hihvak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nang hon panpih in gal ka delh ngal a; ka Pathian panpih mah in kulh dai ka tawmkan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pathian lampi a hoihkim a, Toupa thu etdik ahita hi; amah a ginna koih tengteng ading in amah tuh phaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Toupa lou Pathian kua a om a ahia? I Pathian lou Suangpi kua a om a ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hatna hon tengsakpa leh ka lampi hih hoihkimpa Pathian mah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aman ka khe zukpi khe bang in a bawl a, ka mun sangte ah hon omsak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka khutte galdou ding in a chil a, ka bante’n dal thalpeu a lai zou hial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nang na hotdamna phaw n’on pia a: na khut taklam in honkai a, na kingaihniamna in n’on bawllian hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ka nuai a ka kalsuanna na hihlian a, huchi in ka khete a teu kei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hondoute ka delh ding a, ka delh pha ding: hih manthat a a om masiah uh ka kihei kikta kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A thohnawn theihlouhna ding un ka sattan dia: ka khe nua’h a puk ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nang kidouna ading in hatna ka tai ah n’on tengsak a: honsualte ka nuai ah na zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Honhawte ka hih manthat theihna din, nang hondoute hon nunglehngatsan ding in na omsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amau a kikou ua, himahleh hondampa ding kuamah a omkei uh: Toupa a sam ua, himahleh a dawng tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Huaitak in leivui huih mutleng bang in ka satnen a: kholak buannawi bangphet in ka paikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nang mite kilaina lak ah n’on humbit a; namchih lutang ding in na honsiam a, ka theih ngeilouh mite’n ka nek ka tak a bawlta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ka tanchin a zaktak un ka thu a mang ding ua; mikhualte ka kiang ah a kipe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mikhualte a vul ding ua, a insang ua kipan in ling kawm in a hongsuk ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Toupa a hing hi; ka suangpi phat in om henla; hon hondampa Pathian pahtawi in om hen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Phu hon laksakpa leh, michih ka nuai a zoupa Pathian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Aman hondoute lak ah hon honkhia a: ahi, nang kei honsualte tunglam ah n’on domkang a: Mi hiamgamte lak a kipan na hon humbit zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Toupa aw, namchih lak ah kipahthu k’on hilh ding a, nang phat in la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Aman hotdamna thupitak a kumpipa bawl kiang ah a pe zel a; a thaunilhpa tung ah, David leh a suante tung ngei ah, tangtawn in a chitna a langsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vante’n Pathian thupidan a theisak ua; huihkhua liantak in a khutsuak a langsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sun in sun kiang ah thu a gen sawn a, Zan in zan kiang ah theihna a sulang sawnsawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thugen himhim leh pau a omkei a; a aw uh bil a zak theih ahi kei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A tehna khau uh leilung luah tengteng ah Zam suaksak in a om a; a thu uh kawlmong pha in a thangkheta hi. Huaite ah ni ading in puanin a zak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai ni tuh mouneipa ding a dantan a kipan pawt bang ahi a, mi hattak bang in, a taina lampi a a tai ding nuam a sa naknak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A pawtna kawlmong tawp a kipan ahi a, a taikawina a tawp lehlam tan in ahi a, a satdan theilou a selguk in a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa dan a hoihkim a, hinna a halhsak hi; Toupa thu theihsak a muanhuai a, mi mawl a pilsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa thuzohna a dik a, lungtang a kipaksak nak hi: Toupa thupiak a siangthou a, mitte ahihvak nak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa laudansiam a siang a, tangtawn a ding in a om hi: Toupa vaihawmnate a tak a, a kizen kimvel vek ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaite dangkaeng sang in a deihhuai zaw ahi; ahi, dangkaeng siangthou tampi sang in leng: khuaizu leh khuaikhak sang in leng a khum zaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai lou leng huaite in na sikha taihilh in ka om zel hi; huaite zuih kipahman thupitak neihna ahi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kuan ahia amah diklouhnate theithei ding? Diklouhna kiselte lak ah hon huikhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thil hihkhial teitei lou ding in na sikha honlen chinten inla; ka tung ah amaute thunei sak ken! huchi in hoih in ka om dia, tatlekna thupitak lak ah gensiat bei in ka om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa aw, ka suangpi leh hontanpa, ka kam a thupawtte leh ka lungtang a ka ngaihtuahnate na mitmuh in pomtak hi hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangbat ni’n Toupa’n hon dawng hen! Jakob Pathian min in hon liahkhuh hen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mun siangthou a kipan in panpihna hon sawlsak henla, Zion a kipan in hon hihhat hen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na thillat teng theigige henla, na haltum thillat kipahpih hen! Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lungtang deihlam honpia henla, na lunggel tengteng hon lohchingsak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na hotdamna ah nuam in la ka sa ding ua, ka Pathian min un ka puanzakte uh ka zak lai ding uh! Toupa’n na ngetnate hon lohchingsak hen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n a thaunilh a hondam chih tuin ka theita; a khut taklam hotdamna tha in a van siangthou a kipan in amah a hon dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khenkhatte’n kangtalaite a muang ua, khenkhat in sakolte a muang uhi: Enzaw Toupa i Pathian min I louzaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amau zaw a kun ua, a pukta ua; ei zaw i thou ua, i ding zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa , hondam in: i sap chiang in Kumpipa’n hon dawng hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, kumpipa tuh na hatna ah a nuam ding a, na hotdamna ah nuamsa na zouzen inchia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lungtang deihlam na pia a, a muk a thilnget na phallou kei hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hoihna a vualzohnate in na dawn a: dangkaeng siangthou kumpi lukhu na khusak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman hinna hon ngen a, na pia a tangtawn tangtawn a damna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na hotdamna ah a thupina a lian mahmah ahi: pahtawina leh thupina tung ah na nga zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tangtawn a ding in vualzawlna liantak mu in na bawl a: Na ma a nopsakna in na kipaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa’n Toupa a muang a, tungnungpen chitna ziak in a ling kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na khut in nang hondoute tengteng a zongkhe vek ding a: na khut taklam in nang hondoute a zongkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na heh hun chiang in amau haltuina meikuang lutlut bang in na bawl ding. Toupa’n amau heh in a valh khin ding a, mei in a kang mang mai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A gahte uh lei a kipan na hihmang ding a, a suante uh mihing tate lak a kipan in na hihmang behlap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tung ah thil gilou hih a tum ua; thil gilou a ngaihtuah khia ua, a hih tangtung thei ngal kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang amau na kiheisak dek a, na thalpeu khaute a maitang uah laisa in na bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa aw, na hatna ah pahtawi in hongom in: huchi in na thilhihtheihna phat in la ka sa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka Pathian, ka Pathian, bang achia hon paisan? Bang achia hon panpih ding a na gamlat mahmah a, ka thumna thute a kipan a na gamlat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Pathian aw, sun in ka kikou a, himahleh na dawng tuankei a; zan in leng ka kikou a, ka dai tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh, nang Israelte phatna a tengpa aw, nang zaw na siangthou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka pipute un nang hon na muang ua: a muang ua, huchi in nang na humbit zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang honsam ua, huchi in, humbit in a om zel ua: honmuang ua, huchi in zahlak in a om ngeikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei zaw mihing ka hi kei a, tangtel phet ka hi a; mihingte gensiat leh mite muhsit ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A honmu peuh in hon nuihsan ua, a muk uh a lawksak ua, a lu uh a sing uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa muang hi ven, aman amah humbit leh a ke: a tung a a kipah ziak in humbit leh ake, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang sul a kipan a hon lakhepa na hi a: ka nu ang a nawi ka teplai nangawn in nang muandan n’on sinsaksakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sul a kipan him in nangmah tung ah ngak ka na hi a: nang ka nu gilsung ah ka Pathian na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hon gamlat mahmah ken; mangbatna ding a nai ngal a; panpihpa ding a om tuankei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawngtal tampi in hon umsuak ua: Bashan gam a bawngtal hattakte’n hon umsuak uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Humpinelkai duhgawl humham bang in a hon kamkat khum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tui bang a buak khiak in ka om a, ka guh tengteng leng a kilawi hi; ka lungtang khuainun bang ahi a, ka gil lak ah a zul khinta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka tha belpei bang in a keu khin a; ka lei ka dangtawng ah a belh bikbek a; nang sihna leivui ah n’on pilutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Uite’n a hon umsuak ua: thil hoihlou hih omkhawmte’n hon umbit ua; ka khut leh ka khete a vut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka guh tengteng ka sim thei a; amau lah hon en in hon ensal ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka puansilhte a kihawm ua, ka puanak ding in ai a san uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang bel, Toupa aw, hon gamlat mahmah ken! Hon hihhatpa aw, hon panpih ding in hongkin in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka hinna namsau lak ah humbit inla; ka neih sun pentak ui thilhihtheihna lak ah humbit in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Humpinelkai kam a kipan in hon hondam inla; ahi, gam bawngtal ki a kipan in ka kha hondam in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka unaute kiang ah na min ka hilh ding a: kikhawmte lak ah ka honphat ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa laudansiamte aw, amah phat un; Jakob suan tengteng aw, amah pahtawi un: Israel suante aw, amah kihta un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aman gimthuakmi gimdan a musit ngal kei a, a kih sam kei hi; a mai lah a lak ah a sel kei hi; amah a sap in a ngaikhe zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kikhopna thupitak a k’on phat zel zaw nangmah na hi: A laudan siamte ma ah ka thuchiam ka tangtun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />thunuailutte’n a ne ding ua, a tai ding uh: amah zongte’n Toupa a phat ding uh: na lungtang uh tangtawn in hing in om hen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kawlmong mi tengteng in leng a thei nawn ding ua, Toupa lam a ngat ading uh: namchih a chichih na ma ah a kun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Gam Toupa a ahi a, namchih tung a vaihawmpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lei a mi neizou tengtengte’n a ne un a be ding ua; leivui dia paisuak dingte a ma ah a hong kun ding uhi, amau hinna hingsak gige theiloute.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chisuan in amah nek leh tak a bawl ding a; khangthak hongom nawnte kiang ah Toupa tanchin a hilh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A hongpai ding ua, nam hongpawt ding kiang ah, A hihkhinta, chi in, a diktatdan a hon theisak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa tuh hon chingpa ahi a; ka tasam kei ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman loupa hingnou mitmet mun ah hon kualsak zel a: khawlna tuigei mundai ah honpi zel hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka hinna a hon bawlhoih sak zel a, amah min ziak in diktatna lampi ah honpi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi, sihna lim guam tawn mah leng, Gilou himhim ka lau kei ding; nang ka kiang ah na om ngal a, na khetbuk leh na chiang in hon khamuan zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hondoute mitmuh in ka ma ah dohkan na bawlkhol a: ka lutang thau na nilhkhin a, ka nou a dimlet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pellou in hoihna leh chitna in ka damsung teng in honzui zel ding ua; huchi in Toupa inn ah tangtawn in ka om nilouhta ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leitung leh asung a thil om tengteng Toupa a ahi a; khovel leh asung a om tengteng toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuipite tung a lei amah muhkhiak ahi a, tuite tung a amah hihkip ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa tang ah kua a paitou dia, a Mun Siangthou ah kua ading ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khut siang leh lungtang siangthou nei a, a lungsim thulimlou lam a koih ngeilou a, khem tum a kichiam ngeilou mi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman Toupa kiang a kipan vualzawlna a mu ding a, a hondampa Pathian kiang a kipan diktanna leng a mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai tuh amah zawngmi suan ahi. Jakob Pathian aw, na mel zongte mah. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kongpite aw, na lutang uh sangsak un: nou tangtawn kongkhakte aw, kikhai sang un! Huchi a thupina Kumpipa honglut theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thupina Kumpipa kua ahia? Toupa hattak leh thilhihtheitak, Toupa kidouna a thilhihtheitak, ahi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kongpite aw, na lutang uh sangsak unla, ahi, tangtawn kongkhakte aw, kikhai sang un! Huchi a thupina Kumpipa a honglut theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hiai thupina Kumpipa kua ahia? Sepaihte Toupa amah mah thupina Kumpipa ahi. Selah
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, ka lungsim na kiang ah ka koih den zel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Pathian aw, nang k’on muang hi, zahlak in hon omsak kenla; hondoute honzoh phal ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi, nang hon ngakte kuamah zahlak in a omkei ding uh. A ziak omlou a lepchiahtak a gamtate zahlak in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa aw, na lampite hon theisak inla; na lamtate tanchin honhilh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thutak ah honpi inla, honhilh in, Nang hon hondampa Pathian na hi ngal a: nitum in k’on ngak nilouh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa aw, na lainatna leh na chitnate theigige in; tuma a na om gige sa ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka valnou lai khelhnate leh ka tatleknate theigige kenla; Toupa aw: na hoihna ziak in, na chitna bangzel in hon theigige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa zaw a hoih in a dik ahi: huaiziak in mikhialte lampi a musak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thunuailutte vaihawmna dik ah a pi ding a: thunuailutte amah lampi tanchin leng a hilh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thukhun leh a thu theihsakte zuite ading in Toupa lampi tengteng chitna leh thutak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa aw, na min ziak in ka thu limlouhna ngaidam in, thupitak ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa kihta mi kua ahia? A tel ding lampi a musak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hinna nuamsatak in a om ding a; a suante’n gam a luah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa thuguk amah laudansiamte kiang ah a om, a thukhun amaute a theisak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka mit in Toupa lam a en gige a: aman ka khete len a kipan in lakhe ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei lam hong nga inla, hon hehpih in; chim leh haksatak in ka om ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka lungtang buainate a hong thupita a; ka mangbatna a kipan hon pikhia in aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka haksatna leh ka thuakdan ngaihtuah inla, ka khelhnate ngaidam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hondoute ngaihtuah dih, tampi ahi ua: nakpi petmah in a honhua behlap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka hinna vom hoih inla, hon humbit in aw: zahlak in hon omsak kenla, nang ah ka ginna ka koih ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka lungsim hoihna leh ka dikna in hon humbit in. K’on ngak nilouh ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian aw, Israelte a mangbatna tengteng ua kipan tankhia in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, vai hon hawmsak in, lungsim hoihtakpu in ka om a, ginglah lou in ka muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa aw, hon pheklek in hon enchian in; ka lungsim leh ka lungtang hihsiangthou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na chitna ka ma ah a om ngal a, na thutak ah ka om zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi bangmahlou phette kiang ah ka tu ngeikei a; lepchiahte kiang ah leng ka lut sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thil hoihlou hihte kikhawmte ka mudah a, migilou saloute kiang ah ka tu kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka khutte gensiat beina in ka sil ding a, huchibang in, Toupa aw, na maitam ka vel ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kipahthu genna ngaih tak a ka gen theih a, na thil lamdang hih tengteng thute ka hilh theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa , na omna inn ka it a, na thupina omna leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hinna mikhialte lak ah lakhawm kenla, ka hinna leng sisan suahhatte lak ah lakhawm sam ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A khut uah ngaihtuah gilou a om a, a khut taklam uh golhna in a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh kei zaw lungsim hoih pu in ka om ding; hontan inla, hon hehpih in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka khe mun tam tak ah ading a; kikhopna ah Toupa a phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa ka vak leh hon hondampa ahi; kua ka lau dia? Toupa ka hinna insang ahi: kua ka kihta dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil hoihlou hihte, hondoute leh ka melmate’n, ka sa nektum a hon suallai un, a kisui ua, a puk chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sepaih pawlte’n honsual tum in hon giahkhum mahle uh ka lungtang in a kihta kei ding; ka tung ah kidouna hongsuak mahleh, huchipi in leng ka gingta chinten ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa kiang ah thil khat ka ngen a, huai mah ka zong ding; Toupa kilawmdan mu ding leh, a biakin a thu dong ding in ka damsung teng a Toupa inn a ka om gige theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangbat ni’n a bukta ah hon koihkhian ding ahi ngal a, a humbitna puanin ah honsel ding a; suangpi tung ah honkha kai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin hondoute, hon umsuakte tunglam ah ka lu dopkang in a om ding; huchi in, a puanin ah nuamna kithoihnate ka lan ding a; la ka sa ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa aw, ka aw a k’on sap leh ngaikhia inla; hon hehpih inla, dawn leng hon dawng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka mel zong un, chi a na genlai in, ka lungtang in na kiang ah, Toupa mel ka zong ding, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka lak ah na mai sel kenla; na sikha heh in hihmang ken, nang zaw hon panpihpa na hi gige a; hon hondampa Pathian aw, hon paikhe kenla hon paisan ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka nu leh ka pa’n hon paisanta uhi, himahleh Toupa’n a hon pomlai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa aw, na lampi hon ensak inla; ka melma te ziak in lampi phei mahmah ah honpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hondoute ut ut a hih ding in honpe mahmah ken; theipih dikloute’n hon sual ua, nunsiat thu sekhe nakte’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihing gam ah Toupa hoihna muh kigingta lou hile’ng ka bahta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa ngak gige in; hattak in om in, na lungtang kihih hang in; ahi, Toupa ngak gige in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, honsam ding hi ing; ka suangpi, kei lam ah na bil ngongsak ken: huchilou in zaw; nang n’on daih san leh, kawkhuk a lutsukte bang lel in ka hongom kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />K’on sap a, ka khutte na biakna Mun Siangthou lam a ka zak leh, hehpih ka ngetna awte ngaikhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Migilou salou lak leh thil hihkhialte lak ah hon kaimang khawm ken; huaite’n a invengte u kiang ah lemna thu a gen na ua, himahleh a lungtangte uah thilhihkhelhna a theh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thilhih bangzel un, a thilhih gitlouh dan bangzel in thuk inla; a khut nasep bang in thuk inla; a gitlouh man uh musak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa nasepte leh a khut a a thilhih a limsak louh ziak un aman amau bawlhoih lou in a hihse ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman ka ngetna awte a ngaihkhiak ziak in Toupa phat in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa ka hatna leh ka phaw ahi a; ka lungtang in amah a muang hi; huchi in huh in ka om hi; huaiziak in nakpitak in ka lungtang a nuam a; ka la in amah ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa a hatna uh ahi a, a thaunilh ading in hotdamna insang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na mite hondam inla, na gouluah ding vualzawl in: amaute vak inla, tangtawn in pom in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi thilhihtheitak tate aw, Toupa kiang ah pia unla, Toupa kiang ah thupina leh hatna pia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa kiang ah a min thupina pia unla; siangthou kilawmna silh in Toupa bia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa aw tui tungte ah a ging a: thupina Pathian a hong ging doldol a, Toupa mah tui tampi tung ah a ging hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa aw thilhihtheitak ahi a; Toupa aw thupitak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa aw in sidar singte a hihtan a; ahi, Toupa’n Lebanon tang a sidar singte a hihtan lemlum zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawngnou bang in amaute a diangsak a: Lebanon leh Sirion tangte gam bawngtalnou bang mai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa aw in meikuangte a phelh zel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa aw in gamdai sing a ling a: Toupa’n Kadesh gamdai a lingsak zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa aw in Zukpite nou a neisak a, gammang singnahte a nuai keu vek hi; a biakin ah, A thupi e, a chi chiat zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa Tuichim lai in kumpipa in a tu a, ahi, Toupa tangtawn a ding in kumpipa ding in a tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n a mite kiang ah hatna a pe ding a, Toupa a mite khamuanna in a vualzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, k’on pahtawi ding a; nang n’on kaikhia a hondoute n’on otkhum saklouh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa ka Pathian aw, k’on sam a, nang n’on hihdamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang ka hinna Sheol a kipan na pikhia a; kawkhuk a ka paisuk louhna ding in nang na honhum hing zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A misiangthoute aw, Toupa phat in lasa unla, a min siangthou phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hehna mitphiatkal lel ahi a; a deihsakna ah hinna a om hi; kahna giak ding in nitaklam in a honglut thei a, zingsang in nuamna a hongtung nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ken zaw nuam ka sak lai in, Chikmah chiang in ka ling kei ding, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa nang na deihsakna ziak in ka mual na ding kipsak ta a; himahleh na mai na sel a, ka hong mangbangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang k’on sam a; Toupa kiang ah hehpihna ka ngen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kawkhuk a ka paisuk leh, ka sisan ah punna bang a om ding! Leivui in honphat ding hia? Na thutak a gen sin maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa aw, ngaikhia inla, hon hehpih in: Toupa , nang hon panpihpa hi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka sunna kei din lamna na suaksak a; ka saiip puan n’on suahsak a, kipahna n’on tengsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka thupina dai nilouh lou a, nangmah phat a la a sakna ding in Toupa ka Pathian aw, tangtawn in kipahthu k’on hilh gige ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, nangmah ah ka ginna ka koih zel a; chikmah chiang in zahlak in hon omsak kenla: na diktatna ziak in hon humbit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei lam ah na bil hondoh inla; hon humbit meng in: kei ding in suangpi kiptak, hon hotdamna ding in bitna in honghi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang ka suangpi leh ka kulhpi na hi a; huaiziak in na min ziak in honpi honkai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka awkna dia a guk a a lenphah lak uah hon kaikhia in; ka insang na hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na khut ah ka kha k’on kemsak hi: Toupa thutak Pathian, nang n’on tanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thil bangpeuh ginalou peuh ngaihtuahte ka hua a; ken bel Toupa ka muang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na chitna ziak in nuam in ka kipak ding a; ka mangbatna na mu gige hi; ka hinna a mangbat lai in na theigige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hon doumi khut ah n’on khum kei a; ka khe mun awngthawl ah na ngazawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa aw, hon hehpih in, mangbang in ka om ngal a; ka mit lungkham na ziak in, ka hinna leh ka pumpi nangawn a se huaihuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka damsung lungkhamna in a mangbangta ngei a, ka kumte thumna in a beita hi: ka thulimlouhna ziak in ka tha a zaw a, ka guhte leng a segawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hondoute ziak in ka min a hong seta a, ahi ka vengte lak ah nakpi’n a seta hi, ka meltheihte ading in leng kihtakhuaipi ka hita hi: khaw lak a hon mute’n hon taisan ta ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Misi a mangngilh bang tak un mangngilh in ka om a: bel kitam banglel ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi tampi honhekna ka za ngal a, ka kim a kihtakhuai om hon sawmkhawm lai un, ka hinna honlaksak a tum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh, Toupa aw, k’on muang a: ka Pathian na hi ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hunte na khut ah a om a, hondoute khut a kipan leh hon simmohte lak ah hon humbit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na mel in na sikha hon sunvak in; na chitna ziak in hon hondam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa aw, zahlak in hon omsak ken; k’on sam ngal a: migilou salou zahlak in om uhen, Sheol ah dai dinden in om uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Muk zuautheite pau theilou in om uhen; huaite’n kisathei leh musit kawm in pautal tak in mi diktatte a gense zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na hoihna, nangmah laudansiamte ading in na kholkhawm thupi natel e! Mihing tate mitmuh a muanna koihte ading a na hihsak pen tak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amau mihing omna lak ah na humbitna na mitmuh in na selgu dia: lei selhatna lak ah bukta ah na koih gu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa phat in om hen: a chitdan lamdangtak khopi kiptak ah a hon musak ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei lah, hamhaih in, na mitmuh apan paihmang in ka omta, ka na chi maimah hi; himahleh k’on sap a hehpihna k’on ngetna awte nana za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A Mi Siangthou tengtengte aw, Toupa it un: Toupa’n mi ginom a humbit a, kisathei tak a gamta nakpitak in a thuk zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa lamen tengtengte aw, hattak in om unla, na lungtang uh hangsak un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tatlekna ngaihdam a om a, a khelhna khuh a om in, nuam a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi, Toupa’n thulimlouhna nei a a sehlouh a, a kha a zekhemna himhim omlou in nuam a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka khelhna ka genkhiak louh lai in, nitum a ka mau nilouhna in ka guhte a takkhin vekta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sun leh zan in na khut in n’on delh a: ka tui nawnna leng, khal nisa in thil a hihlamdang bang in, a lamdang hialta hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka khelhna na kiang ah ka phuang a, ka thulimlouhna ka imta kei hi, ka tatlekna Toupa kiang ah ka pulak ding a, ka chi a; huchi in ka khelh thulimlouhna na ngaidamta hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Pathian limsak michih in zon muh baihlam a na omlai in na kiang ah thum chiat uhen; tui liante a honglet hun chiang in amau a pha zou kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang ka bukna mun na hi a: mangbatna lak ah n’on humbit ding a; humbitna late in n’on umsuak sak ding. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na paina lampi ah k’on hilh pil dia, konchil ding: ka mit in konpi ding a, k’on suangtuahsak zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngaihtuahna neilou sakol hiam, sabiltung hiam bang in om kenla: tuate letkipna ding a sikbah leh kaihkhawlna khau ahi a, huchilou in na kiang nai ah a hongpai kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Migilou salou ading in lungkhamna tampi a om ding: Toupa muangte bel chitna in a umsuak zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi diktatte aw, Toupa ah nuam in kipak unla: lungtang diktak pu tengteng aw, nuam in kikou un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi diktatte aw, Toupa ah nuam in lasa un: midik ading in Pathian phat a kilawm him ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kaihging in Toupa kiang ah kipahthu gen unla; pekging gui sawm nei in amah phat in lasa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah pahtawi in la thak sa unla; husa thupi toh siamtak in tum un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa thu a dik a; a thilhih tengteng muanhuai tak a hih ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Diktatna leh vaihawmna dik a it nak a; leitung Toupa chitna in a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa thu in vante siam ahi a; huai a omte tengteng leng a kam a hu a siam ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman tuipi tuite koih khawm bang in a bawl lem khawm a: tui thukpite koihkhawmna innte ah a koih hoih zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leitung luah tengteng in Toupa laudan siam henla; khovel a om tengteng amah lau in om uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman a gen a, a hong omta a; thu a pia a, a hongom kipta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n namchih lunggelna bangmahlou in a omsak a: michih ngaihtuahnate bangmah phattuamna neilou in a siam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa lunggelna bel tangtawn in a om kip ding a, a lungtang a ngaihtuahte khang tengteng tan in a om kip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa Pathian a nei nam a hampha uhi; amah gouluah dia a tel mite mah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa’n van a kipan in a en a; mihing tate tengteng a mu nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lei a om tengteng a omna mun a kipan in a hon en zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaute tengteng lungtang sekpan a thilhih tengteng uh a enkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa himhim sepaih tam ziak lel a humbit ahi ngeikei: mihat thahat ziak lel a tatkhiak ahi sam kei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bitna ding in sakol bangmah ahi kei: a hat mahmah ziak lel in kuamah a humbit tuankei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai dih, Toupa mit tuh amah laudan siamte tung ah a tu gige a, a chitna lam ente tung ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hinna uh sihna lak a humbit ding leh kial tun a amau tungding ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I hinna in Toupa a ngak nilouh a; amah hon panpihpa leh i phaw uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah ah i lungtang a nuam ding ahi, a min siangthou i muan ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa aw, na chitna ka tung uah om hen, k’on lamet bangzel un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chiklaipeuh in leng Toupa tuh ka phat ding a: amah phatna ka kam ah a pawt gige ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hinna in Toupa a suang ding a: thunuailutte’n huai a za ding ua, a kipak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw, Toupa hon phatpih unla, a min pahtawi chiat ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa ka zong a aman hon dawng a, ka kihtak peuhmah lak ah a hon humbit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah a en ua, huchi in a hong vakta uhi; a melte uh chikmah in a zum kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai mi genthei a kikou a, Toupa a za a, a mangbatna tengteng ah a honkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah laudansiamte tuh a kimvel uah Toupa angel in a opkhum a, a humbit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw, Toupa hoihdan chiam him dih ua: amah a muanna koih mi a hampha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A misiangthoute aw, Toupa laudansiam un: amah laudansiamte ading in taksapna himhim a omlouh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Humpinelkai lunlaite tuh a tasam un a gilkial naknak uhi: Toupa zongte zaw thil hoih himhim a tasam kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kisa un, naupangte, ka thu ngaikhia un: Toupa laudan k’on hilh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hoihna a muh theihna ding un, hinna deih a damsawt ut mi kua ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na lei tuh gilou lak ah veng hoih inla, na muk khemna thu genlou ding in veng hoih in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gilou paisan inla, thil hoih hih in; lemna zong inla, a delh in delh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa mit in mi diktatte a en gige a, a bil in a sap uh za ding in a ngaikhe gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa mel in thil hihkhialte a dou a, amau theih gige na lei a kipan a hih mangthang ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi diktatte a kikou ua, Toupa’n a za a, a mangbatna tengteng uah a honkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa’n lungtang khasiate a naih zel a, lungsim a kisik peuhmahte a hondam zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi dik haksatnate a tam a, himahleh Toupa’n huaite apan a honkhia ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A guh tengteng a kem hoih a, khat lel leng hihtan ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thil hoihlou in migilou saloute a that ding a: dik hawte’n siamlouh a tang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa’n a sikhate hinna a tan a; amah a muanna koihte khat lel leng siamlouh tang a omkei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, hon sualte nang sual in: hondoute nang dou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Phaw neu leh phaw lian len in, hon panpih din ding in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tei leng phawi inla, hon delhte lam na dal in: ka hinna kiang ah, Na hondampa ka hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hinna hihmang tum a zongte zahlak sak a hihzum in om uhen, hon hihsiatna ding a thubawlte taizak sak in gen ding theilou hial in om uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Buhsi huih mutleng bang in om uhenla, Toupa angel in delhzui zel hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lampi uh mialtak leh naltak hi henla, Toupa angel in gawt hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ziak omlou in hon matna ding un a len uh kawkhuk ah a phah gu ua, a ziak omlou in ka hinna kiakna ding in kawkhuk a tou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kigin louhlai in siatna a tung uah tung henla; a len phahguk ah amah mah awk henla: huai ah ke sia hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in ka hinna Toupa ah a nuam ding hi: a hotdamna ah a kipak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka guh tengteng in, Toupa , mi genthei lanzoh vuallouh lak a humbitpa ahi, tagah leh genthei, a hihgampa apan humbitpa, nang bang kua a om? a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Theihpih diktatlou hialte a hongding ua; ka thiltheih hetlouh thute a hon dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka hinna in thiltan khop in thil hoih thilsia in a hondin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ken bel, a damlouh lai un, ka puansilh saiip ahi a: ka hinna anngawl in ka hih genthei ngal a; ka thumna keimah angsung ngei ah a hongkik nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka lawm hiam, ka unau hiam leng hi heh aw a tung ua ka omdan ding bang in ahi ka om: mi a nu kah bang in sun in ka kun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh kei ka bai leh amau a kipak ua, a kikhawm hial ua: mi vuak hatte honsual ding in a kikhawm ua, huai ka nathei ngal kei a: tawpnuam lou in a honhih ek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ankuangluina a chiamnuih gente bang phet in a ha uh hon gawikhum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa , nang bang tan ahia na et ding? Ka hinna hihsiat a tupna lak uah hon hunkhia inla, ka neihsun pen humpinelkai lak ah honkhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kikhopna thupitak ah kipahthu k’on hilh ding a: mi tampi lak ah k’on phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka melmate’n diklou tak ah hon otsan kei uhen: bangmahlou a honhawte leng a mit un kihoupih sam kei uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kituahna thu himhim a gen ngal kei ua: hiai gam a om hiathiatte khemna thute a ngaihtuah zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi, a kam un hon kam kat khum ua; Ku! Ku! i mit in i muta a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang na mu hi, daihsan ken. Toupa aw, hon gamlat mahmah ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka Pathian leh ka Toupa aw, ka vaihawm ding in, ahi, ka thu a hongum ding in, kihalhsak inla, hak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa ka Pathian aw, na diktatna bangzel in vai honhawm sak inla; amaute’n hon otsan kei uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A lungsim un, Nuam e! Huchibang a keimaw i deih, chi kei uhen. Amah i valh khinta, chi sam kei uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka siatna tung a kipakte zahlak leh gen ding bei in om chiat uhenla; ka tung a kiliansakte zahlakna leh zumna silhsak in om uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka diktatna tung a kipakte nuam a kikou in kipaktak in om uhenla: Ahi, a sikha vangphatna a kipakte'n Toupa pahtawi in om hen, chi gige uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in, ka lei in na diktatna thu a gen ding a, na phatna thu nitum in a gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Migilou salou tatlekna in ka lungtang sung ah thu a gen a, A mit ah Pathian kihtakna a omkei, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thulimlouhna a mukhe kei ding ua, a pai tuankei ding uh, chi in. Amah mitmuh in a kiphat tawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kam a thupawtte thulimlouhna leh khemna thu gen ahi nak a: pil leh thil hoih hih a tawpta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A lupna ah thil thulimlou a gel gige a; lampi hoihlou ah a pai teitei a: gilou a kih kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa aw, na chitna tung van ah a om a; na ginomna in van dumte a su hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na diktatna Pathian tangte bang ahi; na vaihawmte tui thuk talkhauh bang ahi; Toupa aw, mihing leh gamsa na humbit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian aw, na chitna manpha hina e! Mihing tate na kha nuai ah a tu zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amau na inn sung thil hoih in a tai ding ua; na kipahna lui a na dawn sak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinna tuikhuk nang ah a om a: na vak ah vak ka mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw, nangmah theite tung ah na chitna kitheisak inla; lungtang diktak pute tung ah leng na diktatna langsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kisathei khe honsual ding in kei lam ah kalsuan dah henla, migilou salou khut in hon delhmang kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai ah thulimlouhna hihte a puk ua; Paihkhiak in a om ua, a thou thei nawn kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thil hoihlou hihte ziak in kihih lungkham nuam ke’nla, diklou tak a hihte leng eng ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Loupa bang in at paih in a om zok ding ua, lou hing bang a vuai ding ahi ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa muang inla, thil hoih hih in; hiai gam ah om inla, ginomna delh zel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa tung ah leng kipak in; huchi in na lungtang deihlamte a honpe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na omdan ding Toupa tung ah nga inla; amah muang in, aman ahihvek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na dikdan vak bang in a suaksak ding a, na siamtandan leng sunlai bang mai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa ah khawl inla, amah ngak nilouh in; a omdan a vangphatna mute ziak in kihih lungkham nuam dah in, ngaihtuahna giloute pichinmi ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Heh tawpsan inla, thangpaih kisik in: ki hih lungkham nuam ken, thil hihkhelh ah a hong ke maimah nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thil hoihlou hihte hihmang in a om dek ngal ua: Toupa ngakte’n gam a luah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sawtlou chik in migilou salou a om nawnta kei dia: ahi a omna mun uh enen mahle chin, a omta kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thunuailutte’n gam a luah ding ua; kituahna thupitak ah a ki pak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Migilou salou in mi diktat a sawm a, a ha a gawikhum nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa’n amah a nuihsan ding. A ni a hongtung dek chih a theih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Genthei leh tagahte hihpuk ding leh omdan dikte that ding in migilou saloute’n namsau a phawi ua, a thalpeute uh a lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A namsau un amau lungtang a sun ding a, a thalpeute uh hihtan in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi diktat thil tawmchik neih migilou salou thil neih keihkuih sang in a hoihzaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Migilou salou bante hihtan in a om dek ngal a: mi dik Toupa’n a len gige ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa’n mi hoihkimte nite a thei a; a gouluah ding uh tangtawn a om gige ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hun hoihlou ah a zahlak kei ding ua; kial kum in leng a vah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Migilou saloute a mangthang ding ua, Toupa doute leng gamlak loupa pak kilawm bang a hihmanthat in a om ding ua, meikhu in a zammang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Migilou salou in a leitawi a, a pe nawn kei nak a; midik inbel mi a hehpih a, a pe zawnak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A vualzawlna mute’n gam a luah ding ua, a hamsiatte hih manthat in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi kalsuante Toupa hihkip ahi a; a lampi ah a kipak nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Puk mahleh, lupden sak in zaw a omkei ding hi; Toupa’n a khut in a len gige ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Naupang ka na hita a, tuin tek ka hong hita a, himahleh mi diktat limsaklouh a a omlam ka mu ngeikei hi, a suante anngolh leng ka mu ngei sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi a hehpih gige a, a leitawi sak a; a suante leng a hampha nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gilou paisan inla, thil hoih hih in; huchi in tangtawn in teng gige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Toupa’n vaihawm diktat a deih ngal a, a misiangthoute a paisan ngeikei hi, tangtawn a ding in kep hoih in a om uh: migilou salou suante bel hihmang in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Midikte’n gam a luah ding ua, a sung ah tangtawn in a om ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi dik kam in pilna thu a gen a, a lei in vaihawm diktatna thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A Pathian dan a lungtang ah a om a; a kalsuan a tolh kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Migilou salou in mi diktat a enkhia a, hihlup a tum gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Toupa’n a khut ah a nuse kei ding a, a vaihawm hun chiang in siamlouh tansak a phal sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Toupa ngak inla, a lampi tawn in, huchi in gam luah ding in a hon pahtawi ding hi: migilou saloute hih manthat a a om uh na mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Migilou salou nakpitak a thunei a, a pouna mun a singnou dawng thenthon bang a, ka biambuam ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Himahleh lampi ah mi a vapai ua, ngai dih, amah a na omkei maimah a; ahi, ka zong a, himahleh muhtheih ahi ta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mi gensiatbei chiamteh inla, mi diktak tuh en in, huchibang mite tawpna ding zaw khamuanna hi ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Talekte bel a kituak a hihsiat in a om ding ua, migilou salou tawpna ding tuh hih manthat ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Himahleh mi diktatte hotdamna Toupa a kipan in ahi; amah mangbat lai a kulhpi muan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Toupa’n amau a panpih in a humbit a, amah ah a kituklut ziak un migilou saloute lak ah humbit in a hondam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, heh in hontai kenla; thangpai in honsawi sam ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na thalte ka sa ah a tal a, na khut ka tung ah a tu bukbuk ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na lunghihlouhna ziak in ka sa ah damlai himhim a omkei a; ka thulimlouhna ziak in ka guhte ah damlai a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thulimlouhnate’n ka lu a tum mang a, puakgik tak, ka puak zoh vuallouh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka haina ziak in ka liamnate uih in a namse zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka chi a na a, ka kun ngiungiau a; nitum in lungkham in ka mau den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka kawng a lum huthut vek a; ka sa ah leng damlai a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka bah a, ka sidup keihkuih a; ka lungtang noplouhna ziak in ka thum hithit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa aw, ka deihlam tengteng na thei a; ka thumnate nang apan sel ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka lungphu kisai in hatna ka neikei a; ka mit vakna in hon paimang santa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hon itte leh ka lawmte ka natna lak ah a kihuikhia ua; ka sanggamte leng gamlapi ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka hinna hihmang tum a zongte’n hon matna ding un thang a kam ua; ka siatna ding zongte’n leng thu hoihlou takte a gen nak uhi; nitum in khemna thute a ngaihtuah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh kei tuh bengngong bang in za lou in ka om a; pautheilou mi kamka ngeilou bang in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi, mi pau zalou, a kam a taihilhna pawt ngeilou bang in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa aw, nangmah k’on lamen ngal a; Toupa ka Pathian aw, nang n’on dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchilou in zaw hon otsan dia, ka khe a teu tak in ka tung ah a kihihlian kha ding uh, ka chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka puk dekdek ngal a, ka lungngaihna leng ka ma ah a om gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka thulimlouhna ka pulak ding a; ka khelhna ziak a lungngai in ka om ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh hondoute a halh ua, a hat uhi: diklou pi a hon hawte kilawmlou pi in a pung ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil hoih thil gilou a thukte thil hoih ka delh ziak in hondoute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa aw, hon paisan kenla; ka Pathian aw, hon gamlat mahmah ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa hon hondampa aw, hon panpih ding in, kin meng in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lei a thil ka hihkhelh louhna ding in ka omdante ka veng hoih ding a; migilou saloute ka ma a a omsung uh ka kam mukgakna in ka gak ding, ka chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in daidide in pau lou in ka om a, a hoihlam ah leng ka daidide a; himahleh ka lungngaihna tohthoh in a om zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka sung ah ka lung a sa vutvut a; ka ngaihtuah in mei tuh a kuang khia a; ka lei in thu ka genta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa , ka tawpna ding leh, ka damchiang ding, bangchi ahi, chih, hon theisak inla; ka hinna beikin dan hon theisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai in, ka damsung khutpek tan phet in na siam a; ka kum na mitmuh in bangmah tham ahi kei a; michih a hoihlai pen un avek un bangmahlou lel ahi uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Michih nuamsa bang in a vak ngei ua; a mawk buai ngei nak uhi. Gou a khawl khawm ua, a luah ding lah a theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa aw, tun ah bang ka ngak dia? Nang ah a hi ka lametna a om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka tatlekna tengteng lak ah hon honkhia inla: mihai gensiat in hon omsak ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangmah hih a hih ziak in ka pau kei a, ka kam leng ka ka kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />N’on satna ka kiang a kipan lasuan inla; na khut khak a hihman ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi a tatlekna ziak a thuhilh a na sawi in, a deihlai pen leikha bang in na hihsia a; michih bangmahlou lel ahi uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa aw, ka thumna ngaikhia inla, ka kikou na ah na bildoh inla; ka khitui kia daihsan ken: na mikhual ka hi a, ka pipute bang in Khualzin tamlel bang ka hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw, hiai a kipan ka pawt a, ka omlouh paisuak vengveng ma in, ka halh nawnna ding in honhawi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa ka ngakngak a: aman a hon ngeingaih a, ka kikou a zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Manthatna kawkhuk a kipan, buannawi diadua apan a hon khai khetou a: huchi in ka khe suangpi tung ah a nga a, ka kalsuante a hihkip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />La thak ka kam ah a koih a, i Pathian phatna: mi tampi’n huai a mu ding ua, a lau ding ua, Toupa a muang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa a muanna nei a, ki satheite leh thuzuau a kipan a kihemkhiate tuh a hampha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa ka Pathian aw, nang thillamdang na hihte leh koumau lam n’on ngaihtuahnate a tam mahmah a, huaite na ma a hihlat zoh vual ahi kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kithoihna leh thillat tung ah kipahna na neikei a; ka bilte n’on honsakta a; haltum a thillat leh khelhna ding a thillat na phut kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huaitak in, ken, Ngai in, ka hongpai hi; laibuzial ah ka thu gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka Pathian aw, na deihlam hih ka kipahlam tak ahi; ahi, na danthu ka lungtang ah a om gige hi, ka chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kikhopna thupitak ah diktatna thu hoih ka tangkoupih a; Toupa aw, ngai in, ka kam ka it kei ding chih na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na diktatna ka lungsung ah ka im kei a; na ginomna leh na hotdamna thu ka tangkoupih zaw ding; Na chitna leh na takna kikhopna thupitak a mite lak ah ka selkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa aw, na lainatnate ka lak ah it kenla; na chitna leh na takna in hon humbit gige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thil hoihlou sim zohlouh in hon umsuak a, ka thulimlouhnate’n hon delhpha a, huchi in ka dak theita kei a; huaite ka samzang sang in a tamzaw a, ka lungtang a tawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa aw, hehpih in hon humbit inla; Toupa aw, hon panpih ding in kin in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka hinna hihmang tum a zongte zahlak leh zumtak in om chiat uhen; ka siatna tung a kipakte kiknawn in hih zum in om uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Awihang! awihang! chite a zahlak ziak un mangbang tak in om uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang hon zong tengteng nangmah ah nuamtak leh kipaktak in om uhenla; na hotdamna itte’n, Toupa phat in om hen, chi gige uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei zaw genthei leh liangvai ka hi a, himahleh Toupa’n a hon ngaihtuah a; nang hon panpihpa leh hon humbitpa na hi a; ka Pathian aw, sawt hal mahmah ken.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gentheite ngaihtuah mi a hampha hi, Mangbat ni’n Toupa’n amah a humbit ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n amah humbit in a hihhing ding a, lei ah vualzawl in a om ding; amah doute’n utut a bawl ding un a pe kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa’n a gimna lupna mun ah a hihhat ding a; nang a chi a nat lai in a lupna na bawlsak vek zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa aw, hon hehpih inla, ka hinna hihdam in, na tung ah thil ka hihkhial ngal a, ka chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hondoute’n, chikchiang in a si in, a min a mang diam aw! chi in, hon gensia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lak ua kuahiam in a hongveh lai in, thu bangmahlou maimai a gen zel a; a lungtang in thulimlouhna a lakhawm a; a pawt khiak tak in mi a hilh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hon haw tengteng hon gensia in a kihuau ua: hon hihsiatna ding uh a ngaihtuah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Natna hoihlou tak in a mankipta, tu a lum a thou nawn kei ding, a chi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi, ka lawm kithuahpih theih, ka muantak, ka tanghou nekpih ngei in a khetul ka tung ah a likta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh, Toupa aw, nang hon hehpih inla, amau ka thuk theihna ding in hon kaithou nawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hiai ah ka tung ah na kipak chih ka thei hi, hondou in a honzoh louh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei zaw lungsim hoihtak ka putna ah nangman n’on len chinten a, Na ma ah tangtawn adin n’on koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa , Israel Pathian, tangtawn a kipan tangtawn pha in phat in om hen, Amen! Amen!
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sakhi tal, luita tui duh a nak hawkhawk bang in, Pathian aw, ka hinna nangmah duh in a nak hawkhawk ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hinna Pathian duh in, Pathian hing duh in, a dangtak ahi; chikchiang in ahia Pathian ma ka tun ding a, a mai ka muh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka khitui sun leh zan in ka an ahi a, na Pathian koi a om ahia leh! honchi nilouhlouh ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiai thil ka theigige a, ka hinna ka sung ah ka sungbua a, mipi lak a ka pai in, nuamna leh phatna ging toh, mi tampi khawlni a Pathian inn zuan a a ma uh ka kaih zel dante.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hinna aw, bang achia kun nilouh? Bang achia ka sung a buai? Pathian lamen in; a melma damna ziak in amah k’on phat ding ahi ngal a, hon panpihpa leh ka Pathian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka Pathian aw, ka hinna ka sung ah a kun nilouh; huaiziak in Jordan leh Hermon gam a kipan, Mizar tang a kipan in k’on theigige ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na tui luang ging zuazuate ah tuithuk leh tuithuk a kisam ua: na tuikihawt leh na tui kisep teng in honvuk tumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh, Toupa’n a chitna sun in thu a pe ding a, a la in zan chiang in hon ompih ding hi, ka hinna Pathian kiang a thumna in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian ka suangpi kiang ah, Bangdia hon mangngilh a Bangding a melma nuaisiahna ziak a lungkham a ka mau vialvial nak! ka chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka guh a namsau om bang mai in hondoute’n hon gense gige ua; Na Pathian koi a om ahia leh! Honchi nilouhlouh ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hinna aw, Bang achia kun nilouh? Bang achia ka sung a buai? Pathian lamen in: amah ka phat ding a, hon panpihpa leh ka Pathian ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, vai hon hawmsak inla, Pathian limsaklou nam tung ah ka thu hon genpih in: aw, mi khemhat, mi diklou lak ah hon humbit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang ka hatna Pathian na hi ngal a; bangding in ahia n’on pampaih ding? Bangding in ahia melma nuaisiahna ziak a lungkham a ka mau vialvial nak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw, na vak leh na thutak sawl khia inla, amaute’n na tang siangthou ah honpi in, na omnate hontun uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian maitam kiang ah ka pai ding, Pathian ka nuamna mahmah kiang ah; Pathian, ka Pathian aw, kaihging toh in k’on phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hinna aw, bang achia kun nilouh? Bang achia ka sung a buai na hia? Pathian lamen in: amah phat ding ka hi ngal a, hon panpihpa leh ka Pathian.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, nidanglai a a damlai ua na thilhihte ka pipute un honhilh uh ka bil un ka za ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Namte na khut in na hawlkhia a, amau na phut a; mite na hihgim a, na paikhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gam luah ding a amau namsau a a lak uh ahi kei a, amau ban a kihumbit leng ahi kei uhi; a tung ua na kipah ziak in na khut taklam, na ban leh, na mel vak in ahizaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian aw, nang ka Kumpipa na hi: Jakob humbitna ding in thu pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah ziak in ka melmate uh ka si pai ding ua; na min ziak in honsualte ka chil ekek ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thalpeu ka muang kei ding a, ka namsau in hon hondam sam kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hondoute lak ah n’on hondam zawta hi, hon hawte na zaklaksak behlap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nitum in Pathian ka suang ding ua, na min tangtawn in ka phat ding uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tun zaw nang n’on khah khia a, n’on hihzum a; ka sepaih honte uh lak ah lah na pawtkhe ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Melmate lak ah n’on taizak sak a: hon hawte’n gallak a deihdeih uh a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang nekding belam bang in n’on pia a; namchih lak ah n’on hihdalh behlap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na mite bangmahlou in na khawngta a, a man uh lah a tam hetkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang ka kim ua mite gensiat in n’on omsak a, ka kiangnai ua mite muhsit leh nuihsan in n’on omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang namchih lak ah a selam gentehna in n’on omsak a, michih lak a mite lu sinkhum in n’on omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka buaina nitum in ka ma ah a om gige a, ka zahlakna in hontuam zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Genthangmi leh gensemi aw ziak leh, melma leh phulami ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huai tengteng ka tung uah a tung a; himahleh k’on mangngilh ngeikei ua, na thukhun ah zuau in ka hih ngeikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka lungtang uh a kihei nawn kei a, ka kalsuante’n na lampi a paisan ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang sehalte omna ah n’on bawl ek a, sihna lim a n’on tuamna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I Pathian min i mangngilh a, gamdang pathian lam ah i khutte i zak leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian in huai a zongkhe kei dia hia! Lungtang thugukte a theigige a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi, nangmah ziak in nitum in thah in ka om gige ua; belam goh dingte bang a seh ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Toupa aw, halh tanla, bang achia ihmu! hak inla, tangtawn in honkhah khe ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangziak in ahia na mai na sel a, ka haksatdan uleh nuaisiah ka thuakdan uh na mangngilh nak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka hinna uh leivui si in a kun a; ka gilpi uh lah lei ah a belh bikbek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hon panpih ding in thou inla, na chitna ziak in hon tan in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lungtang thil hoih in a dimlet a: kumpipa tungtang thu a ka laphuah ka gen ding hi: ka lei laigelh siamtak laigelhna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing tate sang in na mel a hoihzaw a; hehpihna in na muk a kinuh hi; huaiziak in Pathian in tangtawn ading in vual a honzawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw, mihat, namsau na kawng ah vom in, na thupina leh na kilawmna toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thutak leh thunuailutna leh diktatna ziak in na kilawmna silh in lamzang tak in sakol tung a tuang in pai zel in: huchi in na khut taklam in thil mulkimhuaite a honhilh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thal a zum a; michih na nuai ah a puk zel uh: kumpipa melmate lungtang ah a tal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian aw, na mangtutphah tangtawn in a om ding ahi: khentuam neihlouhna lalchiang na gam lalchiang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Diktatna na deih a, gilou salou na hua hi, huaiziak in, Pathian, na Pathian in, na lawmte sang in nakpi’n nuamna thau a honnilhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na puansilh tengteng murra gimte, aloe gimte, sing gimte a nam vungvung a; saiha a bawl kumpipa in a kaihging chi tuamtuam ging hong pawtte’n a hon hihnuam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na numei hoihte lak ah kumpipate tanute a pang ua; na taklam ah Ophir dangkaeng a kizem in kumpinu ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka tanu aw, ngaikhia inla, ngaihtuah inla, bildoh in; na mite leh na pa inn a mite mangngilh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in kumpipa’n na melhoih a deih ding hi, amah i Toupa ahi ngal a; amah bia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tura tanu thilpiak tawi in huai ah a om ding a; mi lak a hausate ngei in na hehpihna a ngen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa inn sung a kumpipa tanu a thupi zou hial a: a puansilh dangkaeng a zep kilawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Puan khui kilawm silh in kumpipa kiang ah a pi ding ua: amah zui a lawm nungakte na kiang ah a pi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kipak leh nuam in a pi ding ua: kumpipa in ah a lut ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na pate sik in na tate a om ding ua, amau leitung tengteng ah milian in na bawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na min suan tengteng ah theih gige ding in ka bawl ding: huaiziak in michih in tangtawn tangtawn in kipahthu a honhilh ding uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian i kihumbitna leh i hatna, mangbat lai a huh pahpahpa nai gige ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huaiziak in leitung hong kidang in, mualte tuipi sung pek ah kisuan mahleh i lau kei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tuite ging honhon in phul butbut mahleh, a kihot thupi ziak in mualte ling duamduam mahleh, i lautuan sam kei ding. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lui khat a om a, huai luikate’n Pathian khopi a kipaksak hi, tungnungpen omna Mun Siangthou tak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian a laitak ah a om a, a ling kei ding: Pathian in phalvak chiang in a panpih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Namchih a ging huthut a, gamte a ling a: aman a aw a suah a leitung a hong tuikhinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa i kiang uah a om a: Jakob Pathian i insang ahi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kisa un, Toupa thilhihte en un, leitung a thil a hihsiatdan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman kidounate kawlmong pha in a hihtawp a; thalpeu a hihtan a, tei a sat tan hi; kangtalaite mei ah a haltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dai unla, Pathian ka hi chih thei un: namchih lak ah pahtawi in ka om ding, lei ah pahtawi in ka om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa i kiang uah om a; Jakob Pathian i insang ahi. Selah
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi tengtengte aw, na khut uh beng unla; Nopna aw in Pathian kiang ah kikou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa Tungnungpen a kihtakhuai a; leitung tengteng ah kumpipa thupitak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman michih i nuai uah a zou ding a, namchih i khe nuai ah a zou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman i gouluah ding hon telsak ding a, a it Jakob leh a suanpen gam mah ahi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian kikou aw toh a paitou a, Toupa pengkul ging toh a pai tou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian phat in lasa unla, phat in lasa un; i kumpipa phat in lasa unla, phat in lasa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian khovel tengteng Kumpipa ahi ngal a: theisiam a phat in lasa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian namchih tung ah kumpipa in a tu a: Pathian a mangtutphah siangthou ah a tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abraham Pathian mite hi ding in michih lak a miliante a omkhawm ua: leitung kumpipate Pathian a ahi ngal ua: amah nakpitak a pahtawi in a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa a thupi a, nakpitak a phat ding ahi, i Pathian khopi ah, a tang siangthou ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A sandan a kilawm, khovel tengteng kipahna, Zion tang ahi, mallam pang a. Kumpipa thupitak khopi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A inpi ah Pathian in insang a hihdan a kitheisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai in, kumpipate a kikhawm ua, a pai khawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A mu ua, huchi in lamdang a sa ua; a mangbang ua, a paimang pah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai ah linna in a man a; numei nauvei natna in a matlai bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Suahlam huih in Tarsis long liante a na hihse zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa khopi ah, i Pathian khopi ah, bil a i zak bangtak in i muta: Pathian in huai khopi tangtawn a ding in a hihkip ding. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian aw, na biakin sunggil ah na chitna ka ngaihtuahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian aw, na min bang ngei in na phatna kawlmong pha in a om a: na khut taklam diktatna in a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na vaihawmnate ziak in Zion tang kipaktak in om henla, Judah tanute nuam in om uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zion kim ah, a kimvel in pai unla: a galven insangte leng sim un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kulhte chiamteh hoih unla, a inpite ngaihtuah un; khang hongom nawnte a na hilh theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiai Pathian tangtawn tangtawn a i Pathian hi ding ahi a: sih tanpha a leng hon pipa ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi khempeuhte aw, hiai ngaikhia unla; khovel a om tengteng aw, bildoh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi neu leh mi lian, mi hau leh mi zawng in leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kam in pilna thu a gen ding a; ka lungtang ngaihtuah tuh theihsiamna thu ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Genteh thu ah ka bil ka doh ding a: ka thugil gen kaihging in ka gentel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni hoihloute ah, ka khetul bul a thulimlouhna in hon umsuak in leng, bangding in ka lau dia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amau neih leh lam muang a, amau hauhna tampi suangte’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kuamah in a unau a tan theikei ding uh, Pathian kiang ah tatna leng a piaksak thei sam kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hinna uh tatna din tatna man a tamlua a, tangtawn a leng a ngim a ngim louh mai ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A dam gige a, muatna a muhlouhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mipilte a si ua, huai bang in, mihai leh mi mawlte leng a mang tuaktuak ua, a neih leh lam uh midangte a nawtsiat zelte uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A lungsim ngaihtuah dan uh, a innte uh tangtawn a om ding bang leh, a om nate uh suan tengteng tan a om ding bang in ahi; a gamte uh amau min mah a tamsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh mihing pahtawi in a om gige kei ua: gamsa mangthangte bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hiai ki haimuante tuah ahi a, a tan ua kipakte tawpna. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Belamhon bang in Sheol ading a seh ahi, sihna amaute a vak ding hi: zingsang lam in mi diktatte’n a tung uah thu a nei ding ua; a omnate ua a omlouhna ding in, a kilawmna uh Sheol hihsiat ding ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hinna bel Pathian in Sheol khua a kipan a tankhe ding a; aman a hon kipahpih ding hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi hihhauh a a hongom a, a inn sung thupina a hong thupi huthut in leng, lau ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A sih hun chiang in bangmah a keng kei ding hi; a thupina in zui khelou ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A damlai in nuamsa mahleh, a damsung in phat loh mahleh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amah suangtute lam ah a pai dia, vak a mu ngeikei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihing, pahtawi a om a, theihsiamna nei tuanlou zaw, gamsa mangthang zelte bang phet ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian, Pathian mahmah, Toupa’n thu a gen a, leitung ni suahna lam a kipan a a tumna lam tan in a samta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kilawm bukim, Zion a kipan in Pathian a vak kheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I Pathian a hong ding a, a dai nilouh kei ding: amah ma ah mei a kuang zuazua ding a, a kim ah huihpi a nung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A mite vai a hawm theihna ding in tunglam vante leh lei a sam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka misiangthoute ka kiang ah pikhawm unla, kithoih a thukhungte ngei, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in, vante’n a diktatna a tangkoupih ding ua, amah Pathian ngei vaihawmpa ahi ngal a. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mite aw, ngaikhia unla, thu ka gen ding hi; Israel aw, ngaikhia in, k’on hilhchian sak ding hi: kei Pathian, na Pathian ngeingei ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na kithoihnate ziak in k’on tai kei ding; na haltum thillatte ka ma ah a om gige ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na inn a kipan bawngtal ka lakhe kei ding a, na ganhuang a kipan keltalte ka lakhe sam kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gam nuai a sa chiteng kei a ahi a, tang sang khat tung a gan omte leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tang a vasa tengteng ka theivek a: gamsate kei a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gilkial mah leng k’on hilh kei ding: leitung leh asung a thil om tengteng kei a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawngtal sa ka ne in kel sisan ka dawn dia hiam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian kiang ah kipahthugen kithoihna lan zaw inla; na thuchiam leng Tungnungpen lak ah tangtun in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan, mangbat ni’n honsam lechin, k’on humbit ding a, huchi in nang n’on pahtawi ding hi, a chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Migilou salou kiang ah bel, Pathian in, Ka thuseh bangchidan a na kam a lou na hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuhilhna na hua a, ka thute na nunglam ah na pai zel ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Guta na muh in phaze na sakpih a, angkawmpate na koppih gige behlap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na kam gilou kiang ah na pia a, Na lei in khemna a bawl gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu kawm in na unau na kalh a; nangmah nu tapa ngei na hek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huai thil na hih a, himahleh ka dai nilouh a; nangmah bang geih in n’on gingta hi: himahleh k’on tai a, na mitmuh in kizom zel in ka hihlang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nou Pathian mangngilhte aw, hiai ngaihtuah dih ua! Huchilou in zaw k’on botnen kha ding hi, noumau hon humbit ding lah a om dek ngal kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kuapeuh kipahthugen kithoihna lan in a hon pahtawi zel hi, huan a omdan kem hoih kiang ah Pathian hotdamna ka ensak ding hi, a chi a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, na chitna dungzui in hon hehpih inla; na lainatna thupi dungzui in ka tatleknate nulmang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thulimlouhnate hon silsiang vilvel inla, ka khelhna hon silsiangsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka tatleknate ka theigige ngal a: ka khelhna ka ma ah a om nilouhlouh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na tung ah, na tung kia ah thil ka hihkhial a, na mitmuh in thil gilou ka na hihta hi: thu na gen a siamtang a na om theih a, vai na hawm a, gensiatbei a na om theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai in, thulimlouhna a suktuah in ka om a; ka nun khelhna in honpai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai in, sunggil ah takna na deih naknak a, a kimu lou lam ah pilna n’on theisak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hussop in hon siangsak inla, huchi in ka siang ding: honsil siang lechin, vuk sang in ka ngou zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nopna leh kipahna bil in hon zasak in; na guh suktante a kipah theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka khelhnate lak ah na mai sel inla, ka thulimlouhna tengteng nulmang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian aw, keimah ah lungtang siangthou tak siam inla; ka sung ah kha diktak siam thak nawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na kiang a kipan in hon paimang kenla; na Kha Siangthou hon laksak ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na hotdamna kipahna hon penawn inla; na Kha khut in honlen gige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in talekte na lampi tungtang ka hilh ding a; huchi in mikhialte nang lam a nga nawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian, hon hondampa Pathian aw, sisan suahte lak ah hon tankhia in; huchi in ka lei in na diktatna thu kipaktak in la in a sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang ka muk hong in; huchi in ka kam in na phatna a theisak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kithoihna tung ah kipahna na nei ngal kei a; huchi hilou hileh ka pe ding a: haltum a thillat tung ah lungkimna himhim na neikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian deihlam kithoihnate zaw kha khasia ahi. Pathian aw, lungtang khasia leh kisik tuntun na musit kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na deihlam tak in Zion tung ah thil hoih hih inla; Jerusalem kulh lem in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in diktatna kithoihnate tung ah kipahna na neita ding a, haltum a thillat leh haltum a pumpiak tung ah: huchi in na maitam tung ah bawngtalte a lanta ding uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi hat aw, bang achia thil hihkhelh suang na hia! Pathian chitna tung a gitlouhna bangdia suang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na lei in niteng in gilou salou a suangtuah nak; mulmet tem hiam tak khemhat bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hoih sang in gilou na deih zaw a; diktatna thugen sang in zuau thugen na deih zaw hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang lei mi khemhat aw, thu mi valh zou theite na deih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in tangtawn a ding in a hon hihzou sam ding a, a honman ding a, na omna a kipan in a hon kaikhe ding a, mihing gam a kipan a hon botkhe ek ding hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi diktatte’n leng a mu un a lau ding ua, a nuihsan ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />En dih uh, hiai mi ahi, Pathian a kulhpi a nei nuamlou a a hauhna thupi muang zaw a, gitlouh satlouhna a ki hihhat, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei zaw, Pathian inn a olive sel liahliah bang ka hi: Pathian chitna tangtawn tangtawn in ka muang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai na hih ziak in, tangtawn in kipahthu k’on hilh ding: na misiangthoute mitmuh ah na min ka ngak ding, a hoih ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihai in a lungtang in, Pathian a omkei, a chi nak hi. A se khin ua, thil thulimlou kihhuaitak a hih uh; kuamah thil hoih hih himhim a omkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Theisiam a Pathian zong himhim a om uhiam chih thei ding in Pathian in van a kipan mihing tate a en suk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lehngat chiat ua; nintak in a na om vekta ua; kuamah thil hoih hih a omkei ua, khat lel leng a omkei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thil hihkhialte’n theih a neikei ua hia! Tanghou nek bang in ka mite a nekhin ua, Pathian lah a ngaihsak kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Launa om louhna ah a lau petpet ua: Pathian in nang hon umpa guhte a dalhsak ziak in: Pathian in amau a muhsit ziak in, amau na zahlak sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israelte hotdamna Zion a kipan in hongpawt leh aw! Pathian in a mite saltangte a pi kiknawn chiang in, huai hun chiang in Jakobte a nuam ding ua, Israelte a kipak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, na min in hon hondam inla, na hatna in vai hon hawmsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian aw, ka thumna ngaikhia inla; ka kam a thu suakkhete bildoh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mikhualte’n hon sual ua, mi ngongtatte’n ka hinna hihmang tum in a zong ua: Pathian a ma uah a koih kei uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai in, Pathian hon panpihpa ahi a: Toupa ka hinna lente lak a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman gitlouhna thuk a melmate tung ah a thuk ding a, nang amau na thutakna ziak in hih mangthang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keimah deih thu a thil lan in na kiang ah ka kithoih ding a; Toupa aw, na min ka phat ding, a hoih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mangbatna tengteng ah n’on tankheta a; hondoute tung a ka deihtel ka mit in a muta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, ka thumna ah bil doh inla; hehpih ka ngetna ah kisel ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Honza inla, hon dawng in: ka mangbat thu ziak in ka mau vialvial a, ka thum nilouhlouh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Melma husa in honhih mangbang; migilou salou nuaisiahna in a honvuk ua, heh in honsawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka sung ah ka lungtang a na mahmah a: sih mulkimnate’n hondelh khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lauthawnna leh linna in honbawm a, launa in a honkhuh khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan, ken, vakhu bang a kha neih ut hina tel ing e, aw! Huchi in ka leng mang ding a, khamuangtak in ka om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai in, gamlapi ah ka vialvak dia, gamdai ah ka om ding hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huih thupi leh huih bukna mun ah ka paikin ding, ka chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa aw, a lei uh hihsia in hihkek in; khopi ah ngongtatna leh kisuknatna ka mu ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sun leh zan in khopi kulh dawn ah a vialvak ua: asung ah thulimlouhna leh haksatna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gitlouh satlouhna asung ah a om a: nuaisiahna leh zekhemna in kholak a pawtsan ngeikei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hon gensia lah melma ahi ngal kei a; hileh zaw, ka thuak theizaw ding: ka tung a kihihlian a honhua ahi sam kei a; hileh zaw, ka buksan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh, nang, ka mi batpih, ka lawm, kithuahpih theih na hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kam khum tak in i kihou khawm zel a, mipi lak a Pathian inn ah i pawt zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sihna a tung uah hongtung henla, kawhawm ah a hing in paisuk uhen: gitlouh satlouhnate a omna uah leh a gilsung uahte a om ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ken zaw Pathian ka sam ding a; Toupa’n hon hondam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nitaklam, zingsang, sun in ka mangbat thu ka gen in ka thum ding a, huchi in aman ka aw a ngaikhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka tung a kidouna lak ah ka hinna khamuangtak in a humbit ta a: honsualte lah a tam ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian, nidanglai a om gige in, a ngaikhe dia, amau a dawng ding. Selah Lamdanna nei ngeilou, Pathian laudan siam ngeilou mite zaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amah toh kituakte tung ah a khut a lik a: a thukhun a hihbuahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kam nawitui khal bang in a nem a, a lungtang bel kidouna ahi ngal a; a thute sathau sang in a nalzaw a, himahleh namsau phawisate ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na puakgik Toupa tung ah nga lechin, aman nang a hon hihhat ding hi. Mi diktat chikmah in leng a hihlin a phal kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh, Pathian aw, nang amaute manthatna kawhawm ah na paisuk sak ding; sisan suahhat leh khemhat mite tuh a damsung kimkhat uleng a dam zou kei ding uhi; ken bel nang k’on muang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, hon hehpih in; mihing in hon valhkhit a tum uhi: nitum in honsual in hon nuaisiah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka melmate’n nitum in honvalh zoh a tum ua: kisatheitak a honsualte lah a tam ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka lau chiang in, nangmah k’on muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian ah a thu ka phat ding a; Pathian ka gingta a, ka lau kei ding; sa in bang a honchih thei dia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nitum in ka thute a la kawi ua: a ngaihtuahna tengteng tuh ka hatlouhna ding lam ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kikhawm ua, a bu ua, ka khapte a chiamteh ua, ka hinna hihmang tum a a ngak ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thulimlouhna in a suahtak san ding uam! Pathian aw, heh in michih hihniam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nang ka vakvaihnate na chiamteh a: ka khituite na savun thawl ah thun in; na laibu ah a tuang chiat kei ua hia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />K’on sap hun ngeingei in hondoute a taizak ding ua: hiai ka thei, Pathian in hon panpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian ah a thu ka phat ding a: Toupa ah a thu ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian ka gingta a, ka lau kei ding; mihing in bang a honchih thei dia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian aw, na kiang ah thuchiam ka nei a: kipahthugen kikhopnate in ka honthuk ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka hinna sihna lak ah na humbit a; ka khete puk lou ding in na humbit kei ahia! mihing vak a Pathian ma a ka vak theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, hon hehpih inla, hon hehpih in; ka hinna nangmah ah a hong puklut ngal a: ahi, na kha nuai ka tuh ding, vangtahnate a then masiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian Tungnungpen ka sam ding: Pathian kei dia bangkim hon hihsakpa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hon valhkhit tumpan a hon gensiat hun chiang in aman van a kipan in a honsawl ding a, a hon hondam ding hi; Selah Pathian in a chitna leh a thutak a honsawl khe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hinna humpinelkai lak ah a om a; mi mei a kang lak ah ka lum a, mihing tate lak ah; huaite ha tei leh thal ahi a, a lei uh namsau hiam tak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian aw, nang van khen pek ah pahtawi in hongom in! Na thupina leitung tengteng tung ah hongom hen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka khe awkna ding in len a phah ua; ka hinna a kun kheikhei a: ka ma ah kawkhuk a tou ua; amau mah a laitak ah a kia uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka lungtang a kip ahi, Pathian aw, ka lungtang a kip ahi: la ka sa ding a, ahi, phatna la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thupina, halh in; pekging leh kaihgingte aw, halh un: kei zingkhang in ka halh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa aw, michih lak ah nang kipahthu k’on hilh ding a: namchih lak ah nangmah phat in la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na chitna vansun in a thupi a, na thutak vandum sun in a thupi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian aw, nang van khen pek ah pahtawi in omta in; na thupina leitung tengteng ah hong omta hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Diktatna thu daidide in maw na gen taktak uh! Mihing tate aw, diktak in maw vai na hawm uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi, na lungtang uah thil thulimlou na hih nak ua; leitung ah na khut ua thil ngongtatna na buk khia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Migilou saloute a nu uh gilsung a kipan in Pathian apan khen in a om ua: a piantak un zuau thugen in a vakmang zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A gu uh gul gu bang ahi a: thangtom bengngong a bil hum bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai in gul aitawi aw a ngaikhe kei a, bangchibang a siam in bum mahle uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian aw, a kam uah hate tansak inla: Toupa aw, humpinelkai hatsanlaite ha lianpipite tong khia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amau tui hattak a luang bang in tuimang uhenla: a thalte a a ngim in, sat tan bang in om zel hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dokdawn, tui a mang maimah zel bang hileh: a hunlou a numei nau neih, ni mel mu lou bang hi hen aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na belte un ling satna a theihma un leng aman pingpei in a lamang ding. A hinglai leh a kuanglai leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi diktat in phulakna a muh in a kipak ding a: migilou salou sisan ah a khe a sil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in mite’n, mi diktat ading in kipahman a omtaktak a: lei ah vaihawmpa Pathian a om taktak hi, a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka Pathian aw, hondoute apan hon humbit inla; honsualte apan kipan mun sang ah honsuan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil hihkhialte apan hon humbit inla, sisan suah hatte apan hon hondam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa aw, ka tatlekna ziak hilou in, ka khelh ziak leng hilou in, ngai in, ka hinna a tang gige hi, mi hatte honsual ding in a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka khelh louh pi in leng honsual ding in a kisa ua: hon panpih ding in kihihhalh inla, en in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa aw, sepaihte Pathian, Israelte Pathian, nangmah ngei namchih gawt ding in thou inla: milepchiah giloutakte peuhmah hawi ken. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nitaklam in a hong nawn ua, ui bang in a ham vengvung ua, khopi a kimvel ah a pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai in a kam un a sa-ik khia ua; a muk uah namsaute a om a: kua a thei a om a! A chi maimah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Himahleh, Toupa aw, nang amau na nuihsan zaw ding a; namchih na nuihsan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hatna aw, k’on ngak nilouh a, Pathian ka insang ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka tung a migi Pathian in a hondon ding a: Pathian in ka melmate tung ah ka thudeih a hon musak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amau that kenla, huchilou in zaw ka mite’n a mangngilh kha ding ua: Toupa aw, ka phaw pen uh, Na thilhihtheihna in hihdalh inla, hihniam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kam khelhna ziak un leh a muk ua thupawt ziak in a kisaktheihna ngei uah awk uhenla a thugen zel uh hamse lohna leh zuauthu ziak in leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaute thangpai in hih mangthang inla, a om nawn louhna ding un hih mangthang inla, Pathian in Jakobte lak ah vai a hawm chih theichiat uhen, kawlmong pha in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan, nitaklam in hong uhenla, ui bang in ham vengvung uhenla, khopi a kimvel ah pai uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amau nekding zong in a vakvak ding ua, a tai kei uleh a om zanhak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh ken na hatna thu la in ka sa ding a; ahi, zingsang in na chitna thu nuamtak in la in ka sa ding hi: nang ka insang, ka mangbatni a ka kihumbitna na hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka hatna aw, nang phat in la ka sa ding a; Pathian ka insang, ka tung a siam Pathian ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, nang n’on khahkhia a, n’on hihsia a; n’ong hehta a; hon tungding nawn in aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hiai gam na hih ling a, na khangsakta hi: a khangkhamte siam hoih nawn inla; a ling a ling ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na mite thil haksa pipi na tuak sak a: hoina uain n’on dawnsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang laudansiamte kiang ah puanzak na peta a, thutak ziak a zak a hihtheihna ding in. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na deihtakte humbit a a om theihna ding un, na khut taklam in hondam inla, hon dawng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian in a siangthouna ah hichibang in a gen, Ka nuam ding a: Sekem khua ka hawm ding a, Sukkoth guam ka hawmzak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gilead gam kei a ahi a, Manasseh gam kei a ahi a; Ephraim gam leng ka lu humbitna ahi a; Judah gam ka lalchiang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moab gam ka kisilna bel ahi; Edom gam ah khedap ka pai ding: Philistia gam, nang zaw keimah ziak in kikou tanla, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khopi kiptak ah kuan a hon pilut dia! Edom gam ah kuan a honpi ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian aw, nangmah mah in n’on deihlouh ka hi kei ua hia? Pathian aw, ka sepaihte kiang uah lah na pawt ngal takei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Melmate sual ding in hon panpih in, mihing panpihna bangmahlou maimai ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian ziak in hangsantak in ka hih ding: amah tuh i melmate sikden dingpa ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, ka kikou husa na za inla; ka thumna ngaikhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lungtang a bah lai in kawlmong a kipan k’on sam ahi: Suangpi kei sang a sangzaw ah honpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang kei ading in humbitna melmate lak ah galven insang kiptak na hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na puanin ah tangtawn in ka om ding a: na kha nuai bukna mun ah ka muang ding hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian aw, nang ka thuchiamte na ngaikhia a: na min laudansiamte gamluah tuh n’on pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa damsung hihsau in: a kumte suan tampi bang ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian ma ah tangtawn in a om gige ding: aw, amah a humbit theihna leh thutak bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in ka thuchiamte niteng a ka hih theihna ding in, tangtawn in na min phat in la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hinna in Pathian kia a ngak a, amah a kipan in ka hotdamna a hongpawt ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah kia ka suangpi leh Hon hondampa ahi. Ka insang ahi a, nakpitak in ka ling kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nou tengteng in, mi khat that ding a, bang awn leh gawl puk dekdek bang in bang tan ahia na sual ding uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thupina a kipan a sawnkhe ding lel in a kihou ua; zuaugen a kipah lamtak uh ahi a: a kam un a vualzawl ua, himahleh a lungsim un hamsia a loh zel ngal uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hinna, Pathian kia ngak in; ka lametna amah kiang a kipan a pawt ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah kia ka suangpi leh ka hotdamna ahi: ka insang ahi a; ka ling kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian kiang ah ka hotdamna leh ka thupina a om a: ka hatna suangpi leh ka kihumbitna Pathian ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nou mipite aw, chiklaipeuh in leng amah muang unla, na lungtang uh a ma ah sungbua un: Pathian ei ading in kihumbitna ahi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi nam niamte bangmahlou lel ahi ua, mi nam liante leng zuau lel ahi uhi: bukna ah a paitou ding ua; maimai sang in a zang zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nuaisiahna muang kei unla; mi hiamgam hat suan in neisam kei unla: hauhnate a hong khan leh a tung ah na lungtang uh nga kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian in khatvei a gen a; hiai nihvei tak ka zata hi; thilhihtheihna Pathian a ahi chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa aw, chitna nang a mah ahi a: michih a thilhih bangbang un na thuk ngal zel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, nang ka Pathian na hi a; phalvak in k’on zong hi: ka hinna nangmah duh in a dangtak a, ka sa in a honngai ahi, gamkeu leh guam tui omlouhna ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in Mun Siangthou ah k’on en gige hi, na thilhihtheihna leh na thupina mu ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na chitna ka hinna sang a a hoihzawk ziak in ka muk in a honphat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in ka damsung teng in k’onphat ding a: na min in ka khutte ka zak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hinna guhngek leh thau a a tai bang in a tai ding a; ka kam in kipahna mukpu in a honphat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka lupna tung a k’on theihgige lai in, zan a na tungtang thu ka lunggel lai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang hon panpihpa na hi a, na kha nuai ah nuam in la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hinna in honzui tettet a, na khut taklam in n’on kai zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hinna hihmang tum a zongte leimun nuainung ah a lut ding ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Namsau thilhihtheihna in a puk ding ua: sehalte tan a hi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa bel Pathian ah a nuam ding a: amah lou a kichiam peuhmah in a suang ding ua, zuauhat kamte hum a om ding a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, ka mangbat thu ah ka aw na za inla: melmate lauhhuaina lak ah ka hinna humbit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil hoihlou hihte kihou gukna lak ah honsel in; thil hihkhialte buaina lak ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amau namsau bang in a lei uh a tat hiam ua, a thu khate ngei uh thalte bang a kap ding in a ngim ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi gensiatbeite mun dai a a kap theihna ding un: lau lou in khatvei thu in a kap guih ngal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thil gilou hih ding in a ki thuhilh ua; thang a guk a kam thu bang ah a kihou zel ua: kuan huaite a mu dia? a chi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thulimlouhna a zongkhia ua; Hahkat tak in i zongta, a chi ua: a sunglam ngaihtuahna leh lungtang uh thuk tak ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian in amau a kap ding a: Thakhat in thal a liam in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchibang in, amau lei ngei in amau a dou ziak in, kisui in a om ding uhi: amau mute’n a lu uh a sing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in, mi tengteng in a lau ding ua: Pathian nasep a gen ding uhi, a thilhih piltak in a ngaihtuah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi diktatte Toupa ah a kipak ding uh; lungtang diktat pu tengteng in a suang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, Zion ah phatna in hon ngak nilouh hi: thuchiam na kiang ah tangtung sak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thumna zapa aw, na kiang ah sa tengteng a hongpai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thulimlouhnate’n honzoh chiang in, ka tatleknate uh nang na silsiang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi, na biakin huangsung intual a om thei ding a na tel a, na kiang na naihsak in nuam a sa hi: na inn hoihna in ka tai ding ua, na biakin Mun Siangthou hoihna in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian hon hondampa aw, diktatna mulkimhuai thilhihte in n’on dawng ding hi; nang kawlmong a mi tengteng leh tuipi tung a gamlapi a omte lametna na hi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thilhihtheihna a tai a kigak a, nangmah hatna a mualte hihkippa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuipi thomging, a kihot gingte leh michih chiak vengvung hihdaipa na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kawlmong tawp a omte’n leng na theihsaknate a lau ua: zingsang leh nitak paikhiaknate nuam in na kikou sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lei na veh a, tui in na khai a, nakpi petmah in na hih hoih hi; Pathian lui tui in a dim a: lei huchibang a na bawl nung in amau ding in buh na bawlsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Leilehte tui tampi in na vak a; a saichian na khengsak hi: vuahtui in na nemsak a. A thilpoute na vualzawl zel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kum na hoihna na khusak a; na paina lam thil hoih in a tak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gamdai a gantatna munte ah a tak a, tangte leng nuamna gak suak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gan tatna munte ganhon in a luahsuak a; phaizangte leng buh in a khuhsuak hi; nuam in a kikou ua, la a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leitung luah tengteng aw, Pathian pahtawi in nuam in kikou unla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A min thupidan la in sa unla: a phatna hihthupi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian kiang ah, Na thilhihte mulkimhuai na e! Na thilhihtheihna thupidan thu ah nangmah melmate na kiang ah a kipe lut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leitung luah tengteng in a hon be ding ua, nangmah phat in la a sa ding uh, chi un, Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kisa un, Pathian thilhihte en un; mihing tate tung a a thilhih ah a kihtakhuai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman tuipi leigaw a suaksak a; luipi khe in a pai kai ua: huai ah amah ah i kipak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thilhihtheihna in tangtawn in vai a hawm hi; a mit in namchih a en hi: helhatte kipahtawi kei uhen. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi chihte aw, i Pathian uh phat unla, amah phatna husa theisak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman i hinna uh a hihhing gige a, I khete kisuan a phal kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian aw, nang n’on enchian a; dangka sik etchet bang in n’on enchian hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang len ah n’on pilut a; ka kawng uah puakgik gik tak n’on koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihingte, kangtalai tung a tuang in, ka lu tung uah na paisak a; mei leh tui ah ka paisuak ua; himahleh mun hausa tak ah lut ding in n’on pi khia ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Halmang a thillatte toh na inn ah ka lut ding a, ka thuchiamte na lak ah ka tangtung sak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka muk in a gen a, mangbang a ka omlai a kam in a gente mah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sathau tak haltum a thillatte na kiang ah ka lan ding a, belampate hal namtui toh; bawngtalte, kelte toh ka lan ding hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kisa un, Pathian laudansiam tengteng aw, ngaikhia un. Huchi in, ka hinna ading a a thilhih k’on theisak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amah ka kam in ka sam a, ka lei a pahtawi in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka lungtang a thulimlou ka limsak leh Toupa’n hon ngaikhe kei ding a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh, Pathian in hon ngaikhia a; ka thumna a limsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian aw, ka thumna vuaksuak saklou a, ka lak a a chitna tawp samlou phat in om hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="67" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian in hon hehpih henla, vual honzawl henla, a mel i tung uah hon vaksak hen. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na lampi leitung a mi theih a hihtheih a, na hotdamna namchih kiang a theih a hihtheihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian aw, michih in honphat hen; mi khempeuhte’n honphat hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw, namchih kipaktak a om in, nuamla sa uhen: Nang michih khentuam neilou a vai hawmsak in, leitung a namchih na uk ngal a. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian aw, michih in honphat uhen; mi chitengte’n honphat uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lei in a thil pou a pia a: Pathian, koumau Pathian ngei in, hon vualzawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian in vual a honzawl ding a; kawlmong a mi tengteng in leng amah a lau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="68" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian thou in, a melmate delhzak hen: amah hawte leng a ma ah taikek uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meikhu mutmang a a om bang in, amau mut mang in: khuainun mei lum a a zul bang in migilou saloute Pathian ma ah mangthang uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi diktatte bel kipaktak in om uhenla; Pathian ma ah nuam uhenla; ahi, kipaktak in nuam uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian pahtawi in lasa unla, a min phat in lasa un: kangtalai a gamdaite paisuakna din lamlian ding sungvum unla: a min Toupa ahi; a ma ah nuam un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian a omna siangthou a om, pa beite Pa leh meithaite ngaihtuahpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian in mi tangkhatte inkuan ah a pangsak a: mi hentate a pikhia a, vangphatna ah a pi lut hi: helhatte zaw gamkeu ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian aw, na mite makai a na hongpawt a, gamdai a na paisuak lai in. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lei a ling dupdup a, vante leng Pathian ma ah a takkhia a: Sinai tang hilhial leng Pathian ma ah, Israelte Pathian ma ah, a ling dupdup hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian aw, nang vuah tampi na zu sak a, na gouluah ding, a bah in, na hihkip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na heute’n huai ah panmun a khoh ua: Pathian aw, nang na hoihna in gentheite ading inn na bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n thu a pia a, tanchin genmi numeite pawl lianpi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sepaihte kumpipate a taikek ua: inn ngaknu’n gallak sum a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vakhu kha dangkaeng a luan a, a kha mong leng dangkaeng tesel sel a luan bang in, belam huang kal bang ah om mahle uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangkim hihthei in huai a kumpipate a hihzak lai, Zalmon tang a vukzuk lai bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian tang Bashan tang ahi a; Bashan tang tuh tang sangpi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tang sangtakte aw, Pathian in a omna ding a a tang deih, bangdia haza a en. Ahi, Toupa huai ah tangtawn in a om nilouh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian kangtalai a sing a sing, a sang a sang tampi ahi: Toupa tuh, Sinai tang a om bang in, huai lak ah Mun Siangthou ah a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang tunglam ah na paitou a, matte sal in na pi a: mihingte apan thilpiakte na mu a, ahi, helhatte apan leng: Toupa Pathian a kiang ua a om theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa ka puak uh niteng a hon puak sakpa, hon hondampa Pathian phat in om hen. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian ei ading in kihumbitna Pathian ahi; sihna a kipan hotkhiaknate Toupa Jehovah a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian in amah melmate lu a sat phel ding a, gitlouhna a paizelte lu sam pha tak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa’n , Bashan gam a kipan in ka pi nawn ding a tuipi nuai thuktak a pan ka pi nawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na khe sisan a na diah theih a, na ui leite’n na doute lak a tan a neih theihna ding in a chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian aw, na pailaite a mu ua, i Pathian i kumpipa Mun Siangthou a a pailai
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nungak khuang bengte lak ah, lasa pawlte a pai masa ua, tumging tumpawl in a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kikhopnate ah Pathian phat un, Israel tuinak a pawtte aw, Toupa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huai ah nautum Benjamin a vaihawmpa un a om chiuchiau, Judah miliante leh a upate uh, Zebulun miliante, Naphtali miliante toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na Pathian in na thilhihtheihna a pia a: Pathian aw, kou ding a thil n’on hihsak hihhat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jerusalem a na biakin ziak in Kumpipate’n kipahmante a honpuak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Dangkate sikden in sialluang lak a gamsahangte taihilh in; Bawngtal tampi, michih bawngnoute toh kidou ut mi khempeuh a hihzakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aigupta gam a kipan in miliante a hongpawt ding ua; Ethiopiate a khut uh Pathian lam a zak ding in a kintat ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Leitung gamte aw, Pathian pahtawi in lasa unla; aw, Toupa phat in lasa un. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vante van nidanglai a omte tung a tuangpa mah. Ngai in, a aw a suah a, A aw thupitak mahmah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pathian kiang ah hatna pia un: a thupina Israelte tung ah a om a, a hatna van dumte ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pathian aw, na Mun Siangthou a kipan in na kihtakhuai ahi. Amah Israelte Pathian ngei in A mite kiang ah hatna leh thilhihtheihna a pia hi. Pathian phat in om hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="69" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, hon hondam in; tuite lah ka hinna pha in a lutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Buannawi thukpi, siksan himhim om louhna ah, ka tum hulhul hi: Tui thukpi tui lian hon tupnate ah, ka na lutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kikouna lam in ka bah a; ka dang a keu khinta; ka Pathian ka ngakna ah ka mit a vai khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangmahlou a hon hawte ka samzang sang in a tam ua: dikloupi a hondou a hon hihmanthat tumte mihat tak ahi uhi: ka lak hetlouh ka penawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian aw, nang ka haidan na thei hi; ka siamlouhnate nang ah sel ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa aw, sepaihte Pathian, nangmah ngakte keimah ziak in zahlak kei uhen: Israelte Pathian aw, nangmah zongte keimah ziak in hihzum in omkei uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmah ziak a gensiat ka thuak ziak in, zumnan ka mai a khuh khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka unaute lak ah mikhual ka na hita a, ka nu naute lak ah theih ngeilouh mi ka na hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na inn a ka phatuamngaihna in hon negai a; nangmah gensete gensiatnate ka tung ah kibung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka kah a, anngawl kawm a ka hinna ka sawi leh, huai gensiat a ka omna phet ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka puansilh a saiip ka zat leh, amau dia hoihlou lam a gentehna ka na hi zel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kulh kong a tute’n ka tungtangthu a gen ua; zukhamhatte lasak ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh, Toupa aw, ken zaw, hun kipahhuai ah ahi, ka thum; Pathian aw, na chitna thupi ziak in na hotdamna thupitak in hon dawng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Buannawi a kipan hon humbit inla, hontum sak mahmah ken; honhawte lak ah leh tui thukpi a kipan humbit in hon omsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tui lian in hon tummang kei henla, tui thuk pi in leng honvalh kei hen, kawkhuk in leng a kam chihkhum kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa aw, hon dawng in; na chitna a hoih ngal a; na lainatna thupidan bangzel in kei lam hong nga in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na sikha lak ah na mai sel ken; ka mangbang ngal a; hon dawng meng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka hinna honnaih in, tan inla; hondoute ziak in hon humbit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang mi hon gensiatnate, ka zahlaknate, ka zumnate na thei hi: hondoute na ma ah a omvek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi hon gensiatna in ka khasia a; nakpitak in ka lungkham behlap hi: huchi in hon hehpih ding ka zong a, himahleh kuamah a om kei ua; hon khamuan ding ka zong nawn a, kuamah ka mu sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka an ding in banghiam kha a honpiak behlap ngal ua; ka dangtak in uain thuk dawn ding in honpia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ma ua a dohkan uh thang hi henla; khamuangtak a a omlai un pial suak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A mitte uh, a muh theihlouhna ding un, hihmial in om hen; a kongte uh kivuang sak gige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na lungkimlouh mahmahna a tung uah sungbua inla, na heh thangpaihna in amau man hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A omna uh gam henla; a puanin uah kuamah omkei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na satpa a sawi ua, na sukliamte lungkhamna leng a gen ngal nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A thulimlouhna uah thulimlouhna behlap inla; amau na diktatna ah lut kei uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A min uh hinna bu apan nulmang in om uhen, midiktat lak ah gelh hi kei uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Himahleh kei genthei tak leh lungkham tak ka hi a: Pathian aw, na hotdamna in mun sang ah honkoih in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pathian min la in ka phat ding a, kipahthu gen in amah ka pahtawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchibang in bawngtal hiam, ki leh chinnei bawngpa hiam, sang in Toupa a kipaksak zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thunuailutte’n huai mu in a kipak uhi: nou Pathian zongte aw, na lungtang uh hing in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Toupa’n tagahte ngaikhia in, a hentate tuh a musit ngal kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lei leh van in amah phat hen, tuipite leh a sung ua thil tang thei peuhmahte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pathian in Zion honkhia in, Judah khuate a siam dek ngal a: huchi in huai ah a om ding ua, neih toh a thuah ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A sikhate suante’n gou a luah ding ua; a min itte a sung ah a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="70" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, hon humbit ding in kin inla; Toupa aw, hon panpih ding in kin meng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hinna hihmang tum a zongte zahlak in zum uhen, ka siatna zong a kipakte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ku! Ku! Chite a zahlak ziak un taikek sak in om uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A honzong tengteng nangmah ah nuamtak leh kipaktak in om uhenla; na hotdamna itte’n, Pathian pahtawi in om hen, chi gige uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Himahleh kei zaw genthei leh tagah tak ka hi a; Pathian aw, ka kiang ah hongpai meng in: nang hon panpihpa leh hon humbitpa na hi a; Toupa aw, sawt hal mahmah ken.
  </para>
  <chapter number="71" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, nangmah ah ka ginna ka koih zel hi; chikmah chiang in zahlak in hon omsak ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na diktatna vang in hon humbit in, hon honkhia inla: kei lam ah na bil hondoh in, hon hondam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei ading in omna suangpi, ka hohtheih gige na, honghi in: nang hon hondam ding in thu na pia a; ka suangpi leh ka kulhpi na hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka Pathian aw, migilou salou khut a kipan hon honkhia in, mi diktatlou leh nunsia khut a kipan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa Pathian aw, nang ka lamet na hi: ka naupan chik a kipan k’on muan na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka nu gil a kipan in nangmah na honlen zel a: ka nu sung a kipan hon lakhepa na hi: ahi nangmah ka honphat gige ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mitampi theih in thillamdang ka hi a; himahleh ka kihumbitna kiptak na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka kam nang phatna in a dim ding a, nitum in nang pahtawina in a dim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka tek chiang in hon nial kenla, ka bah chiang in hon paisan ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka melmate’n ka tungthu a gen ua; ka hinna tangte leng a kikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian in a paisanta: delh unla, man un; humbitpa ding himhim a om ngal kei a chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian aw, hon gamlat mahmah ken: ka Pathian aw, hon panpih ding in kin in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka hinna tung a melmate zahlak leh mangthang in om uhenla; ka siatna zongte gensiatna leh zumna a khuh in om uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh ken zaw ka lamen gige ding a, k’on phat semsem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka kam in na diktatna thu a gen ding a, nitum in na hotdamna thu a gen ding a: a tamdan ka thei ngal kei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa Pathian thilhih thupiakte toh ka hongpai ding a: a diktatna, nangmah diktatna thu kia ka gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian aw, ka naupan chik a kipan nang n’on hilh a; tu tan in na thillamdang hihte ka theisak gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi, Pathian aw, ka tek a ka sam a kan hun in hon paisan mahmah ken; na hatna hiai khangte kiang leh, na thilhihtheihna khang hong omlai dingte kiang a ka theihsak mateng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian aw, na diktatna leng a sang mahmah ahi; Pathian aw, nang thil thupitakte hihpa, nangmah bang kua a om?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang, buaina tampi leh thupitak hon musakpa’n n’on hingsak nawn dia, lei thukpi a kipan n’on pikhe nawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang ka thupina honhih pungsak inla, hong kihei nawn inla, hon khamuan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pekging in k’on phat ding a, ka Pathian aw, na thutak ka phat ding hi, Nang Israelte Mi Siangthou aw, kaihging toh nang phat in la ka sa ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangmah phat a la ka sak chiang in ka muk a nuam mahmah ding a; na tatsa ka hinna mah leng nuam a sa mahmah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka lei in leng nitum in na diktatna thu a gen ding; ka siatna ding zongte a zahlak un a zumta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="72" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, na vaihawmnate kumpipa kiang ah pia inla, na diktatna kumpipa tapa kiang ah pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na mite dikna in vai a hawmsak ding a, na mi gentheite vaihawmna dik in vai a hawmsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tanglian leh tangneute’n diktatna in mite kiang ah khamuanna a hontun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman mi lak a gentheite vai a hawmsak ding a, tagah tate a hondam ding a, nuaisiahtu bel a hihzan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tung a ni leh kha om sungteng, suan omsung teng in leng a kikou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah loupa gawitan tung a vuah kia bang in a ke ding a; lei vak vuah tui bang mai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A damlai un mi diktat a hampha ding uh, khapi om nawnlouh dong in khamuanna thupi toh a khang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman tuipi apan a tuipi dang pha in, luipi apan kawlmong pha in thu a nei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gamdai a omte a ma ah a kun ding ua: a melmate’n leng leivui a liak ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tarsish gam leh tuikulh gam Kumpipate’n kipahman a hontawi ding ua; Sheba leh Sheba gam Kumpipate’n thilpiakte a honlan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi, kumpipa tengteng a ma ah a khupboh ding ua: namchih teng in a na a sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Genthei in a sap chiang in aman a humbit ding a, mi tagah, panpihpa neilou leng a humbit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi genthei leh tagahte a hehpih ding a, tagahte hinna a hondam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hinna uh nuaisiahna leh hiamgamna lak a kipan a tan ding a, a sisan uh amah ngaihdan in manpha tak a hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan, a hing ding ua; Sheba gam dangkaeng a kipan a piak ahi ding a: mite’n amah a thumsak gige ding uhi; nitum in a vualzawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lei ah, mualvum peuh ah, buh tampi a om ding a; a vui Lebanon bang in a ling suausuau ding a, khua a mite bel loupa bang in a pha lihliah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A min tangtawn in a om den ding a; a min ni a om sung in tatlak lou in a om zel ding a; mite amah ah vualzawl in a om ding ua; nam chihte’n amah hampha a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa Pathian, Israelte Pathian phat in om hen, amah kia in thillamdang a hih zel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A min thupitak tangtawn in phat in leng om henla; lei pumpi leng a thupina a hihdim in om hen. Amen, Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesse tapa David thumnate a beita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="73" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian Israelte tung ah a hoih ngei e, lungtang siangthoute tung ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Himahleh ken zaw ka siktal dekdek a; ka kalsuante a teu dekdek ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Migilou saloute vangphat dan ka muh in mi kiuangsakte ka eng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A sih lai un thuakgimna a neikei ua: a hatna uh a kip zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Midang bang a gimthuak in a omkei uhi. Midang bang a gawt in leng a omsam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in kisaktheihna in khainiang bang in a ngawng uh a vial a; hiamgamna in puan bang in a tuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thau ziak in a mit uh a pawng leuluau a: lungtang thudeih sang a thupi a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nuihsan ua, gilou tak in nuaisiahna thu a gen ua: kisaktheihna in a pau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kam uh vanlam ah a koih ua, a lei un leitung a pha suak zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in a mite huai ah a kiknawn ua, Tui nou a dim a dawn siang sipsip uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian in bangchi’n a thei dia? Tungnungpen in theihna a nei dia hia? a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />En dih, hiai migilou saloute ahi uh; nuamsa a om in a hau deuhdeuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thawn in ka lungtang ka hihsiang a, ka khutte gensiatbei in ka sil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nitum in gawt in ka om a, zingsang teng in sawi in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchibang in ka gen ding, na chita leng; ngai dih, muanhuailou tak a hih ka hi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai ka theihna ding dan ka ngaihtuah in, Kei din a na lua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian Mun Siangthou a ka lut a, a beina ding uh ka ngaihtuah masiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amau mun naltak ah na koih a; siatnate ah na paikhe zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangchidan ahia mitphiat kal kia a inn-gam tak uh aw! Thil mulkimhuai takte a hih manthat vek in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Min khanloh nung a mang bangmah a sak louh bang un, Toupa aw, na halh hun in amau lim leng bangmah na sa kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka lungsim lungkham a a om a, ka lungtang sut a ka omlai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi mawl leh bangmah theilou ka hi a, na lak ah gamsa bang phet ka hi hial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh na kiang ah ka om gige a: ka khut taklam na len gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nang na lemtheihna in n’on pi ding a, huai nung chiang in thupina ah n’on kipahpih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Van ah nang lou kua ka nei a? Lei ah leng nang lou ngal ka deih kuamah a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka sa leh ka lungtang a bahta a: himahleh Pathian tangtawn a ka lungtang utna ding leh ka tantuan ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngai in, nangmah gamlat a omte a mangthang dek ua: a hon angkawm san peuhmahte na hihmangta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kei ading in bel Pathian naih a hoih a: Toupa Pathian ka kihumbitna in ka nei a, nna nasep tengteng thu ka hilh theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="74" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, bangding a hon paimang den ding na hia oi? Bangding a na gantatna mun a belamte tung a na hehna a khut?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na mite kikhawmte, nidanglai a na lei, na gou ding a na tat namte theigige in; na omna Zion tang toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tangtawn siatna lam ah na khe khai in, melmate’n Mun Siangthou ah thil gilou chiteng a hihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmah doute na mite kikhawmte lak ah a awng zuazua ua; a chiamnate uh chiamtehna ding in a takta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi singbawk heipi a ngimte bang in a kimu ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tun ah a thilkhuak kilawm teng uh heita leh sek in a hihse chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na Mun Siangthou a hal ua; na min omna lei a tum khop hial in a hihbuahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A lungsim un, avek in i hihse ding, a chi ua, hiai gam a Pathian kikhopna in tengteng a halse khinta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I kichiamtehnate uh i muta kei ua: Zawlnei a omta kei ua a sawt ding dan thei himhim i lak uah leng a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian aw, melma in bang tan ahia hon gensiat ding? Gal in na min tangtawn in a gense dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangding in ahia, na khut, na khut taklam na lak tak? Pholh khe nawn inla, amaute hihmang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh, Pathian nidanglai tan a ka Kumpipa, lei lai tak a hotdamna siampa pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang na hatna in tuipi na kikhensak a, nang tui a dragonte na kitamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang Ole lute na zansak a, amah gamdai mi omte kiang ah an ding in na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang tuikhuk leh tuilian na khen a; nang lui lian taktakte na kangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sun nang a ahi a, zan leng nang a ahi. Nang khovak leh nisa na ngaihtuah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang leitung gamgite na khung vek hi: nang nipi leh phalbi na siam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa aw, hiai theigige in, melma in a hon gensiat a; nam haipi in na min a gensiat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw na vakhu hinna gam sahang kiang ah pe mahmah kenla; na mi gentheite hinna tangtawn in mangngilh sam ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thukhun hon poimawhngaih in: leimun mial tata hiamgamna omna in a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw, nuaisiahna thuakte zahlak in kihei kei uhenla: genthei leh tagahte’n na min phat uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian aw, thou inla, nangmah thu kigen tawm inla, mihai in nitum in a hon gensiat dan theigige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangmah galte husa mangngilh ken: a hon sualte chiak vengvung a paitou gige ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="75" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, kipahthu k’on hilh uhi; kipahthu k’on hilh uhi, na min a nai ziak in: min na thillamdang hih thute a gengen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hun seh pen ka muh hun chiang in diktak in vai ka hawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lei leh asung a om tengteng a zul khinta: ken a bante ka phut ahi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi uangte kiang ah, Uangtakin omkei un, ka chi a: migilou saloute kiang ah, Na ki uh sangsak kei un, leng ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na ki uh tunglam ah hihsang kei unla; ngawng golh zen in thu gen kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sansakna suahlam a kipan ahi kei a, tumlam a kipan leng ahi kei lai a, simlam a kipan ahi sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian vaihawmpa ahizaw: Aman khat niamsak in khat a sangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa khut ah nou a om a, a uain a phul a; thildang toh hel in a dim a, huai apat a bungkhia a; pellou in a neng nangawn lei a migilou salou tengteng in a dawn siang sipsip ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh ken zaw tangtawn in ka theisak ding a, Jakob Pathian phat in la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Migilou saloute ki tengteng ka hihtan ding a; mi diktatte ki zaw sansak in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="76" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judahte lak ah Pathian theih in a om a; Israelte lak ah a min a thupi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Salem ah bawkta a om a. Amah omna Zion ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huai ah thalpeu thalte a hihsia a: phawte, namsaute, kidouna vanzatte toh. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang thupitak leh hoihtak na hi a, sathah tangte sang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lungtang phate’n loh a tuak ua, a ihmu uh a ihmu denta uhi; mi hatte leng kuamah in a khut uh a lik theita kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jakob Pathian aw, na sawina ziak in kangtalai leh sakol leng gen ding theilou in a om tuaktuak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang, nangmah mah, lau ding na hi: na heh peuhmah leh, kua ahia na mitmuh a ding thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na vaihawm thu van a kipan in na theisak a; lei a lau a, a daita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lei a mi thunuailut tengteng hondam ding leh vaihawm ding a Pathian a thoh lai in. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pellou in mihing hehna in nang a honphat ding a: hehna val in na kigak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu chiam inla, Toupa na Pathian lak uah hih tangtung un: a kim a mi tengteng in kihtak dingpa kipahmante hon tawisak uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman lalte kha a satkhe ding a; amah lei a kumpipate ading in a kihtakhuai ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="77" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka aw in Pathian ka sam a; ka aw in Pathian ngei tuh ka sam ding a, aman kei lam ah bil a hondoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka buai ni’n Toupa ka zong a: ka khut zan chiang in leng khaikhe lou in ka zak gige a; ka hinna in khamuan a om a nial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian ka theigige a, ka buai naknak: ka ngaihtuah a, ka kha a bah naknak. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mitte mitmeisuan in n’on let sak a: pau theilou khop in ka buai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nidanglaite ka ngaihtuah a, tanglai hun leh kumte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zan a ka lasak ka thei nawn a: ka lungtang ah ka kingaihtuah a, ka kha in phatuamngaitak in a zong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n tangtawn in a khahkhe dia eita aw? Chikmah chiang in a kipakta kei dia eita aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A chitna a mang tawntung dia eita aw? A thuchiam suan tengteng pha in a mang dia eita aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in hehpih a mangngilh a eita aw? Heh in lainatnate a khakta a eita aw? Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai ka hatlouhna ziak ahi; himahleh Tungnungpen khut taklam kumte ka theigige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa thilhih thute ka gen ding a: nidanglai a na thillamdang hihte ka theigige ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nna nasep tengteng ka ngaihtuah ding a, na thilhihte leng ka sut ding hi, ka chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian aw, na lampi Mun Siangthou ah a om a: Pathian bang Pathian thupi kua a om a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang thillamdang hihpa Pathian na hi a: michih lakte ah na hatdan na theisak zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na ban in na mite na honkhia, Jakob leh Joseph tate. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuite’n a honmu ua, Pathian aw, tuite’n nang a honmu ua, a kikou ua; tui thukpite leng a ling uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Meipite’n tui a sungbua ua; vante’n aw a suah ua: na thalte leng a phe zolzol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na van ging husa pingpei ah a om a; khophiate’n khovel a tanvak zolzol a: lei kising in a ling dopdop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na lampi tuipi ah a om a, na lampite tui zatak ah a om a, na khapte theih ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mosi leh Aron khut in na mite belamhon bang in na pipi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="78" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka mite aw, ka danthu ah bil na doh unla: ka kam a thute ah na bil uh hondoh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gentehna thu in ka kam ka ding a: nidanglai a thugil gente ka gen khe ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huaite i bil un i za ua, i lungsim in leng i thei uhi, a pipute’n leng a honhilh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huaite a tate uh lak ah i im kei ding ua, khang hongom ding kiang ah Toupa phatna thu leh, a hatdan leh a thillamdang pipi hih dante i hilhzaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakobte lak a thu theihsak a hihkip a, Israelte lak ah dan a sep a, huaite i pipute kiang ah thupiak in a pia a, amau huai thu a tate uh kiang ah a theihsak ding un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khang hongom ding naupang hongpiang dingte’n, a theihna ding un, huaite a thou ua, a thou ua, a tate u kiang a, a hilhsawn zel ding un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lametna uh Pathian a a koih ua, Pathian thilhihte a mangngilh louhna ding leh a thupiakte a zonna ding un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A pipute bang ua, suan genhak leh helhat suan lungtang bawl diklou, Pathian lak a lungsim ginom lou pu a a om louhna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ephraim suante galthuam a kithuam a, thalpeu tawi in, kisual ni’n a taikek ua:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian thukhun a zuikei ua, a dan a om leng a ut kei ua:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thilhihte a mangngilh ua, a thillamdang a muhsakte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A pipute uh mitmuh ah thillamdang pipite a hih zel a. Aigupta gam ah Zoan pawn ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuipi a khen hok a, amau a galkaisak a: tuite thil koih khawm venvon bang in a khawlsak meuhmouh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sun chiang in mei in a pi a, zankhua in mei vak in leng a pipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gamdai ah suangpite a kitam sak a, tui thukpi a kipan bang mai in dawn ding tampi a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Suangpi a kipan in luite a pawtsak a, tuite luipi bang in a luang khesak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi pipi in leng a tung ah thil a hihkhial lailai ua, gamkeu ah Tungnungpen tung ah a hel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A gongthak uh hihdamna ding a a nekding uh ngen in a lungtang un Pathian a ze-et uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi, Pathian kalh in thu a gen ua; Gamdai ah Pathian in dohkan a bawlkhol thei diam maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai in, suangpi a sat a, tuite a hong kikhoh khia a, luite a piau ah a dimlet a; an leng a pe thei lai diam maw? A mite din sa a bawlkhol diam maw? a chi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi in Toupa’n a naza a, a hehta hi. Jakobte tung ah mei a hong kuangkheta a, Israelte tung ah hehna hongsuakta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian a gingta kei ua, a hotdamna leng a muan louh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh tunglam van dumte thu a pia a, van kongkhakte a honsak a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A nek ding un manna a tung uah a zusak a, van buh a kiang uah a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihingte’n angel an a ne ua: vahna khop in an a honpia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Suahlam huih van ah a nungsak a: a thilhihtheihna in sim huih a nung sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sa leivui zah a tung uah a zusak a, vasa kha nei tuipi a piaunel zah tak:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A giahna mun tak uah a kesak a, a omna buk kim uah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchi in a ne ua, a vah ngial ua; a lunggulh ua a kiang uah a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A gongthakna uh a dai naikei a, a an uh a kam uah a omlai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian hehna a tung uah a tung a, a mi hoihte uh a that a, Israel tangval telte a satpuk helhul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huchipi in leng thil a hihkhial lailai ua, thillamdang hihte a gingta tuankei uh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Huaiziak in a damsung nite uh bangmahlou phet in a hihmang sak a, a damsung kumte uh launa in a hihmansak lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amaute a thah chiang in amah a zong ua: a kiknawn ua, phalvak in Pathian a zong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pathian a suangpi uh ahi chih leh Pathian Tungnungpen a tanpa uh ahi chih a theikhe zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Himahleh a kam un a maitang phat ua, a lei un a kiang ah zuauthu a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A lungtang uh amah lam ah a dik kei a, thukhun ah lah a ginom sam kei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Himahleh, amah bel lainatna a dim a hih ziak in a thulimlouhna uh a ngaidam a, amau a hihmang kei hi. Ahi, tamveipi a hehna a la kik a, a thangpaihnate a tokthou nuam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Sa leltak a hih uh a theigige a: huih, kik nawnlou ding a nungzel bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Gamdai ah a tung ah hel mun in, gamkeu ah amah hih lungkham mun hina tel u e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A kihei kiknawn un Pathian a ze-et ua, Israelte Mi Siangthou a hihvui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A khut a theigige kei ua, melma lak a a humbit ni a theigige sam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huchi a Aigupta gam ah a chiamtehnate a koih a, Zoan pawn ah a thillamdang hihte leng a koih a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A luipi uh sisan a suaksak a, a luite uh leng sisan a suaksak hi, huchi in a dawn theita kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A lak uah thou tampi a sawl a, huai in amau a ne khin a; ukengte leng a sawl a, huai in amau a hihmangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />A thil poute u leng lung kiang ah a pia a, a sepgim gah uh khaupe kiang ah a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />A grepguite uh gial in a hihsia a, a theipi kungte u leng vuk in a hihsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A gantate uh gialpi kiang ah a pia a, a ganhonte uh kek sa kiang ah a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A hehna thupitak a tung uah a khia a, thangpaihnate, lunghihlouhna mahmahte, mangbatnate, gilou angel honte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />A hehna ading in lam a bawlsak a; a hinna uh sihna lak ah a humbit kei a, a hinna uh hi kiang ah a pezawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Aigupta gam a ta masa tengteng a that a, Ham puanin ah a hatna gah masapente.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Himahleh a mite belam bang in a pikhia a, ganhon bang in gamdai ah a pi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Bittak in a pi a, huchi in bangmah a lau kei ua: himahleh tuipi in a melmate uh a khuh khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />A Mun Siangthou gamgi a pitung a, hiai tang, a khut taklam a a lei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Namchih a ma uah a delhkhia a, amau khuate gouluah ding in a hawm a, a puaninte uah Israel namte a omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Himahleh, Pathian Tungnungpen a ze-et ua, a tung ah a hel ua, a thu theihsakte a zui kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Kihei nawn in, a pipute uh bang in lepchiahtak in a gamta zawta uhi: thalpeu muanhuailou bang in a paikawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />A mun sangte un amah a hihheh ngal a, a milim siamte un a mullit sak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Pathian in huai a na zak in a heh a, Israelte a kih mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Huchi in Shiloh biakbuk mihing lak a a puanin koih, a paisan a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />A hatna sal ah a mansak a, a thupina melma khut ah a mansak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />A mite namsau kiang ah a pia a; a gouluah ding tung ah a hehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Mei in a tangvalte uh a kangmang a, a nungakte un kitenna a neita kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />A siampute uh namsau a hihpuk in a om ua; a meithaite uh a kap kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Huchihlai in, Toupa mi ihmu a khanglou bang in a khanglouta a, mi hat uain ziak a kikou bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Amah melmate a satkik a, tangtawn min siatna a lohsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Huailou leng Joseph puanin a deihkei a, Ephraim nam leng a telta kei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Judah nam a tel zawta a, a it Zion tang mah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />A inn siangthou van sangte bang in a lam a, tangtawn ding a a hihkip leilung bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />A sikha David a tel a, belam huang a kipante a lakhia a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Belampu nou kaite zuihna a kipan in a pikhia a, a mite Jakobte leh a gouluah ding Israelte vak ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Huchi in aman a lungtang uh hoihna bangzel in amaute a vak a; khut siam in a pita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="79" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, namchih na gouluah ding ah a lut ua; na biakin siangthou a hihnin uhi; Jerusalem suangchim a vum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na sikhate luang tungleng vasate an ding in a pia ua, na misiangthoute sa gamsate kiang ah a pia ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sisan uh Jerusalem kim ah tui bang in a sungbua ua; amau vui ding lah kuamah a om ngal kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I kim ua mite gensiat in i na om ua, i kiangnai a mite muhsit leh nuihsat in i na omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa aw, bang tan ahia na heh nilouh ding? Na mullitna mei bang in a kuang ding ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangmah theilou namchih tung ah na hehna sungbua in, na min sam lou gam tung ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jakobte a ne khin ua; a omna uh a hihgamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka pipute uh thulimlouhnate ka lak uah theigige ken: na lainatna in hon don pah hen. Nakpitak a hihniam in ka omta ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hon hondampa Pathian aw, na min thupina ding in hon panpih inla; na min ziak in hon humbit in, ka khelhnate uh sil siang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bang achia namchih in, A Pathian uh koi a om ahia leh? Na sikhate sisan pawt phulakna ka mitmuh un namchih lak ah theih hi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Henta thumna na ma ah tung hen: na thilhihtheihna thupidan bangzel in si ding a sehte humbit inla:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang a hon gensiatna uh, ka kiangnai uate tung ah a leh sagih in thuk in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huchi in, kou na mite, na gantatna mun a belamte’n, tangtawn in kipahthu k’on hilh ding uhi: suan tengteng tan in nangmah phatna ka theisak zel ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="80" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israelte chingpa, Belamhon bang a Joseph pipa, bil na doh in: nang cherubte tung a tu, hong vakkhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ephraim leh Benjamin, Manasseh mitmuh in na hatna tokthou inla, hon hondam ding in hongpai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian aw, hon kiheisak nawn inla; na mel hihvak in, huchi in hotdam in ka om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa aw, sepaihte Pathian, bang tan ahia na mite thumna tung a na heh ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaute khitui tanghou in na vak a, khitui dawn ding in tehna liantak in na pe zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang ka kim ua mite ading in kinakna din n’on bawl nak a: ka melmate uh a nui chiat nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sepaihte Pathian aw, hon kiheisak nawn inla: na mel hihvak in, huchi in hotdam in ka om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta gam a kipan grepgui na honla a: namchih na delh khia a, na suanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ma na hih siang zel a, thutak in zung a kai a, gam a luahvek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tangte a limtuam in a om chiat, a hiangte Pathian sidar singte bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hiangte tuipi tan in a zamsuak sak a a selte Luipi pha in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bang achia a huangte hihsia na hia? Lampi a pai peuhmah in a sat kheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gamnuai a ngal in a hihsia a, gamsate’n leng a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sepaihte Pathian aw, hehpih in kihei nawn in; van a kipan in hon ensuk inla, hiai grepgui en inla, hongveh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kung na khut taklam in a suan leh, a hiang nang dia na khauhsak toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mei ah a kangta, phuk in a omta: na mel a salhna ziak in a mangthang zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na taklam a mi tung ah na khut om hen, mihing tapa nang dia na hihhat tung ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in k’on kiksan kei ding ua: hon hihhalh inla, na min ka lou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa aw, sepaihte Pathian, hon kiheisak nawn inla; na mel hihvak in, huchi in hotdam in ka om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="81" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian hon hihhatpa pahtawi in nuamtak in lasa unla; Jakobte Pathian pahtawi in nuam tak in kikou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Phatna lasa unla, khuangta, kaihging ngaihnophuai, pekging toh hontawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kha thak in pengkul mut unla, kha lik a i Ankuangluina thupi ni’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israelte ding a thuseh ahi ngal a, Jakobte Pathian dan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai Joseph lak a thu theihsakna ding a a seh ahi. Aigupta gam tung a a paikhiak lai in: ka theihlouh pau ka zak lai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A liangzang thilgik apan in ka lasuan a: a khutte loh a kipan a khah in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangbatni’n n’on sam a, k’on humbit a; van ging bukna mun ah k’on dawng hi; Meribah tuite ah k’on ze-et ahi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka mite aw, ngaikhia unla, ka hon theihsak bang in; Israelte aw, ka thu ngaikhe nuamle uteh aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gamdang pathian himhim na lak uah a om ding ahi kei; midang Pathian himhim na biak ding uh leng ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei, Toupa na Pathian uh ka hi a, Aigupta gam a kipan honpi khepa tak: na kam uh liankat un, ka hihdim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Himahleh ka mite’n ka aw a ngaikhe kei ua; Israelte’n hon deihkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in a lungtang uh genhak dan bangzel a om ding in ka khahzanta ahi, amau hoihsak bang a a omna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw, ka mite’n ka thu ngaikhia in, Israelte ka lampite ah pai le u aw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A melmate uh ka hihneu zok in, amau galte tung ah ka khut ka lik ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa hawte a kiang ah a kipelut ding uhi; amau hun bel a om nilouh louh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nou bel buh hoihpen in k’on vak ding hi; suangpi a khuaizu in k’on taisak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="82" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian tuh Pathian kikhopna bawl ah ading a; Pathiante lak ah vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bang tan ahia diklou tak a vai na hawm ua, migilou saloute, na deihsak tuam ding uh? Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gentheite leh paneiloute hawmsak unla; haksa thuakte, tagahte tung ah hihdik un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gentheite leh tagahte gum unla; migilou salou khut a kipan humbit un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A theikei ua, theihsiamna leng a neikei uh; mial ah a kileh a kileh ua: leilung kingakna tengteng a lingta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathiante na hi ua, na vek un Tungnungpen tate na hi uh, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh mihingte bang phet in na hongsi ding ua, mi lian khat bang in na hongpuk ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian aw, thou inla, lei vai hawmsak in: namchih na gouluah ding ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="83" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, paulou in om kenla: Pathian aw, dai nilouh ken, om maimai mahmah ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai in, na melmate a lum lutlut ua: nangmah hawte a dak hawkhawk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na mite lepchiahtak in a sawm ua, na mi selgukte tung ah a selam in a kihou a kihou khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kisa dih ua, a nam uh mangsak khop in i hihmang ding uh: Israel min himhim theihgige a a om nawn louhna ding in, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thukhatsat in a kihou ua; na tung ah a selam a hih ding in thu a chiam khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Edom leh Ishmael puaninte, Moab leh Haggar;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gebal leh Ammon leh Amalek; Philistiate Tura khua a omte toh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Assuriate amau lam ah a pang ua; Lot suante a panpih uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amau Midiante tung a na hih bang, Kison lui a Sisera tung a na hih bang, Jabin tung a na hih bang in hih sam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai mite Endor khua ah a mang ua; lei ading in eklei banglel a na hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A miliante uh Oreb leh Zeeb bang in bawl inla, Ahi, a kumpipa tengteng uh Zebah leh Zalmunna bang in bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huai mite’n, Pathian omnate i luahsak ding uh, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka Pathian aw, amaute leivui kipei lunglung bang in bawl in: buhsi huih mutleng bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gam kang mei bang leh, tang kang meikuang bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amau na huihpi in delh inla, na huih thupitak in hihlau in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa aw, na min a zon theihna ding un a mel uh zumna in hihdim in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tangtawn in zahlak leh mangbang tak in om uhenla; ahi, hihzum a om in mangthang uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangmah kia Jehovah minpu, leitung tengteng tung a Tungnungpen na hi chih a theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="84" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa aw, na omnate deihhuai natel e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hinna in Toupa biakin huangsung intualte a ngai mahmah a, ahi, a bahpih hial a; ka lungtang leh ka sa Pathian hing kiang ah a kikou khia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi, kawlgit in inn a mu a, lensiam in leng amah ading in bu a mu, a nou koihna ding in sepaihte Toupa aw, ka Kumpipa leh ka Pathian, huai nangmah maitamte ngei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na inn a omte’n nuam a sa ua; nang a honphat gige ding uhi, Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah a hatna nei min nuam a sa hi; a lungtang a Zion naihna lamliante om in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kahna guam a tot un, tuikhuk omnate a bawl ua, ahi, vuahtui ke masa in vualzawlna in a khuh lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatna a kipan in hat nawn semna ah a pai ua, Zion ah Pathian ma ah a kimusak chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa aw, Sepaihte Pathian, ka thumna hon ngaikhia inla: Jakobte Pathian aw, bil na doh in. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian ka phaw pen u aw, en in, na thaunilhpa mel en in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na biakin huangsung intual a ni khat om tuh mun dang a ni sang khat sang in a hoihzaw hi. Gitlouhna puaninte a om sang in i Pathian inn kongkhak ngaktu hih leng ka utzaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa Pathian i ni leh phaw ahi: Toupa’n hehpihna leh thupina a pe ding a: diktak a omte lak ah thil hoih a it kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sepaihte Toupa aw, nangmah muang min nuam a sa hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="85" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa , na gam tung ah na kipak a: Jakob, sal a om na pikik nawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na mite thulimlouhnate na ngaidam a, a gitlouhna tengteng uh na khuh khinta hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na thangpaihna tengteng na lamang a: na hehna thupitak na kiheisanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hon hondampa Pathian aw, hon kiheisak nawn inla, ka tung ua na hehna tawpsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka tung uah na heh nilouhlouh dia hia? Na hehna suan tengteng tan in na kitheisak zel dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangmah a na mite a kipah theihna ding un n’on hihhalh nawn kei dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa aw, na chitna hon musak inla, na hotdamna leng honpia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa Pathian thugen ding ka ngaikhe ding: a mite leh a misiangthoute kiang ah khamuanna thu a gen dek a: himahleh amau haina lam ah kihei nawnta kei uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hotdamna amah kihtate naih in a om ngeingei nak hi; I gam ua thupina a om theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chitna leh thutak a kituak a; diktatna leh kituahna a kitawp a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thutak lei a kipan in a dawnkhia a; diktatna in van apan a hon tansukta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi, Toupa’n thil hoih a pe ding a; I gam in leng a thilpou a pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Diktatna in a ma a kai ding a; a khapte lampi ah a siam ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="86" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, keilam ah na bil hondoh inla, hon dawng in; genthei leh tagah lua ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hinna vom hoih inla; Pathian limsak mi ka hi ngal a: ka Pathian aw, nangmah muang na sikha, hondam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa aw, hon hehpih inla; nitum in ka honsam ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na sikha hinna hihnuam in; Toupa aw, ka lungsim na kiang ah ka koih det ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa , nang, na hoih a, ngaihdam na ngap a, a honsam peuhmah tung ah chitna na hau ngal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa aw, ka thumna ah na bil na doh in; hehpih k’on ngetna aw ngaikhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mangbat ni’n k’on sam ding a, huchi in n’on dawng ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa aw, pathiante lak ah nang bang himhim a omkei ua; na thilhih bang thilhih a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa aw, na siam nam chihte a hongpai ding ua, na ma ah a kun ding ua, na min a hon pahtawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang na thupi ngal a, thillamdangte leng na hihzel a; nangmah kia Pathian na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa aw, na lampi hon ensak inla, na thutak ah ka om ding a, Na min lau ding in lungtang khat hon pusak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa ka Pathian aw, ka lungtang tengteng in k’on phat ding a; na min tangtawn in ka pahtawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka tung a na chitna a thupi ziak in, ka hinna kawkhuk nuainungpen a kipan na humbitta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian aw, mi kisatheite’n honsual ua, mi ngongtat omkhawmte’n ka hinna hihmang tum in a zong ua, nang a ma uah a honkoih kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh, Toupa aw, nang Pathian, lainatna a dim, mi hehpihthei, lungnel, chitna leh thutak hau, na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keilam hong nga inla, aw, hon hehpih in, na sikha kiang ah na hatna pia inla, na sikhanu tapa hondam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hoihna ding chiamtehna honlak in; hon hawte’n huai a muh ua, a zahlakna ding un, Toupa , nang n’on panpih a, n’on khamuan ziak in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="87" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A suangphum tang siangthou ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n Zion kulh kongkhakte Jakob omna tengteng sang in a it zaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian khopi aw, na tungthu thupitak in a gen uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hontheite lak ah a pang sam uh chih Rahab leh Babulon tungtang thu ka gen ding: Philistia leh Tura, Ethiopia toh, en un; hiai mi huailai a piang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi, hiai mi leh huai mi amah a piang ahi ua: Tungnungpen ngei in amah a hihkip ding, chih, Zion tungtang thu a gen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n , mite min a gelh chiang in, hiai mi huai a piang ahi, chi’n, a sim ding uh, Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lasate’n, a lamte toh, Ka tuikhuk teng nangmah ah ahi a om, a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="88" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, hon humbitpa Pathian, sun leh zan in na ma ah ka kikou gige a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thumna na ma ah lut henla; ka kikou husa ah na bil hondoh in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka hinna mangbatnate in a dim a, ka hinna in Sheol a naihta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kawkhuk a paite toh simkhawm ka hi; hatna himhim neilou mi bang ka hi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gal thahte han a lumte bang a misi lak a paihkhiak ka hi; huaite na theih tak louh, na khut a kipan hihman ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kawkhuk nuainungpen ah n’on lumsak a, mun mial, thupi ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na hehna in hon delhkhum a, nang na tui kihot tengteng in gim n’on thuaksakta hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka meltheihte hon gamlat in na omsak a; amau adia kihhuai pi in n’on bawlta a: khakkhum in ka om a, ka pawt theikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gimthuak ziak in ka mit a seta a: Toupa aw, ni teng in k’on sam ahi, nang lam ah ka khutte ka zak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Misite ading in thillamdang na hih dek ahia? Sisate’n thou in a honphat ding ua hia? Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na chitdan han a theihsak in, na ginomdan Abaddon mun a theihsak in a om dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na thillamdang hihte mial ah theih in a om dia hia? Na diktatna gam ah theih in a om dek nawn ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa aw, ken zaw k’on sam a, ka thumna in zingsang in a hondon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa , bang achia ka hinna khah khia na hia? Bang achia ka lak a na mai sel?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka naupan chil a kipan gimthuak leh si dekdek in ka om a; na thil mulkimhuaite ka huak in hih lungbuai in ka om hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na heh mahmahna in hon vukmang a; thil mulkimhuaite’n hon hihmangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaite’n nitum in tui bang in hon umsuak ua; ka kim ka vel in hon um chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Honitpa leh ka lawm hon gamlat in a omsakta a, ka mel theihnate mial ah na omsakta ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="89" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa chitna thute tangtawn in la in ka sa ding a: ka kam in na ginomdan suan tengteng tan in ka theisak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chitna tangtawn a ding in leptouh in a om ding a; na ginomna vante ah ngei na hihkip ding, ka chita ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka mitel kiang ah thu ka khung a, ka sikha David kiang ah ka kichiamta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na suante tangtawn a ding in ka hihkip ding a, na mangtutphah leng suan tengteng tan in ka lemding, chi in. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa aw, vante’n na thillamdang hih a phat ding uh; misiangthoute kikhopna ah na ginomna leng a phat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tung vandumte ah Toupa toh kiteh thei ding kua a om a? Mi hattak tate lak ah Toupa bang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Misiangthoute om khawmna ah Pathian kihtakhuai tak, a kim a mi tengteng sang a kihtakpen ding kua ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa sepaihte Pathian aw, nang bang a mi hat kua a om a? Na ginomna na kim ah a om ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang tuipi kisaktheihna vai na hawm a: a tuikihawt kisep laite uh na hihdai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang Rahab gal thah bang in na hihkham dimdem a; nangmah galte na ban thahat in na keksakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vante nangmah a ahi a, lei leng nangmah a ahi: khovel leh asung a omteng nangmah muhkhiak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sim leh mal nangmah siam ahi a: Tabor leh Hermon na min ziak in a nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang ban thilhihtheitak na nei a: na khut a hat a, na khut taklam pahtawi in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Diktatna leh vaihawmna dik na mangtutphah kingakna ahi a: chitna leh thutak na ma ah a pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Husa kipahhuai za namte’n nuam a sa ua: Toupa aw, amau na mel vak ah a vak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na min ziak in nitum in a nuam ua, diktatna ziak in pahtawi in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang a hatna uh thupina na hi ngal a: na deihsakna ziak in ka ki uh pahtawi in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka phaw uh Toupa a ahi ngal a: ka kumpipa uh Israelte Mi Siangthou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huailai in na misiangthoute kiang ah kilakna in thu na gen a, mi hattak khat tung ah panpihna ka nga a; mi khat mite lak a tel khiak ka pahtawita hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka sikha David ka mukheta a; ka thau siangthou in amah ka nilhta a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka khut a kiang ah hihkip in a om ding a; ka ban in amah a hihhat ding a, a hihhat taktak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Melma in a lak ah a phut kei ding; thulimlouhna tapa in a hihgim kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amah galte a ma ah ka satpuk ding a, amah hawte ka bawl ek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amah kiang ah bel ka ginomna leh ka chitna a om ding hi; ka min ziak in a ki pahtawi in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A khut tuipi ah ka ngasak ding a, a khut taklam luipite ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aman, Nang ka Pa, ka Pathian, ka hotdamna suangpi na hi, chi in, a honsam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huan, ken amah tapa masa in ka siam ding a, lei a kumpipate lak ah tungnungpen in ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka chitna tangtawn in amah ading in ka kep hoih sak ding a, ka thukhun a kiang ah a om kip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A suante tangtawn in ka omsak ding a, a mangtutphah van omlai siah in ka omsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A tate’n ka dan a lehngatsan ua, ka vaihawmnate bang a a omlouh ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka thuseh a tatlekna a neih ua, ka thupiakte a kep hoih kei uleh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A tatlek chiang in ka gawt dia, a thulimlouhnate uh zep in k’ong kan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Himahleh, ka chitna tuin a kiang a kipan ka laksak vek kei ding a, ka ginomna zuau a suak din leng ka phal sam kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka thukhun ka suse kei ding a, ka muk a thupawt leng ka hihlamdang sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khatvei ka siangthouna lou in ka kichiam a, David kiang ah zuau ka gen kei ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A suante tangtawn in a om ding ua, a mangtutphah ka ma ah ni bang in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kha bang in tangtawn a ding in hihkip in a om ding a, van dum a theihpih ginom bang in, a chi a. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Himahleh nang na khahkhia in na deihkei a, na thau nilhpa tung ah na hehta ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na sikha thukhun na kih a: a lallukhu lei a paikhe hial in na hihniamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A huang tengteng na hihpuk a; a kulh pite na hihseta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Lampi a pai peuhmah in a thil a laksak zel uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amah doute khut taklam na pahtawi a; a melma tengteng na hih nuamsata hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ahi, a namsau ma na bengpek a, amah kisualna ah na ding kipsak kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A vakna na hihtawp sak a, a mangtutphah lei ah na paikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A tangvallai nite uh na hihtom a; amah zahlakna in na khuhta hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Toupa aw, bang tan ahia na buk nilouh ding? Bang tan ahia na hehna mei bang a a kuan ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Aw, ka hun a tom dan theigige inla; mihing tate siam gina kei natel chia!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Kua mi ahia sih ni mel mulou a hing a, Sheol khut a kipan a a hinna humbit ding? Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Toupa , nidanglai a na hehpihna, na ginomna David kiang a kichiam a na chiam, koi a om ahita a?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Toupa , na sikhate a gensiatna uh theigige in; nam hattakte tengteng gensiatna ka angsung a ka thuak zeldan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang hondoute gensiatna, na thaunilhpa khapte gensiatna mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Toupa tangtawn in phat in om hen. Amen, Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="90" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa , suan tengteng tan a ka tenna uh nang na hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tangte pian ma a, leitung leh khovel na bawlkhiak ma in leng; tangtawn a kipan tangtawn Pathian nang na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang mihingte manthatna ah na kiksak a; Mihingtate aw, kik un, na chi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang seh in kum sang khat zan mangta bang phet ahi a, zan ven khat sung bang phet ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaute tui lian bang in na taimang a; khang khat ihmu bang phet ahi uh: zingsang a loupa dawn khia bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zingsang in a hongpou in a hong dawnkhia a; nitaklam in phuk in a om a, a vuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na hehna a hihman in ka om ua, na thangpaihna a hihmangbat a leng ka om ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thulimlouhnate uh na ma ah na koih a, ka khelhna gukte uh na mel vak ah na koihta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka damsung ni tengteng uh na hehna ah a mang zel a: ka damsung kumte uh tangthu bang in ka tawpsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka damsung kumte uh kum sawmsagih ahi a, hatna ziak in kum sawmgiat leng ahi thei hi; himahleh a sawtna sepgimna leh lungngaihna lel ahi a; a mang paha, kou leng ka leng mang zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kuan ahia na hehna thilhihtheihdan thei a, nang kihtak ding dan a na hehna theilou?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka damsung nite uh simdan honhilh in, pilna lungtang ka neih loh hial na ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa aw, hongkik nawn in; bang tan ahia na heh ding? Na sikhate tungthu ah na lungsim kiheisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw, zingsang in na chitna in hon taisak in; ka damsung tengteng ua ka nuam ua ka kipah theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang n’on hihgim ni leh, thil hoihlou ka tuah kum sung hute bang un hon kipaksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nna nasep na sikhate kiang ah kithei henla, na thupina a tate kiang uah kithei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa ka Pathian uh kilawmna ka tung uah om hen: ka khut nasep uh ka tung uah leng hihkip in; ahi, ka khut nasep uh hihkip in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="91" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tungnungpen bukna mun a ommi Bangkim hihthei lim ah a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa tungthu ah, Amah ka kihumbitna leh ka kulhpi; ka Pathian, ka muan ahi, ka chi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman thangkammi thang leh Hi hoihlou lak ah nang a hon hondam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kha in a honkhuh ding a, A kha nuai ah na muang ding hi; A thutak pho neu leh pho lian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zan a thil mulkimhuai na lau kei ding a, Sun a thal leng zong na lau kei ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mialnuai a hi leng na lau kei ding a, Sun a thil hihsia siatna na lau kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na sik ah sang a puk ding ua, na taklam ah sing a puk ding uh; himahleh Nang honnaih kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na mit in na en ding a, migilou saloute siatna a muh in na mu lel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang ka kihumbitna na hi a! Tungnungpen na omna a hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thil hoihlou in a hon tuak kei ding a, hi himhim in leng na puan in a honnaih sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na lampi teng a hon humbit ding in, na tungthu ah zaw a angelte thu pe ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A khut un hondom ding ua, huchilou in zaw na khe in suang na sui khakha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Humpinelkai leh gul gial na sikden ding a; Humpinelkai hatlai leh dragon na sikden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka tung a a itna a ngak ziak in amah ka humbit ding a: ka min a theih ziak in mun sang ah ka khatou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman honsam ding a, ka dawng ding hi; mangbat lai in a kiang ah ka om ding hi: amah ka humbit in ka pahtawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Damsawtna in ka lungkim sak ding a, ka hotdamna leng ka musak ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="92" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa kiang a kipahthu gen leh, Tungnungpen aw, na min phat a lasak thil hoih ahi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zingsang a na chitna hihlat leh, zan teng a na ginomna hihlat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thil tumtheih gui sawm neite, pekgingte, kaihging tum khasiathuaite toh, a hoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa , nang nna nasep in n’on kipaksak a: na khut thilhihte ziak in nuam in la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa aw, na thilhihte thupi hina tel e! Na ngaihtuahnate a thuk na lawmlawm e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi mawl in hiai a theikei hi; mihai in a theisiam sam kei hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Migilou saloute loupa bang a a hongnou ua, thil hihkhialte tengteng a hongphat letlot un, tangtawn a ding a hihman a hongom ding uh ahi, chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang zaw tangtawn ading a sangpi a om gige na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa aw, ngai dih, nang hondoute, ngai dih, nang hondoute a mangthang dek uhi; thil hihkhial tengteng hihzak in a omvek ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh gam bawngtal ki bang in ka ki na pahtawi a: thau thak ka nilhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mit in leng ka galte tung a ka thudeih a mu dia, ka bil in kei hondou gilou saloute tung a ka thudeih a za ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi diktat tumsing bang in a khanpha ding a: Lebanon tang a sidar sing bang in a khang huthut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa inn a suan a omte i Pathian biakin huangsung intual ah a khanpha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Upat nung in leng a gah lailai ding ua; tui pai kiihkeih in a hing dipdip ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa diktat ahi chih theihsakna ding in: amah ka suangpi ahi a, amah ah diktatlouhna himhim a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="93" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa kumpipa in a tu a, A thupina in a kithuam a; Toupa A hatna a kithuam in a tai ah a kigakta hi: khovel leng a lin theihlouhna ding in, hihkip in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na mangtutphah nidanglai a na hihkipsa ahi a: nang tangtawn a omsa na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa aw, luipite’n a aw uh a suah ua, luipite’n a ging thupitak a suah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tui tampi awte sang in, tuipi kihot hattakte sang in leng, tunglam a Toupa a hatzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thu theihsakte a muanhuai mahmah a: Toupa aw, tangtawn in Na inn Siangthouna toh a kilawm hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="94" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang phulakna thunei Pathian, nang phulakna thunei, Pathian, vakkhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang lei a vaihawmpa, kisa inla: kisatheite a gitlouhman uh thuk in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa , migilou saloute bang tan ahia, bang tan ahia a vualzoh ding uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau a mawk pau ua, kisathei tak in thu a gen ua: thil hihkhialte tengteng a kiphat tawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa aw, na mite a keknen sak ua, na gouluah a hihgim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Meithai leh mikhual a that ua, pa neilou a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n a mu kei ding, Jakob Pathian in a ngaihtuah sam kei ding, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi lak a mi mawlte aw, ngaihtuah un: mihaite aw, chikchiang in na pil ding ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bil phutpa’n a za kei dia hia? Mitsiampa’n a mu kei dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Namchih thuzohpa’n na taihilh kei dia hia, mihing pilna hilhpan?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n mihing ngaihtuahnate bangmahlou phet ahi chih a thei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa aw, mi na thuzoh a, na danthu apan sinmite a hampha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Migilou adia kawkhuk toh a a om masiah, mangbat nite na khawlsan theihsakna din.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n a mite a paikhe dek kei a, a goutan a paisan sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaihawmna diktatna ah a kiknawn dia: lungtang diktak pu tengteng in huai a zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kua ahia thil hoihlou hihte hon dousak ding a kisa ding? Thil hihkhialte hon dousak ding in kua ading dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa hon panpihpa hi kei leh, ka hinna mundai ah a om pah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka khe a teu a, ka chih in, aw Toupa , na chitna in a honkai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka lungsim a ngaihtuah tampi ka neih lai in, na khamuannate’n ka hinna a hihnuam zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gitlouh satlouhna mangtutphah, dan a thilhihkhelhna omsak in, nang hon kithuahpih dia hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi diktat hinna sual tum in a pungkhawm ua, sisan gensiatbei siamlouh a tangsak nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa ka insang ahi a: ka Pathian ka kihumbitna suangpi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A khelhna uh a tung uah a kesak a, a hoihlouhna ah a hih mangthang ding a; Toupa i Pathian in a hihmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="95" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw hongpai un, Toupa pahtawi in nuamsatak in la i sa ding uh: I hotdamna suangpi pahtawi in nuamsatak in i kikou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kipahthu gen in a ma ah pai ni e, phatna lasa a amah pahtawi in nuamsatak in aw i suah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa Pathian a thupi mahmah ziak in, Pathian tengteng tung ah Kumpipa thupitak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah khut ah lei mun thuktakte a om a: mualdawn sangtakte amah a mah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipi amah a ahi a, amah bawl ahi a; gam leng a khut suak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw hongpai unla, bia in kun ni e: Toupa Honsiampa ma ah i khukdin ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah i Pathian ahi a, eite a gantatna mun a mite leh, a khut a belamte i hi ngal ua. Tuni in a aw na zak uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Meribah a a hih bang un na lungtang uh khauhsak kei un, Gamdai a Massah ni bang in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huailai in na pipute un a honkhem ua, hon ze-et ua, ka thilhih a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum sawmli sung huai suante tung ah ka lunghikei hi. A lungtang ua ngaihkhelh hatmi ahi ua, ka lampite leng a theikei uhi, ka chi a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in, Ka khawlna ah a lut kei ding uh, chi in, heh in ka kichiam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="96" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Toupa phat in la thak sa unla: leitung luah tengteng aw, Toupa phat in lasa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa phat a lasa in, a min phat unla; ni teng in a hotdamna thu theisak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Namchih kiang ah a thupina gen unla, michih peuhmahte kiang ah a thillamdang hihte gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa a thupi a, nakpitak a phat ding ahi ngal a: Pathian tengteng sang a kihtak ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mipite pathiante milim ahi ua: Toupa’n bel vante a bawl ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pahtawina leh thupina a ma ah a om ua: hatna leh kilawmna a Mun Siangthou ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi chih a chichihte aw, Toupa kiang ah pia unla, Toupa kiang ah thupina leh hatna pia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa kiang ah a min thupina pia unla: thillat ding tawi in a biakin huangsung intual ah hongpai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw, siangthou kilawmna silh in Toupa bia unla: leitung luahte teng aw, a ma ah ling un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Namchih lak ah, Toupa kumpipa in a tu, chi un: Khovel mah leng a lin theihlouhna ding in, hihkip in a om hi: aman khentuam neilou in michih vai a hawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vante kipaktak in om henla, lei leng nuamtak in om hen; tuipi leh asung a thil om tengteng lum honhon uhen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lou leh asung a om tengteng kipaktak in om henla; huai hun in gam a sing teng in nuam in la a sa ding uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa ma ah, amah a hongpai dek hi; lei vaihawm ding in a hong dek ngal a: Khovel diktak in vai a hawmsak ding a, michih thutak in vai a hawmsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="97" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa kumpipa in a tu a; lei nuamtak in om hen; tuikulh gam tampite kipaktak in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meite leh mial sah bikbek a kim ah a om a; diktatna vaihawmna dik a mangtutphah kingakna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ma lam ah mei a pai a, a kim a amah galte a kangmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A khophiate’n khovel a salvak a: lei in a mu a, a ling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tangte khuainun bang in Toupa ma ah a zulkhin a, khovel tengteng Toupa ma ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vante’n a diktatna a tangkoupih zel ua, mi khempeuh in a thupidan a muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Milim bawltawm nasemte zahlak in om uhen, milim suangte mah: nou pathian tengteng aw, amah bia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zion tang in a za a, kipaktak in a om a, Judah tanute leng nuamsatak in a om uh; Toupa aw, na vaihawmte ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa , nang leitung tengteng tung pek ah pahtawi in na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa itte aw, gilou lehngatsan un: Aman misiangthoute hinna a vomhoih a; amau migilou salou khut a kipan a humbit nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi diktat ading in khua a vak a, lungtang diktakpu ading in kipahna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi diktatte aw, Toupa ah kipaktak in om unla; A min siangthou phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="98" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Toupa pahtawi in la thak sa un; thillamdang takte a hihta ngal a: a khut taklam leh a ban siangthou in amah a ding in hotdamna a hihsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n a hotdamna a theisak a: a diktatna namchih mitmuh in chiantak in a langsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel inkuanpihte tung a a chitna leh a ginom dan a theigige a: kawlmong a mi tengteng in, I Pathian hotdamna a muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leitung luah tengteng aw, Toupa pahtawi in nuamsatak in kikou unla: kikou khia unla nuamsa in lasa un, ahi, phatna lasa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kaihging toh Toupa phat in lasa un: kaihging leh phatna la husa toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pengkulte leh pengkul binei ging toh kumpipa, Toupa ma ah, nuamsatak in kikou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuipi leh asung a thil om tengteng lum honhon hen; khovel leh asung a tengteng toh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Luipite’n a khut uh beng uhenla; tangte’n nuam in lasa khawm uhen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa ma ah; lei vaihawm ding in, A hongpai dek ngal a khovel diktattakin vai a hawmsak ding a, khentuam neilou in michih vai a hawmsak ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="99" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa kumpipa in a tu a; michih ling uhen: Amah cherubte tung ah a tu a; lei ling hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa Zion khaw sung ah thupitak ahi a; michihte tung ah tungnung tham ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amau na min thupi lauhuaitak phat uhen: amah a siangthou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa hatna in vaihawmna a it a; nang khentuam neihlouhna na hihkip hi, nang Jakobte lak ah vai na hawm a, diktak in na hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa i Pathian uh pahtawi unla, a khe ngakna bul ah bia un: amah a siangthou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A siampute lak ah Mosi leh Aron, a min loute lak ah Samuel; amau Toupa a sam ua, aman a dawngta ahi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mei ding ah a kiang uah thu a gen a: a thu theihsakte leh thusehte a zui zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Toupa ka Pathian uh, nang amaute na dawng a: nang amau ngaidampa Pathian na hi, a thilhih tung uahte phu lazel mahle chin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa i Pathian pahtawi unla, a tang siangthou ah bia un; Toupa i Pathian a siangthou hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="100" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gam tengteng aw, Toupa pahtawi in nuamsatak in kikou un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kipak kawm in Toupa nna sem unla: lasa kawm in a ma ah hongpai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa tuh Pathian ahi chih thei un: hon bawlpa amah ahi a, amah a i hi ua; A mite leh a gantatna mun a belamte i hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kipahthu gen kawm in a kongkhak ah lut unla, phat kawm in a biakin huangsung intual ah lut un: a kiang ah kipahthu gen unla, a min phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa a hoih ngal a: A chitna tangtawn in a om ding hi: A muanhuaidan suan tengteng tan in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="101" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chitna leh vaihawmna dik thu la in ka sa ding a: Toupa aw, nangmah phat in la ka sa ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lam hoih kim ah piltak in ka om ding a: Aw chikchiang in ahia ka kiang a na hongpai ding? Ka inn sung ah lungtang hoihkim pu in ka om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thilhoihloute ka mitmuh ah ka koih kei ding: lam pialte thilhih ka hua ahi; keimah ah a bang kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungtang genhak in hon paisan ding a: thil gilou himhim ka theikei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kuapeuh a vengte a guk a gen, huai mi ka hihmang ding a: mi sang leh lungtang kisathei pu mi ka thuak theikei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiai gam a mi muanhuaite tung ah ka mit a tu ding a, ka kiang a a om theihna ding un: lam hoihkim tawn mi’n ka na a sem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khemhat ka inn sung ah a omkei ding a: Zuauhat mi ka mitmuh ah hihkip in a omkei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zingsang teng in hiai gam a migilou salou tengteng ka hihmang ding a: Toupa khopi a kipan thil hihkhial tengteng ka hihmang ding in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="102" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, ka thumna ngaikhia inla, ka kikou husa na kiang hongtung hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka mangbat ni’n ka lak ah na mai sel kenla: kei lam ah na bil hondoh in; k’on sap chiang in hon dawng pah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka damsung nite meikhu bang in a zam mang a, ka guhte taptung bang in a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lungtang loupa bang in hailum in a om a, a vuaita hi; tanghou nekding ka mangngilhta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka thum husa ziak in ka guhte ka sa ah a belh bikbek ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gamdai tuivapi bang ka hi a: khaw tul simbu bang ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hak gige a, kawlgit in tung a amah kia a om bang ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hondoute’n nitum in hon gensia ua: ka tung a hangsante’n keimah bang a om ding in hamsia a lou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vut an bang in ka ne a, ka dawn ding in khitui toh ka helta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lunghihlouh mahmah leh na heh ziak in: nang n’on domkang a, n’on paimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka damsung nite limliap kiam bang ahi a; loupa bang in ka vuaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang bel tangtawn in na om ding a; nangmah theihgigena suan tengteng tan in a omlai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na thou ding a, Zion tang na hehpih ding a: amah lah hehpih a hunta ngal a, ahi, hun seh a tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na sikhate’n a suangte a it un, a leivui leng a hehpih ngal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in namchih in Toupa min a lau ding ua, lei a kumpipate tengteng in na thupina leng a lau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa’n Zion a dinsak hun in, a thupina in a hong kilang ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tagahte thumna a limsak a, a thumna uh a musit kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai khangthak hongom dingte ading in gelh ahi ding a: nam siam a hongom ding in Toupa a phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman a Mun Siangthou sangpi a kipan in a en suk a; Toupa’n van a kipan in lei a mu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Suangkulhtang thum ngaikhe ding leh, si ding a sehte sut ding in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huchi a mite’n Zion ah Toupa min a genthang ua, Jerusalem a a phatna a genthang theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mite a kikhawm khawm ua, kumpigamte toh, Toupa nasem ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aman lam lak ah ka tha a bahsak a; ka damsung a hihtom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka Pathian aw, ka hatlai nite in honla mang ken, ka chi a: Nang kum suan omsung tengteng in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Leitung kingakna nidang a na phumsa ahi a; vante leng na khutsuak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huaite tuh a hong mang ding a, nang zaw na om den ding hi: ahi, huai tengteng puansilh bang in a honglui ding ua; puan bang in na khek ding a, a hong lamdangta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nang zaw na ngeingei a, na kumte’n bei ni a neikei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na sikhate tate a om gige ding ua, a suante uh na ma ah hihkip in a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="103" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hinna aw, Toupa phat inla; ka sung a om tengteng aw, A min siangthou phat in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hinna aw, Toupa phat inla, a thilhih hoih tengteng mangngilh ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman na thulimlouhna tengteng a ngaidam a; na natna tengteng a hihdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Manthatna lak a kipan na hinna a tan a; chitna leh lainatnate a hon khusak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na kam thil hoih in a taisak a; huchi in na valnouna muvanlai bang a siam thak in a om nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n , nuaisiahna thuak tengteng ading in thil kizente hihsak in, vai a hawmsak nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lampite Mosi a theisak a, a thilhihte Israel suante leng a theisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa lainatna a dim, mi hehpihthei tak, lungnel tak, chitna hau tak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman a taikei ding a; a hehna a pai nilouhlouh sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I khelhnate bang in i tung uah a hih kei a, i thulimlouhnate bang in a honthuk sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Van leitung sang tak a a om bang in, amah laute tung ah a chitna a lian mahmah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Suahlam leh tumlam a kigamlat bang in, I tatleknate tuh eimah a kipan in a koih mangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pa’n a tate a hehpih bang in, Toupa’n amah laute a hehpih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I pumpi kibawldan a thei a, leivui lel ihi chih a theih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihing damsung nite loupa bang ahi a; pawn a pak bang in a lun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huih in a mut a, a mang hi; a omna mun in a thei nawnta kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa chitna bel amah kihtate tung ah tangtawn apan tangtawn pha in a om ding a, a diktatna leng a ta suan a tu suan tan un a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thukhun zui peuhmahte leh, a thuhilhte man tum a theigige peuhmahte tung ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa’n a mangtutphah van ah a hihkip a; a gam in bangkim tung ah vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A thu ngaikhia a, a thumang nou a angelte aw, hatna a thupite aw, Toupa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A sepaihte aw, a deihlam hih a nasemte aw, Toupa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A vaihawmna mun peuhmah a a thilhih tengteng aw, Toupa phat un: ka hinna aw, Toupa phat in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="104" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hinna aw, Toupa phat in, Toupa ka Pathian aw, nang na thupi mahmah a; pahtawina leh thupina in na kithuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang vak puan bang in na silh a; vante puanin tung bang in na kaipalh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman a dantan sunggil kalvaite tuite ah a khung a; meipi kangtalai in a bawl a; huih kha tung ah a vak hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman angelte huih a suaksak a; a nasemte meikuang zuazua a suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leitung kingaknate na phum a, tangtawn a a lin louhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang leilung thukpi puan bang in na silhsak a; tuite tang tung te ah a om pheuphou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na taihilhna ziak in a taimang a; na vanpiging husa ziak in a paimang pah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tang tung ah a paitou a, guamte ah a paisuk a, amah dia mun na bawlsakna lam ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kan louh ding in gi na khung a, lei tupmang ding a a kiknawn tak louhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman guamte ah luinak a sawl khia a; tangkalte kikal ah a luang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaite’n gamsate kiang ah dawn ding tui a pia ua; Gam sabiltungte’n a dangtak uh a hihdai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A dung uah tungleng vasate’n omna a nei ua, singbawk lak ah a ham uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman a dantan tungnung a kipan in tangte tui in a vak a: lei na thilhih gahte in a vak a: lei na thilhih gahte in a tai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gante a ding in loupa a pousak a, mihing zatdin haichi a pousak hi: lei a kipan nekding a pawtna ding in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihing lungtang kipahsakna uain toh, a mai kilawmsakna ding thau toh, mihing lungtang hihhatna tanghou toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa singte tui in a dim ua, Lebanon tang a a suan sidar singte mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />huai ah vasate’n bu a sep ua: vaiva bel meilah singte a inn ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tang sangte sathak ading ahi a; suangpite zusapi ading in kihumbitna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman kha hunbi theihna ding in a sep a: ni in tum hun theigige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang mial na bawl a, zan a hong hizel hi, huai hun in gamnuai a sa khempeuhte a ta khia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Humpinelkai hatlaite’n a sa mat ding uh humham khum in, Pathian kiang a kipan a nekding uh a zong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni a suak a, a pai mang ua, a omna khuk chiat uah a kual zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mihing nasem in a pawt a, nitaklam tan in a semgim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa aw, na thilhihte tam hina tel e! Pilna in na bawl vek ahi; leitung na hauhsakna in a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pam ah tuipi a om a, thupi, lianpi tak, huai ah thil bokvak a pai sim zohlouh a om a, sa neu leh sa liante.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huai ah meilong liante a pai uh; huai ah Ole a om, asung a mawl ding a na bawl ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huaite teng in a honngak chiat ua, a huntak a a an uh na piak zelna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A kiang ua na piakte a tawm ua; na khut na zak a, na hoihna in a tai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na mai na sel a, a lungzing ua, a hatna uh na laksak a, a si ua, amau leivui ah a kiknawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na kha na sawl khia a, siam in a om zel uhi; leitung na bawl thak zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Toupa thupina tangtawn in om henla; Toupa a nasep ah nuam hen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aman lei a en a, a ling nak; tangte a khoih a, a khu khe nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ka damsung teng in Toupa pahtawi in la ka sa ding a: ka hinlai teng in ka Pathian phat in la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka ngaihtuahna amah ading in khumtak hi hen: kei Toupa ah ka nuam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mikhialte lei a kipan hihman in om uhenla, migilou saloute om nawn kei uhen! Ka hinna aw, Toupa phat in! Toupa phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="105" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Toupa kiang ah kipahthu gen unla, a min lou un; michih lak ah a thilhihte theisak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah pahtawi in lasa unla, amah phat in lasa un; a thillamdang hih tengteng thu in houlim un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A min siangthou suang un: Toupa zongte lungtang nuamsa hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa leh a hatna zong unla: a mel zong gige un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hihzohsa a nasep lamdangte, a thillamdangte, leh a kam a vaihawmnate theigige un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A sikha Abraham suante aw, a telte Jakob tate aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah Toupa i Pathian ahi a; a vaihawmte leitung ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thukhun tangtawn in a theigige hi, suan sang khat tan a a thu na piak ngei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abraham kiang a a thukhun leh, Isak kiang a a kichiamna ngei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai mah thuseh ading in Jakob kiang ah a hihkip a, Israel kiang a tangtawn thukhun ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kanaan gam na kiang ah k’on pedia, na goutan tuam di’n chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi tawmchik phet a hihlai un; ahi, tawmchik phet, huai gam ah mikhual ahi ngal ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nam tuamtuam kiang ah a pai ua, gam tuamtuam a kipan in mi tuamtuamte kiang ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kuamah nuaisiah a phal kei a: ahi, amau ziak in kumpipate a taihilh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka thaunilhte khoih kei unla, ka zawlneite hihna kei un, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai gam a tung din kial a sam a; nekding himhim a omsakta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ma uah mi a sawl a; Joseph sikha ding a zuak in a om a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A khete kol in a hihna ua; sik khainiang bun in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thu a tun masiah, Toupa thu in amah a ze-et gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kumpipa’n mi a sawl khia a, a sut a, a khahta a, michih vaihawmpa ngei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A insung a heutu ding leh, a sum tengteng tung a vaihawm ding in a bawl a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A mi liante a utut a hen ding leh; a upate hih pil ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel leng Aigupta gam ah a hoh a; Jakob Ham gam ah a omtadih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A mite nakpitak in a pungsak a, amau doute sang in a hihhat zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A mite haw ding in a lungtang uh a lehngatsak a, a sikhate tung a lepchiah tak a hih ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A sikha Mosi a sawl a, a mitel Aron toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amau a chiamtehnate a lak uah a ensak ua, Ham gam ah thillamdangte a ensak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aman mial a sawl a, a hihmialta a; huchi in a thute a nialta kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A tuite uh sisan a suaksak a, a ngasate uh a hihlumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A gam uh Ukeng in a dimta a, kumpipa dantan sung nangawn ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aman thu a gen a, thou tampi hongpai ua, hik leng a gamsung tengteng uah a hongom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A kiang uah vuah sik in gial a pia a, a gam uah meikuang zualzual a peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A grepguite leh a theipi kungte uh a hihsi a; a gam ua singte a kitansakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aman thu a gen a, khaupete a hongpai ua, Lungte toh, sim zoh vuallouh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Huaite’n a gam ua haichi teng a negai ua, a leigahte uleng a gai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A gam ua ta masa om tengteng a that a, a hatna tengteng ua gah masapente uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huchi in, dangka leh dangkaeng toh a pi kheta a; amah namte lak ah mi hatlou khat leng a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A pawtlai un Aiguptate a kipak ua, amau a lautak ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Aman a liah ding in mei a kaisak a, zan a tanvak ding in mei leng a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A ngen ua, huchi in vamim a honpia a, van an in amau a taisakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Suangpi a hong a, huchi in tui a hongpawt zuazua a, mun keute ah lui bang in a luangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A thu siangthou a theigige a, a sikha Abraham toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huchi in, a mite nuamsatak in a pikheta a, a mitelte lasa kawmkawm in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Namchih gamte a kiang uah a pia a: amau michih sepkhiaksa a luahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A thusehte a zuih theihna ding un, a dante a kephoihna ding in, Toupa phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="106" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa phat un, Aw, Toupa kiang ah kipahthu hilh un; amah lah a hoih ngal a: A chitna tangtawn in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kua ahia Toupa thilhih thupitakte gen thei a, A phatnate theisak vek thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaihawmna kem hoihte’n nuam a sa uhi, chiklaipeuh a diktattak a hihmi toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa aw, na mite na deihsakna in hon theigige inla, Aw, na hotdamna toh hongveh in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na mitelte hamphatna ka muhtheih a, Na namte kipahna ah ka nawpsak theih a, Na gouluahte toh ka suan theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka pipute uh bang in thil ka hihkhial ua, tatsetak ka hi ua, gilou tak in ka om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka pipute un Aigupta gam a Na thillamdang hihte a theisiam kei ua; Na chitna thupitak a theigige ta kei ua; tuipi ah a hel zawta ua, Tuipi San ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi pipi in leng amah minziak in amau a hondamta a, a thilhihtheihna thupitak a theihsakna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuipi San a tai a, huchi in a kangta a; huan amau gamdai a pi paisuak bang in tui thukte ah a pi paisuakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amau homi khut a kipan a hondam a, melma khut a kipan a tanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuite’n amau doute a khuh khin a, khat leng dam a pawt a omta kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huailai in a thute a gingta ua; a phatna la a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Himahleh a thilhihte a mangngilh zok ua; a lunggelna a ngak ngamta kei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gamdai ah thil a lunggulh mahmah ua, gamkeu ah Pathian a ze-etta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thil nget uh a pia a; himahleh a hinna uah gawnna a lutsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A giahphual uah Mosi a haza ua, Toupa Mi Siangthou Aron toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lei a kam ka a, Dathan a valhta, Abiram pawlte a khuhkhin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pawl lak uah mei hihkuan in a hongom a, meikuang ah migilou saloute a kangmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Horeb tang ah bawngnou lim a bawl ua, a lim sun a beta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchibang in a thupina uh bawngtal loupa ne bangphet a suaksakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian a hondampa uh, Aigupta gam a thil thupitak hihpa mangngilhta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ham gam a thillamdangte, Tuipi San dung a thil mulkimhuaite hihte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huaiziak in, a hihmang kha ding, a chi a, a hehna heimang ding in a mi tel Mosi a lutna ding ah a ma ah na ding kei ngial leh, a hihmang ding chih a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi, gam deihhuaitak a ngaineu ua, a thu a gingta nuam kei ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A puanin uah a phun zaw ua, Toupa aw a ngaikhe nuam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huaiziak in amau lam ah a khut a zak a, amaute gamdai a a hihpukna ding leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A chi suan dingte uh namchih lak a a hihpuk a, gam chin a a hihzakna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Baal-peor a zom ua, misi kiang a thillatte a ne samta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huchibang in a thilhihte un amah a su heh ua; a tung uah hi a leng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Phinehas ading a, vai a hawm a: huchi in hi daihsak in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huai amah diktatna a seh ahi, tangtawn in suan tengteng tan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Meribah tuite ah amah a hihheh ua, amau ziak in Mosi tung ah thil hoihlou a tung hial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A kha tung ah a hel ua, a muk in kilawmlou pi thu a gen ziak in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Toupa’n a kiang ua hihman thu a piak bang in namte a hihmang kei ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Namchih a kihelpih ua, a thilhihte uh a chingzaw ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A milim nate uh a sem ua; huaite amau ading in thang a hong hita hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahi, dawite kiang ah a tapate a tanute un a kithoih ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Sisan gensiatbei, a tapate uleh a tanute uh sisan a suah ua, huaite in Kanaan gam milimte kiang ah a kithoih uhi; huai gam sisan in a na ninta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Huchi in a nasepte un a hihnin ua, a thilhihte un ang a kawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Huaiziak in Toupa a mite tung ah a thangpaita a, a gouluah a kih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Huchi in amau namchih khut ah a pia a; amau hawte’n a tung uah vai a hawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amau doute’n a nuaisiah ua, a khut uah hihneu in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tamveipi amau a humbit a; himahleh a lunggelna uah a hel nak uhi, a gitlouh satlouhna uah hihniam in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Huchipi in leng aman, a kikou husa uh za in, a mangbatna uh a limsak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A thukhun amau a theisak gige a, a chitna thupidan bangzel in a lungsim a kisikta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Sal a pi tengteng amau a hehpihsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Toupa ka Pathian uh aw, hon hondam inla, namchih lak apan hon pikhawm in, na min siangthou phat ding leh na phatna suang ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Toupa , Israelte Pathian, phat in om hen, tangtawn a kipan tangtawn pha in leng, Mi tengteng in, Amen, chi uhen, Toupa phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="107" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Toupa kiang ah kipahthu hilh un; amah a hoih ngal a: a chitna tuh tangtawn in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa tatsate’n huai gen uhen, doumi khut a kipan a tatkhiakte’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gam teng a kipan a pikhawm a, suahlam leh tumlam, simlam leh mallam a kipan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gamdai a gamkeu lampi ah a vakvak ua; Tenna ding khua himhim a mu kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gilkial leh dangtak in a hinna uh a gilsung uah a bahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaitak in a buaina uah Toupa a sam ua, aman a lungkhamna uah a humbit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing tenna khua a a pai theihna ding un, lampi tangtak ah a pikheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw, mihingte’n Toupa a chitna ziak leh, mihing tate tung a a thillamdang hihte ziak in phat teitei le u aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman a hinna un a lunggulh mahmah in a taisak a, hinna gilkial a vahsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mial nuai ah leh sihna lim a tu a, gimthuakna leh sikkhau a hente mahmah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian thute tung ah a hel ua, Tungnungpen lunggel a ngaihneu ziak un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman a lungtang uh sepgimna in a minsakta a; a puk ua, panpihpa ding himhim a om ngal kei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A buaina uah Toupa a sam ua, aman a buaina ua kipan a pikhia a, a mangbatna ua pan a hondam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mial nuai a kipan leh sihna lim a kipan a pi khia a, a henna uh a suktat sakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw, mihingte’n Toupa a chitna ziak in leh, mihing tate tung a a thillamdang hihte ziak in phat teitei le u aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman dal kongkhakte a chimsak a, a kalhna sik tawnte a hihtanta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihaite a tatlekna ziak un leh, a gitlouh satlouhnate u ziak in a kihihgim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hinna un nektheih chiteng a kih a; sihna kulh kongkhakte a naih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huaitak in a buaina uah Toupa a sam ua, aman a mangbatna ua kipan in a hondam zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A thu a sawl khia a, amau a damsak hi, a manthatna ua kipan in a humbit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw, mihingte’n Toupa a chit ziak leh, mihing tate tung a a thillamdang hihte ziak in phat teitei le uh aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amau kipahthugen kithoihnate lan uhenla, a thilhihte uh lasa in hilh uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuipi a long lian a paisuk a, tuiza tak tung a nasemte’n:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huaite’n Toupa thilhihte leh tui thupi a a thillamdang hihte a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aman thu a pia a, huihpi a nungsak a, huai in a tuikihotte a sangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vanlam ah septouh in a om ua, tui thukpi ah a tumsuk nawn zel uhi: mangbatna ziak in a hinna uh a zulbei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zukham bang in a sawi hoihoi ua, a tuan loklok ua, omdan ding hunlel a theikei nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan a buaina uah Toupa a sam ua, aman a mangbatna ua kipan in a pi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huihpi a daisak duam a, huchi in a tuikihotte a dai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huan, a daihtak ziak in a kipak ua; huchi in aman a omna ding uh longkhawlna ah a pitung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aw, mihingte’n Toupa a chit ziak leh, mihing tate tung a a thillamdang hihte ziak in phat mahmah le uh aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amau mite kikhopna ah amah phat uhenla, upate tutna ah phat uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aman luipite gamdai a suaksak a, tuinakte leng leikeu a suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Gam hoih gam a suaksak zel, a sung a omte genhak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Gamdai dilmun a suaksak zel a, gamkeu leng tuinak a suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Huai ah gilkialte a omsak a, tenna ding khua a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Loute a nei ua, grephuante a bawl ua, a gah hongpungte a muh theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amau vual a zawl a, nakpitak a hihpun in a om ua; a gante uh kiam a phal kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Huan, nuaisiah, gimthuakna, lungkhamna ziak in a kiam hiaihiai ua, a kun ngiungiau lel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Aman miliante tung ah muhsitna a sungbua a, gamdai, lampi omlouhna ah a vakvai saksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Himahleh gentheite gimthuakna a kipan in mun sang ah a khatou hi, ganhon bang in inkuanpihte a siamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Mi diktatte’n huai a mu in a kipak ding uh; thulimlouhna tengteng in a kam a hum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Kuapeuh a pil in huaite a kem hoih ding ua, Toupa chitnate a ngaihtuah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="108" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian aw, ka lungtang a kip hi; la a sa ding, ahi, phatna la ka sa ding, ka thupina ngei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pekging leh kaihgingte aw, halh un: kei zaw zingkhang in ka halh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa aw, michih lakte ah kipahthu k’on hilh ding: namchih lak ah nangmah phat in la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na chitna van khup in a thupi a, na thutak in vandumte a sun hial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian aw, nang van khen ah pahtawi in hongom in: na thupinate leitung tengteng tung ah pahtawi in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na deihtakte humbit a a om theihna ding un, na khut taklam in hondam inla, hon dawng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian in a sianthouna ah hiai bang in a gen a, Nuam ka sa ding a: Sekem khua ka hawm ding a, Sukkoth guam ka hawmzak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead gam kei a ahi a; Manasseh gam leng ka lu humbitna ahi a: Judah gam ka lalchiang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moab gam ka kisilna bel ahi a; Edom gam ah ka khedap ka pai ding a; Philistia gam ka kikou khum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khopi kulhnei ah kuan a honpi lut dia? Edom gam ah kuan a honpi dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian aw, nang hon khahkhia hilou na hi maw? Pathian aw, ka sepaih honte uh kiang ah lah na pawt samta ngal kei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Galte sual ding in hon panpih in; mihing panpihna zaw bangmahlou phet ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian ziak in hangtak in ka hih ding uh: Amah lah hondoute sikdenpa ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="109" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka phat Pathian aw, dai nilouh ken:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Migilou salou kam leh kam khemhat ka tung ah a hangsan ngal ua: amau lei zuauthei in ka kiang ah thu a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huatna thu in hon umsuak ua, bangmahlou in a hondou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka it ziak in a hondoute a hong hita uhi: himahleh kei zaw thumthum ding in ka kipe chinten hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau thil hoih thil gilou in honthuk ua, ka itna huatna mah in a honthuk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang a tung ah migilou koih inla: a taklam ah hekmi ding hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaihawmsak a a om chiang in siamlouh tang in pawt henla: a thumna khelhna ah suak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A damsung nite tom henla; a heutu hihna midang in tang hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A tate pa lou in om uhenla, a zi mah leng meithai in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tate mi vakvai honghi in, khutdoh uhenla; a nekding uh a mun gamsiate ah zong uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pung delh a dangka leitawisak in a neih tengteng laksak vek henla; mikhualte’n a sepgim gah lok uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tung a chitna langsak zel ding kuamah omsam kei uhenla; a ta paneiloute hehpihpa ding kuamah omkei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A suante hihman in om uhen la; khangthak hongom nawn ah a min uh nul mang in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pipute uh gitlouh satlouhna Toupa kiang ah theihgige in om henla: a nu khelhna nulmang in omkei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa ma ah om gige hen. Aman amau theihgigena lei a kipan a hihmang theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chitna latsak nadan a theihlouh ua, mi genthei, tagah leh khasiate thah tum a a sawi zawk ziak un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi, mi hamsiat a utlam ahi a, huchi in amah tung ah a hongtung a: mi vualzawl a kipahlam ahi kei a, huchi in amah gamlat in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Puanaktual silh bang in hamsiatna in a kivan a, huai a gilsung ah tui bang in a lut a, a guh ah thau bang in a leng lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huai amah ading in silh gige puansilh bang in om henla, a kigak zelna kawnggak mah leng hi hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huai hondoute leh ka hinna gensete Toupa’n a thukna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh, Toupa Pathian aw, nang na min ziak in hon hehpih inla: na chitna a hoih ziak in hon humbit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Genthei leh tagah tak ka hi a, ka lungtang ka gilsung ah liam in a om ngal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lim kiamlam bang in ka mang a: khaupe bang in mutleng in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka khukte an ngawl ziak in a hatta kei a; ka sa in thau himhim a puta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amau gensiat ka na hita a; honmuh un a lu uh a sing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Toupa ka Pathian aw, hon panpih inla; aw na chitna bangzel in hon hondam in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huai na khut ahi, a chih theih ua, Toupa , nang na hih ahi, chih a theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amau hamsiat uhen, nang zaw vualzawl zaw in: a thoh tak un a zahlak ding ua, na sikha bel a nuamsa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hondoute zumna puan silhsak in om uhenla, puanak a kivan bang in amau zahlakna in kivan uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka kam in Toupa kiang ah kipahthu nakpi’n ka gen dia; ahi, mipi lak ah amah ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amah tagahte taklam ah ading a, a hinna vaihawmsakte lak a hondam ding in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="110" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n , ka Toupa kiang ah, Na melmate na khe ngakna a ka bawl masiah ka taklam ah tuin, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n na hatna chiang Zion tang a kipan in a sawlkhe ding: nang nangmah doute lak ah vaihawm in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na mite na thilhihtheihna ni ah amau utthu in a kipe zel uhi. Siangthou kilawmna ah, zingsang gilsung a kipan in, na valnou daitui na nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa a kichiam a, a kisik nawn kei ding, Nang zaw Melkizedek omdan bang a tangtawn siampu na hi a, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa na taklam a om in a heh ni’n kumpipate a nuaizan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Namchih lak ah vai a hawm ding a, munte siluang in a hihdim ding a, gam tampi ah lu a satzan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lam lak a luita a dawn ding a: huaiziak in a lu a tawisang ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="111" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa phat un. Mi diktatte kikhop khawmna ah leh kikhopna ah, Ka lungtang tengteng in Toupa kiang ah kipahthu ka hilh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa thilhihte a thupi a, a tung a kipak peuhte’n zonkhiak ahi nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A nasep a zahtakhuai in a thupi a; a diktatna tangtawn a om ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman a thillamdang hihte a theigige a: Toupa mi hehpihthei tak, chitna a dim ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah laute kiang ah nekding a pia a; a thukhun tangtawn in a theigige ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thilhihtheihdan a mite kiang ah a langsak a, namchih gouluah ding a kiang ua pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A khut thilhihte thutak leh vaihawmna dik ahi a: a thuzohna thute muanhuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huaite tangtawn tangtawn a ding in hihkip in a om a, thutak leh diktat a hih ahi chiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman a mite kiang ah tatna a sawl a; a thukhun tangtawn a ding in a sep a; a min a siangthou in a zahtakhuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa kihtak pilna bul ahi a; huchibang a hihmite’n theihsiamna hoih a nei uhi; amah phatna tangtawn a om ding ahi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="112" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa phat un, Toupa kihta mi’n nuam a sa hi, A thupiakte a nakpitak a kipak mi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A suante lei ah hattak in a om ding ua: midiktat khang vualzawl in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A inn ah sum leh hauhsakna a om a: a diktatna tangtawn a om ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi dik ading in mial ah vakna hong pawtkhia a: Amah mi hehpihthei, chitna a dim diktat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi hehpih a leitawisak mi hoih in a vuk nak a; Amah kizen tak in a khosa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangchik mah chiang a ling lou ding ahi ngal a: mi diktat tangtawn a theihgige in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tanchin hoihlou takte a lau kei ding: Toupa muang in a lungtang a kip ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A lungtang a kip a, a lau kei ding, Amah doute tung a a thudeih a hih tangtung a muh masiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hawmzak a, gentheite kiang ah a pia, a diktatna tangtawn a om ding ahi: a ki zahtak tak a pahtawi in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Migilou salou in huai a mu ding a, a heh ding a, a ha a gawi dia a zulmang ding, migilou saloute deihlam a mang ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="113" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa phat un. Aw Toupa sikhate aw, phat unla, Toupa min phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa min phat in om hen, Tua kipan a, tangtawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni suahna a kipan a tumna pha in, Toupa min phat ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa nam chihte tung ah tungnungpek ahi a, a thupina in vante a khup tham ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tunglam a tutphah nei, Toupa i Pathian bang kua ahia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Van a thil omte leh lei a thil omte en ding a a kihihniam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman genthei leivui a kipan a kaithou a, tagah eklei a kipan a domkang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi liante kiang a omsak theihna ding in, a mite mi liante kiang ngei ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman numei ching inn leh lou a kepsak a, tu leh ta nei nu nuamsatak in a bawl hi. Toupa phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="114" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israelte Aigupta gam a pan a pawt ua, Jakob inkuanpihte melmak mi lak a kipan a pawt lai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah a Mun Siangthou a hi a, Israelte a vaihawmna gam a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuipi in huai a mu a, a taimang a; Jordan lui kiksak in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tang liante belamtal bang in a diang ua, mual neute belampa noute bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw nang tuipi, bang na chi a, na taimang tak? Nang Jordan, bangchi na hia, na kiknawn tak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nou tang liante aw, bang na chi ua ahia, belampa noute bang a na dian uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang leitung, Toupa ma ah ling in, Jakobte Pathian ma ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman suangpi dil a suaksak a, meisuang tuinak a suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="115" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, kou hon pelou in, Koumau hon pelou in, na min thupina pe zaw in, na chitna leh na thutak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bang achia namchih in, a Pathian uh koi a om ahia? chi uh ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka Pathian uh van ah a om a: A utut a hih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A milimte uh dangka leh dangkaeng ahi ua, mihing khutsuak ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kam nei napi, a pau theikei ua; mit a nei ua, a mu theikei ua:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bil a nei ua, a za theikei ua: nak a nei ua, gim a za theikei ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khut a nei ua, bangmah a khoih theikei ua; khe a nei ua, a pai theikei ua; a dang un a pau thei sam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amau bawlte amaute bang a hi ding ua; ahi, huai muang peuhmahte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israelte aw, Toupa muang un: amah amau panpihpa leh a phaw uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aron inkuanpihte aw, Toupa muang un: amau panpihpa leh a phaw uh amah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa laute aw, Toupa muang un: amau panpihpa leh a phaw uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n hon theigige a; a vualzawl ding: Israel inkuante a vualzawl ding a: Aron inkuante a vualzawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa laute a vualzawl ding, a lian a neu in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n nou hon pungsak hen, nou leh na tate uh toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa vualzawlna mute na hi uh, amah lei leh van siampa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vante Toupa vante ahi a; leitung mihing tate kiang ah a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Misite’n Toupa a phat kei ua, mun daitak a paisukte peuhmah in a phat sam kei uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kou bel Toupa ka phat ding uh, tu a kipan a tangtawn in, Toupa phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="116" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa ka it ahi, ka aw leh ka ngetnate a ngaihkhiak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei lam a a bil a hondoh ziak in ka damsung teng in amah ka sam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sihna khauhualte’n honvial a, Sheol natnate’n hon man a: mangbatna leh lungkhamna ka na tuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huaitak in Toupa min in ka sam a: Aw Toupa , hehpih in ka hinna humbit in, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa mi hehpihthei tak leh diktattak ahi a; ahi, i Pathian uh mi lainatthei tak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n mi mawlte a humbit nak a: hihniam in ka om a, aman hon hondamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hinna aw, na khawlna ah kiknawnta in; Toupa’n na tung ah hoihtak in a hihta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hinna sihna apan, ka mitte khitui apan, ka khete pukna apan na humbitta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihing gam ah Toupa ma ah ka vak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka gingta a, thu ka gen ding, ahi, nakpitak a hihgim in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka lungvai in, mi tengteng zuau ahi uh, ka na chita mawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka tung a a thil hoih hih tengteng ziak in Toupa kiang ah bang ahia ka piak thuk sam ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hotdamna nou ka la ding a, Toupa min ka sam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka thuchiamte Toupa kiang ah ka tangtun ding, ahi a mite ma ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A misiangthoute sihna Toupa muh in manpha pi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa aw, na sikha ka hi: na sikha, na sikhanu tapa ka hi; n’on henna na sutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kipahthugenna kithoihnate k’on lan ding a, Toupa min ka sam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka thuchiamte Toupa kiang ah ka tangtun ding, ahi, a mite tengteng ma ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Toupa biakin huangsung intual ah, Jerusalem aw, na laitak ah ka tangtun ding hi. Toupa phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="117" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, namchihte aw, Toupa phat unla; michihte aw, amah phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A chitna i tung uah a thupi in; Toupa thutak tangtawn a om ding a hih ziak in. Toupa phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="118" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Toupa kiang ah kipahthu gen un; Amah lah a hoih ngal a: a chitna leng tangtawn a om ding a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A chitna tangtawn in a om ding chih Israelte’n gen uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A chitna tangtawn in a om ding chih, Aron inkuante’n gen uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A chitna tangtawn in a om ding chih, Toupa kihtate’n gen uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka mangbatna a kipan in Toupa ka sam a: Toupa’n hon dawng a, mun awngthawl ah hon omsakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa kei lam a pang ahi a: ka lau kei ding: mihing in bang a honchih thei dia:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa kei lam a pang hon panpihte lak a ahi: huaiziak in hondoute tung ah ka thudeihtel ka mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihing muan sang in Toupa a muanna koih a hoihzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi liante gintak sang in Toupa a ginna koih a hoihzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Namchih in hon umsuak ua; amau Toupa min in ka hihmang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amau hon umsuak ua; ahi, hon umsuak ua; amau Toupa min in ka hihmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuai bang in hon umsuak ua; ling meikuang bang in mihsak in a om uh: amau Toupa min in ka hihmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka pukna ding in honsut na tum a: himahleh Toupa’n a hon panpih geih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa ka hatna leh ka la ahi: ka hotdamna leng a hong hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kipahna leh hotdamna husa midiktatte puanin ah a om hi: Toupa khut taklam in hangsantak in a hih nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa khut taklam pahtawi in a om nak a; Toupa khut taklam in hangsantak in a hih nak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka si kei ding, ka dam ding hi, Toupa thilhihte ka theisak zaw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa’n nakpitak in hon thuzoh a: sihna kiang ah zaw honpe tel kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Diktatna kulh kongkhakte hon honsak un: huaite ah ka lut ding a, Toupa kiang ah kipahthu ka hilh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hiai Toupa kongkhak ahi; mi diktatte a lut ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na kiang ah kipahthu ka gen ding, nang hon dawng in, hon hondampa na hita ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Inlamte suang deihlouh a ning a suang phatuampen a na hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huai Toupa hih ahi; i mitmuh uah a lamdang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hiai Toupa ni seh ahi, hiai ah i nuam un i kipak ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Toupa aw, hehpih in hon hondam inla, Toupa aw, hehpih in vangphatna honsawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Toupa min a hongpai in nuam a sa hi: Toupa inn apan in k’on vualzawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Toupa Pathian ahi, aman vak a honpia a, kithoihna ding khauhual in khih uhen, maitam ki mahmah ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nang ka Pathian na hi a, kipahthu k’on hilh ding a: ka Pathian na hi a, k’on pahtawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw, Toupa kiang ah kipahthu hilh un; amah lah a hoih ngal a; a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="119" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lampi a mi hoihkimte’n nuam a sa uhi, Toupa dan zuite’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thu theihsakte zuite’n nuam a sa uhi, lungtang tengteng a amah zongte’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi, amau diktatlouhna a hih kei ua: A lampite ah a pai zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang na thuzohna thute phatuamngai tak a, zui ding in thu n’on pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw, na thusehte zui ding in ka omdante hihkip in om leh aw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in ka zahlak kei ding a, na thupiakte khawk ka sak hun chiang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lungtang diktak pu in kipahthu k’on hilh ding hi. Na vaihawmna dikte kazil hun chiang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na thuseh ka zui ding a: aw, hon paisan den ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Valnou in, bangchi’n ahia a omdan a hih siangthou ding? Na thu bangzel a a omdan venghoih in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka lungtang tengteng in k’on zong a; Aw, na thupiakte ka paisan zaw phal mahmah ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tung a thil ka hihkhelh louhna ding in na thu tuh ka lungtang ah ka kem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang nuam nasa hi; na thusehte hon zilsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kam a na vaihawm pawt tengteng ka muk in ka theisakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na thu theihsak lam ah nuam ka sa a, hauhsaknate teng a nuam ka sak bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na thuzohna thute ka ngaihtuah ding a, na lampite ka limsak behlap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na thuseh tungte ah ka kipak ding a: na thu ka mangngilh kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka hin theihna ding in na sikha tung ah hoihtak in hih in; huchi in na thu ka zui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na danthu a kipan thillamdang ka muh theihna ding in, ka mitte vaksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lei ah mikhual ka hi a; na thupiakte ka lak ah im ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka hinna kitam gawp in a om a, chiklaipeuh a na vaihawmna a ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi kisathei, hamsiat a omte na taihilh a, na thupiakte vakmangsante.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gensiatna leh muhsitna ka kiang a kipan lamang in; na thu theihsakte ka zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi liante leng a tu ua, hon kalh ua; himahleh na sikha in na thusehte a ngaihtuah zaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na thu theihsakte ka kipahna ahi a, thupha hon hilhte ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka hinna leivui ah a belh bikbek a; na thu bangzel in hon hihhalh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka omdante ka hon theisak a, nang n’on dawng a: na thusehte hon sinsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na thuzohna lam hon theisiam sak in: huchi in na thillamdang hih thute ka ngaihtuah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka hinna lungkham ziak in a tuimang nak a: na thu bangzel in hon hihhat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Omdan diklou ka kiang a kipan lasuan inla; na dan hehpih in honpia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Omdan muanhuai ka tel a; na vaihawmnate ka ma ah ka omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na thu theihsakte ah ka bel chinten a; Toupa aw, hon zahlak sak ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na thupiak lam ah ka tai ding a, ka lungtang na hihlet hun chiang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Toupa aw, na thuseh lampi hon ensak in; huchi in a tawppha in ka tawn ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Theihsiamna honpia in, huchi in, na dan ka kem hoih ding hi, ahi ka lungtang tengteng in ka zui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na thupiak lampi ah hon paisak in, huai ah ka kipak ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na thu theihsak lam ah ka lungtang kiheisak in, huaihamna lam ah hilou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Thil bangmahlou phet enlou ding in ka mit kaihei inla, na lampite ah hon hihhalh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Na thu na sikha kiang ah hihkip in, huai nangmah launa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kei adia gensiatna ka kihtak lamang in; na vaihawmte lah a hoih ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ngai in, na thuzohna thute theih ka ut gige a: na diktatna ziak in hon hihhalh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Toupa aw, na chitnate ka kiang ah hongpai hen, na hotdamna ngei, na thu bangzel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Huchi in, hon gensete dawnna ding ka nei ding a, na thu lah ka muang ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huan, thutak thu ka kam a kipan lakhe vek kenla; na vaihawmnate ka lamen gige ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Huchi in na dan ka zui gige ding a, tangtawn tangtawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Huan, noplenna ah ka vak ding a; na thuzohna thute ka zong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Na thu theihsak thute kumpipate ma ah ka gen ding a, ka zum kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Huan, ka it na thupiak ah ka kipak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Na thupiak, ka it lamte ah, ka khutte ka zak ding a, na thusehte ka ngaihtuah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Na sikha kiang a thuchiam theigige in, Nang n’on lamet sak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Huai ka gimthuakna ah leng ka khamuanna ahi: na thu in lah a hon hihhalhta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Kisatheite’n nakpitak in hon nuihsan ua: himahleh na dan ka pai hoisan kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Toupa aw, nidanglai a na vaihawmte ka theigige a, ka kikhamuan zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Lunghihlouhna in nakpitak in hon buakkhumta a, migilou salou na dan paisante ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ka khualzinna in ah na thusehte ka la ahi gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Toupa aw, zanchiang in na min ka theigige hi, na dan leng ka zui gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Huai ka nei a, na thuzohna thute ka vom hoih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Toupa ka tantuan ahi a: na thu ka zui ding chih ka gen khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Ka lungtang tengteng in na hehpihna ka ngen a: na thu bangzel in hon hehpih in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ka omdante ka ngaihtuah a, na thu theihsak lam ah ka kalsuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ka kintat a, na thupiakte zui ding in ka zekai kei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Migilou salou khauhual in hon gaklom gige a; himahleh na dan ka mangngilh kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Zankim in kipahthu gen din ka thou ding a, na vaihawm diktatte ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Nangmah laute leh na thuzohna thu zuite lawm ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Toupa aw, leitung na chitna in a dim ahi: na thusehte honhilh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Toupa aw, na thu bang in na sikha na hihhoih zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Ngaihtuah siamna leh theihna hon sinsak in; na thupiakte ka gingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Hihhaksat a ka om ma in ka vakmang a: tunzaw na thu ka zuita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Nang na hoih a, thil hoih leng na hih a: na thusehte hon sinsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Kisatheite’n ka tung ah zuau a phuaktawm ua: ka lungtang tengteng in na thuzohna thute ka vom hoih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />A lungtang uh sungthau bang in a thau a; Kei bel na dan tung ah ka kipak gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Na thusehte ka zil theihna ding a hihhaksat a ka om a hoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Dangkaeng leh dangka sang tampi sang in na kam a dan pawt kei a ding in a hoihzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Na khut in hon siam in, a honsek hi: na thupiakte ka sin theihna ding in theihsiamna honpia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Nangmah laute’n hon mu ding ua, a kipak ding uh; na thu ka lamet ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Toupa aw, na vaihawmte a dik chih leh, nang ginom tak in ahi, n’on hihgim chih ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />Na sikha kiang a na thuchiam bangzel in hehpih in na chitna ka khamuanna hisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />Ka hin theihna ding in na chitnate ka kiang ah hongpai hen: na dan ka kipahna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />Kisathei zahlak in om uhen; dikloupi in hon hihniamta ua: himahleh na thuzohna thute ka ngaihtuah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Nang hon laute keilam hong nga uhen, na thu theihsakte a thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Ka zahlak louhna ding in ka lungtang na thusehte ah hoihkim in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" />Ka hinna na hotdamna ngai in a bah a: himahleh na thu ka lamen gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="82" style="v" />Na thu etna in ka mit a vai khinta a, nang chikchiang a hon khamuan ding na hia? ka chi, ka chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="83" style="v" />Meikhu uk savun thawl bang ka na hita ngal a; himahleh na thusehte ka mangngilh kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" />Na sikha kum chiang ding bang tan hi ding ahia, hon simmohte tung ah chikchiang in ahia vai na hawm ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="85" style="v" />Mi kisathei, na dan bang a om loute’n ka kiakna ding in kawkhukte a tou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="86" style="v" />Na thupiak tengteng a ginom ahi: amau dikloupi in hon simmawh uh; hon panpih in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="87" style="v" />Amau lei ah hon hihmang dekdek ua; himahleh na thuzohna thute lah ka kiheisan ngal kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="88" style="v" />Na chitna bangzel in hon hihhalh in: huchi in, na kam a thu theihsak ka zui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" />Toupa aw, tangtawn a ding in na thu van ah kiptak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="90" style="v" />Na ginomna suan tengteng pha in a om ding hi: leitung na hihkip a, a om gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="91" style="v" />Huaite tuni’n na vaihawmte bang in a om gige a thil teng na sikhate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="92" style="v" />Na dan ka kipahna hi kei lezaw, ka gimthuakna a mangthang ding hi’ng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="93" style="v" />Na thuzohna thute chiklaipeuh in leng ka mangngilh kei ding: nang lah huaite in n’on hihhalh ta ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="94" style="v" />Nang a ka hi, hon hondam in; na thuzohna thute ka zong a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="95" style="v" />Migilou saloute’n hihmang tum in a hon ngak ua; himahleh na thu theihsakte ka ngaihtuah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="96" style="v" />Hoihkimna teng tawpna ka mu a; na thupiak a za ngei e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="97" style="v" />Aw, na dan deih hi natel ing e! Nitum a ka ngaihtuah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="98" style="v" />Na thupiakte’n hondoute sang a pilzaw in honbawl a; tangtawn a ka kiang a a om gige ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="99" style="v" />Honhilhte tengteng sang in pilna ka nei zaw ahi; na thu theihsakte ka ngaihtuah a hih nak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="100" style="v" />Tekte sang in ka theisiam zaw a, ahi, na thuzohna thute ka vom hoih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="101" style="v" />Na thu ka zuih theihna ding in lampi gilou himhim ah ka khete a kalsuan ka phal kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="102" style="v" />Na vaihawmna apan ka pial kei; nang n’on hilh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="103" style="v" />Na thute ka kam a ding in khum hina tel e! ahi, ka kam a ding in khuaizu sang in a khum zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="104" style="v" />Na thuzohna thute ziak in theihsiamna ka nei zel: huaiziak in omdan diklou peuhmah ka hua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="105" style="v" />Na thu ka khe ading in khawnvak ahi a, ka lampi ading in vak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="106" style="v" />Na vaihawmna diktatte zui ding in ka kichiam a, ka hihkip lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="107" style="v" />Nakpitak a hihhaksat in ka om a; Toupa aw, na thu bangzel in hon hihhalh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="108" style="v" />Toupa aw, hehpih in ka kam deihthu a thilpiakte na sang inla, na vaihawmnate hon sinsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="109" style="v" />Ka hinna ka khut ah a om a; himahleh, na dan ka mangngilh ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="110" style="v" />Migilousaloute’n ka awkna ding in thang a kam ua; himahleh na thuzohna thute ka vakmang san kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="111" style="v" />Na thu theihsakte tangtawn a gouluah din ka la a; ka lungtang hihnuam pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="112" style="v" />Na thusehte, a tawppha a zui ding a, ka lungtang ka koihkipta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="113" style="v" />Bangmahlou ngaihtuahnate ka hua a: Na dan ka deih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="114" style="v" />Nang ka bukna mun leh ka phaw na hi a; na thu ka lamet ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="115" style="v" />Nou thil hoihlou hihte aw, hon paisan un; ka Pathian thilpiakte ka vom hoih theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="116" style="v" />Ka hin theihna ding in na thu bangzel in honlen nilouh inla, ka lamet tung ah zahlak in hon omsak ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="117" style="v" />Honkai in, huchi in ka bit ding a, na thusehte ka khawksa gige ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="118" style="v" />Na thusehte vakmang san tengteng na musit a; a khemna ulah zuau ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="119" style="v" />Lei a migilou salou tengteng eksia bang in na hihmang a: huaiziak in na thu theihsakte ka deih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="120" style="v" />Ka sa nangmah lau in a ling a: na vaihawmnate leng ka lau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="121" style="v" />Vai ka hawm a, diktattak in ka hih hi: hon nuaisiahte lak ah hon nuse ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="122" style="v" />Na sikha tungtang thu ah, a hoihna a bultum in: kisatheite’n hon nuaisiah kei uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="123" style="v" />Na hotdamna etna in ka mit a vaikhinta a, na thu diktat tak etna toh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="124" style="v" />Na chitna bangzel in na sikha tung ah hih inla, na thusehte honhilh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="125" style="v" />Na sikha ka hi a, theihsiamna honpia in; na thu theihsakte ka theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="126" style="v" />Toupa , sep a hunta; na dan bangmahlou in a bawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="127" style="v" />Huaiziak in na thupiakte dangkaeng sang in ka deih a; ahi, dangkaeng siangthou sang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="128" style="v" />Huaiziak in thil peuhmah thu a na thuzohna thu tengteng dik in ka thei a; omdan diklou peuhmah ka hua ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="129" style="v" />Na thu theihsakte a lamdang a: huaiziak in ka hinna in a a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="130" style="v" />Na thu hilhchet in mite a hihvak a: mi mawlte a theisiam sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="131" style="v" />Kam zapi in ka ka a, ka nak hawphawp a: na thupiakte ka lunggulh ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="132" style="v" />Kei lam hong nga inla, hon hehpih in, na min deihte na hehpih bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="133" style="v" />Ka khe kalsuante na thu ah hihkip inla; gitlouhnate ka tung ah thu neisak ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="134" style="v" />Mihing nuaisiahna pan hon humbit in; huchi in na thuzohna thute ka zui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="135" style="v" />Na mel in na sikha sunvak inla; na thusehte hon sinsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="136" style="v" />Na dan a zuihlouh ziakin, Ka khitui Lui tui bang in ka mit ah a luang khia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="137" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang na dik a, na vaihawmte a dik ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="138" style="v" />Na thu theihsakte diktat leh ginom mahmah in thu na pia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="139" style="v" />Ka phattuamngaihna in hon negaita, hondoute’n na thu a mangngilh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="140" style="v" />Na thu siangthou mahmah ahi; huaiziak in na sikha in a deih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="141" style="v" />Mi neu leh mi muhsit ka hi a: himahleh na thuzohna thute ka mangngilh ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="142" style="v" />Na diktatna tangtawn diktatna ding ahi a, na dan leng thutak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="143" style="v" />Mangbatna leh lunglauna in hon buakkhumta a; himahleh na thupiakte ka kipahna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="144" style="v" />Na thu theihsakte tangtawn a ding in a dik ahi: theihsiamna honpia in, huchi in, ka hing gige ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="145" style="v" />Ka lungtang tengteng in k’on sam a; Toupa aw, hon dawng in: na thusehte ka kem hoih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="146" style="v" />K’on sam zel a; hon dawng in, huchi in na thu theihsakte ka zui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="147" style="v" />Phalvak ma in ka thou a, huhna deih in ka kikou a; na thute ka lamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="148" style="v" />Na thu ka ngaihtuah theihna ding in zanvente ma in, ka mitte a hak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="149" style="v" />Na chitna bangzel in ka aw ngaikhia inla; Toupa aw, na vaihawmnate bangzel in hon hihhalh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="150" style="v" />Ngaihtuah gilou delhte’n a honnaih ua: amau zaw na dan gamlat a om ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="151" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang zaw na nai a; na thupiak tengteng thutak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="152" style="v" />Nidanglai in, na thu theihsakte a kipan in, huaite tangtawn a ding in na hihkip chih ka na theita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="153" style="v" />Ka haksatna ngaihtuah inla, hon humbit in; na dan lah ka mangngilh ngei ngal kei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="154" style="v" />Ka thu hon genpih inla, hontan in na thu bangzel in hon hihhalh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="155" style="v" />Hotdamna migilou saloute apan a gamla hi, na thusehte a zuihlouh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="156" style="v" />Toupa aw, na chitnate a thupi hi; na vaihawmnate bangzel in hon hihhalh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="157" style="v" />Hon simmohte leh hondoute tampi ahi ua, himahleh na thu theihsakte ka paikawi san kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="158" style="v" />Lepchiahtak a hihte ka en a, ka lungkim kei hi; na thu a zuih louh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="159" style="v" />Na thuzohna thute ka deihdan ngaihtuah inla, Toupa aw, na chitna bang in hon hihhalh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="160" style="v" />Na thu a tung a pan in a dik a, na vaihawmna diktat chiteng tangtawn in a om nilouh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="161" style="v" />Mi liante’n a ziak omlou in hon simmawh ua: himahleh ka lungtang in na thute ahi, a kihtak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="162" style="v" />Na thu ah nuam ka sa a, thil thupipi gallak a mu bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="163" style="v" />Zuauthu ka hua in ka kih a; na dan bel ka deih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="164" style="v" />Ni khat in sagihvei nang ka hon phat a, na vaihawm diktatte ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="165" style="v" />Na dan deihte’n khamuanna thupitak a nei ua; pukna himhim a neikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="166" style="v" />Toupa aw, na hotdamna ka lamen a, na thupiakte bang in ka hih zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="167" style="v" />Ka hinna in na thu theihsakte a zui gige a: ka deih mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="168" style="v" />Na thuzohna thute leh na thu theihsakte ka zui zel a; ka omdan tengteng na ma ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="169" style="v" />Toupa aw, k’on sap husa na ma ah hongnai hen: na thu bangbang in theihsiamna honpia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="170" style="v" />Hehpih ka ngetna na ma ah tung hen: na thu bang in hon humbit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="171" style="v" />Na thusehte n’on sinsak chiang in, Ka muk in nang phatna thu gen hen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="172" style="v" />Ka lei in na thu a gen ding a, na thupiak tengteng diktatna a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="173" style="v" />Na khut in hon panpih in, na thuzohna thute ka tel ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="174" style="v" />Toupa aw, na hotdamna ka lunggulh nak a; na dan ka kipahna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="175" style="v" />Ka hinna hing hen, huchi in a honphat ding hi; na vaihawmnate’n leng hon panpih hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="176" style="v" />Belam mang bang in ka vak mang a na sikha zong in; na thupiakte lah ka mangngilh ngei ngal kei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="120" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka mangbatna ah Toupa ka sam a, huchi in aman a hon dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa aw, muk zuautheite lak leh lei mi khemhat lak ah ka hinna humbit in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang lei khemhat, na kiang ah bang a honpia ding ua, bang a hon behlap ding ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi hat thal zumtakte, Juniper sing lingte toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mashekte gam a ka om leh Kedarte puan in lak a ka om ka tung a gik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka hinna amah lemna hawte kiang ah sawtpi a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ken kituah ka ut a; himahleh thu ka gen tak in kidou a ut nak uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="121" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tangte lam ah ka mit ka suantou ding a: koi a kipan in ahia hon panpihna a hongtun ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hon panpihna tuh Toupa lei leh van bawlpa a pan a hongtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman na khe kisuan a phal kei ding a; nangmah chingpa tuh a lusu kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai in Israelte chingpa a lusu in a ihmu sam kei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa nangmah chingpa ahi: Toupa na taklam a nang hon liahpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sun in ni’n a hon hai kei dia, zan in kha in leng a honsun sam kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa’n hoihlou chiteng apan a honching dia; na hinna a ching ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n na pawt leh na lut a ching ding a, tua kipan a, tangtawn in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="122" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa inn ah hoh ni, ka kiang a a chihlai un ka kipak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem aw, na kulh kongkhak sung ah ka khete uh ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem, khopi bang a lam kiptak a gawmkhawm:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa min phat ding in huai ah namte a paitou ua, Toupa namte ngei, Israelte kiang a thu theihsakna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai ah lah vaihawmna ading in laltutphahte tun ahi ngal a, David inkuanpihte laltutphahte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jerusalem khamuanna ding in ngetsak un: nang hondeihte a navak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kulh sungte ah khamuanna om henla, na inpite ah navakna om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka unaute leh ka lawmte ziak in, na sung ah khamuanna om hen, ka chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa i Pathian inn ziak in na hoihna ding ka zong ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="123" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, nang van a tu, nang lam ah ka mit ka suantou zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai in, sikhate mit in a pu khut a et nak bang in leh, sikhanu mit in a pi khut a et bang in, i mit in Toupa lam a en nilouh ahi, hon hehpih masiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa aw, hon hehpih in, hon hehpih in, muhsitna in ka dim sinsen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi nuamsate simmohna leh kisatheite muhsitna in ka hinna uh a dim hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="124" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eilam a pang Toupa hilou hileh, Israelte’n chi uhen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mite’n honsual lai un eilam a pang Toupa hilou hileh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huailai mah in amau eite a hon hingvalhta ding ua, itung ua a thangpaih lai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huailai mah in tuite’n a hon tummangta ding a, lui in i hinna a vuktumta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huailai mah in tui kisatheite’n I hinna a vuktumta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sa mat bang a mat ding a a ha ua hon pelou Toupa phat in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thangkamte thang a pan vasa a suakta bang in i hinna a suakta hi, thang a seta a, eite i suakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hon panpihna ding Toupa lei leh van bawlpa min ah a om chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="125" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa muangte tuh Zion tang hihlin vuallouh, Tangtawn a om gige ding bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tangte Jerusalem kim a a om bang in Toupa a mite kim ah a om hi. Tua kipan a, tangtawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gilou salou lalchiang mi diktat tan tung ah a kinga kei ding a; midiktatte’n a khut ua thulimlouhna a khoih kei uleh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa aw, hoihtak a omte tung ah hoihtak in hih in, a lungtang ua diktak a omte tung ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A lampi kawi ua pialte bel Toupa’n thil hihkhialte toh a pi khe ding. Israelte tung ah khamuanna om hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="126" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n Zion salte a pi kik nawnlai in, mangnei bang hial i hi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huailai in i kam uh nuih in a dim a, i lei uh lasakna in: huailai in namte lak ah, Toupa’n amau ading in thil thupi a hihsak ahi, a chi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa’n thil thupitak hon hihsak a; i kipak mahmah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa aw, sal a ka tang uh honpi kiknawn in, simlam luite bang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khitui kekawm a tuhte’n nuamsatak in a at ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kap kawm in buhchi kuankhiak pih mahle uh, a buhphalte uh tawi in nuamsa in a hongpai nawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="127" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa’n inn a lam kei leh, a lamte’n a semgim thawn phet uhi: Toupa’n khopi a ven hoih kei leh, a vengmi a hak thawn lel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zingsangpi in na thou ua, na khawl hak mahmah ua, sepgimna an na nek uh: nou din a thawn lel ahi: a mi deihtak ihmut a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai in, tate tuh Toupa apan i goutan ahi ua: gil a gah a kipahman a honpiak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatlai tate mi hat khut a thaltangte bang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thal bawm thal a dim neite kipaktak in a om zel uhi; kulh kong a a doute uh a biak un leng a zahlak kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="128" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa lau peuhmahte’n nuam a sa uhi, a lampi tawnte’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na khut sepgim gah ne ding na hi ngal a: kipaktak in na om ding a, navak in leng na om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na zi na inn kim a grepgui gahpha bang ahi ding a: na tate na dohkan kim ah, olive selte bang a hi ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai in, Toupa laumi huchibang in vualzawl in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n Zion apan in hon vualzawl ding hi: huchi in, na damsung teng in Jerusalem hoihna na mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi, na tute na mu ding a! Israelte tung ah khamuanna om hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="129" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka naupan chik apan in min tamveipi hon mangbangsak ua. Israelte’n chi uhen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka naupan chik apan in min tamveipi hon mangbangsak ua: himahleh honzou tuankei ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leilette’n ka nungzang ah lei a let ua; a leileh kuangte uh a sausak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa a diktat ahi: migilou saloute khauhualte a attanta a, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau zahlak leh taizak sak in om uhen, Zion hawte tengteng mah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Inn tung a loupa a khansang ma a vuai, bang in om uhen:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huai loupa in buh atmi in a khut a hihdim ngeikei a, buhphal telkhawmmi’n leng a angsung a hihdim ngei sam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa vualzawlna na tung uah om hen: Toupa min in k’on vualzawl uhi, a paikhen mite’n a chi sam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="130" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, tui thukpi a kipan k’on sam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa ka aw ngaikhia in: hehpih ka ngetna aw na bil in ngaikhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa nang thulimlouhnate na chiamteh leh, Toupa aw, kua ading zouta dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh na kiang ah ngaihdamna a om ahi, kihtak a na om theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa ka ngak gige a, ka hinna in a ngak gige a, a thu leng ka lamen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A vengmin zingsang khovak a ngaklah sang in ka hinna in Toupa a ngaklah zaw hi. Ahi, a vengmin zingsang khovak a ngaklah sang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israelte aw, Toupa lamen un, Toupa kiang ah chitna a om a, A mah ah tatna tampi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in aman Israelte a thulimlouhna tengteng ua kipan a honkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="131" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa , ka lungtang a kisathei kei a, ka mitte a sanghah law ngeikei a; thil thupitakte ah ka kisangsak sam kei hi, Kei a ding in thillamdang luate ah leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hinna him in ka daisak a; naupang nawinek tawpta a nu kiang a om bang in, ka hinna naupang nawinek tawpta bang in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israelte aw, Toupa lamen un, Tu a kipan a, tangtawn in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="132" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa , David a haksat thuakna tengteng theihpih in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa kiang a kichiam a, Jakob Mi Hatpa kiang a thu a chiamdan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka omna inn a biakbuk ah ka lut kei dia, ka lupna ah ka kah sam kei ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mitte ihmut ka phal kei ding a, ka mitte a sin uh leng ka phal sam kei ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa mun ding ka zonkhiak masiah, Jakob Mi Hatpa omna ding chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai in, a thu Ephrathah ah ka za ua; sing gam ah ka muta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah biakbuk ah ka lut ding ua; a khe ngakna bul ah ka be ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa aw, thou inla, na khawlmun ding ah lut in; nang leh na hatna bawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na siampute diktatna in kivan uhenla; na misiangthoute nuamsa in kikou uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na sikha David ziak in na thaunilh mel kiheisak nawn ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa’n David kiang ah thutak in a kichiamta a; a lehngatsan kei ding hi: na sapum gah a mi mangtutphah ah ka tusak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na tate’n ka thukhun leh ka thu theihsak, amau ka hilh ding a zuih uleh, a tate u leng tangtawn in na mangtutphah ah a tu zel ding uh, chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa’n Zion lah a tel ngal a; a omna ding in a deih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiai tangtawn a ding a ka khawlmun ding ahi: hiai ah ka om nilouh ding; ka deihlam ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A nekding tampi in ka vualzawl dia; a mi gentheite uh tanghou in ka taisak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A siampute hotdamna in ka van ding a; a misiangthoute nuamsa in a kikou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huai ah David ki ka selkhe sak ding: ka thaunilh ading in khawnvak ka septa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amah doute zahlakna in ka van ding a, amah tung ah zaw a lallukhu a te sengsung ding hi, chi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="133" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai in, unaute kituak diamdiam a omkhawm a nak hoih in, a nuam mahmah hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lu a thau manpha tak, khamul a luangkhia, Aron khamul ngei a luangkhia a, a puanaktual mong a luangkhia bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hermon daitui chim Zion tangte a kejel bang ahi; huai ah Toupa’n vualzawlna thupiak a pia a, tangtawn a hinna ding ngei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="134" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai un, Toupa sikha, Toupa inn a zan a ding zel tengteng aw, Toupa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na khutte uh Mun Siangthou lam ah zak unla, Toupa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa’n Zion a kipan in hon vualzawl hen; lei leh van bawlpa ngei in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="135" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa phat un. Toupa min phat un; Toupa sikhate aw, amah phat un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nou Toupa inn ading a, Pathian inn huangsung intual a dingte aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa phat un; Toupa lah a hoih ngal a; A min phat in lasa un, a nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa’n Jakob amah ading in a tel a, Israelte a gou tuam ding in a tel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa thupitak ahi chih leh, I Toupa Pathian tengteng sang a tungnung ahi chih, i thei ngal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n a ut peuhmah, van ah, lei ah, tuipi ah, tuithukpite ah a hih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman meipite kawlmong a kipan in a paitou sak a; khophiate vuah in a siam hi; a sum in a kipante bang in huih a lakhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman Aigupta gam ta masate a that a, mihing leh sate leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aigupta gam aw, amah chiamtehnate leh thillamdangte na sung ah a honsawl a, Pharo tung ah leh a sikhate tung ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman nam tampi a that a, kumpipa thupi taktakte a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sihon Amorte kumpipa leh Og Bashan gam kumpipa leh, Kanaan gam a mi tengteng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A gam uh gouluah ding in a pia a, a mi Israelte goutan ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toupa aw, na min tangtawn in a om ding a; Toupa aw, nangmah theihgigena suan omsung teng in leng a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n a mite vai a hawmsak in, a sikhate tungthu ah a lungsim lah a kisik dek ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Namchih milimte dangka leh dangkaeng ahi ua, mihing khutsuak ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kam a nei ua, a pau kei ua; mitte a nei ua, a mu theikei ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bilte a nei ua, a za theikei ua; a kam uah hatna a omsam kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amau bawlte amaute bang in a om ding uh, huaite gingta peuhmahte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel inkuanpihte aw, Toupa phat un: Aron inkuanpihte aw, Toupa phat un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Levi inkuanpihte aw, Toupa phat un; Toupa laumite aw, Toupa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa Zion a kipan phat in om hen, Jerusalem a tengpa ngei, Toupa phat un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="136" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Toupa kiang ah kipahthu hilh un: amah lah a hoih ngal a; a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw, pathiante Pathian kiang ah kipahthu hilh un: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw, kumpipate Toupa kiang ah kipahthu hilh un: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah kia thillamdang thupitak hihpa kiang ah: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pilna a van siampa kiang ah: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lei tui tung a koih ziazua pa kiang ah: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaksakpa thupitak kiang ah: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni, sun a vaihawm ding in: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kha leh aksite, zan a vaihawm ding in: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aiguptate ta masa hihlumpa kiang ah: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israelte a lak ua kipan a pikhepa kiang ah: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khut hat leh banzak in: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuipi San kikhensak hokpa kiang ah: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israelte a laitak a galkah sak a: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pharo leh a sepaihte Tuipi San a hihmangpa kiang ah: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A mite gamdai a pipa kiang ah: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa thupitakte thatpa kiang ah: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpi minthangte thatpa kiang ah: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sihon Amorte kumpipa: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Og Bashan gam kumpipa: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A gam goutan dia pia: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A sikha Israel goutan pepa kiang ah: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aman i nam niamlai in hon theigige a: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hondoute lak ah hon humbit a: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aman sa tengteng kiang ah nekding a pia a: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aw, van Pathian kiang ah kipahthu hilh un: a chitna tangtawn a om ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="137" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon luite gei ah, huai ah i tu a, ahi, i kap zel a, Zion i ngaihtuah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huai a muisumte ah i kaihgingte i khai ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zion la khat hon saksak un, chi in, sal a honpite’n lasa din a honsawl ua, hon hih gentheite’n nuamsa ding in leng hon chinak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi gam peuh ah Toupa la bangchi’n i sa thei dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem aw, k’on mangngilh leh, ka khut taklam in a thilsiam mangngilh sam hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />K’on theihgige keileh, ka lei ka dangtawng ah belh bikbek hen; ka nopsakna pen sang a Jerusalem ka deih zawk kei leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa aw, Jerusalem ni in Edom suante theigige in. A suangphum nangawn chimsak un, chimsak un, chite.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babulon tanu aw, hihman a om ding; ka tung ua na hih bang a honthuk ding kipak in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na tanu noute hon laksak a, suangpi satna dia zangpa ding kipaktak in a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="138" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na kiang ah ka lungtang teng in kipahthu ka gen ding a: pathiante ma ah nang phat in la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na biakin siangthou lam nga in k’on be dia, na chitna leh Na thutak ziak in na min ka phat ding: Na thu na min sang in na hihlianta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />K’on sap ni’n nang n’on dawng a, ka hinna na hatna in n’on hihhat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa aw, lei a kumpipa tengteng in kipahthu a honhilh ding ua, na kam a thupawtte a zata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi, Toupa lampite la in a sa ding ua: Toupa thupina lah a thupi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa tungnung tak ahi na a, mi neute a limsak hi: mi kisatheite bel gamlapi a kipan in a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangbatna lak ah vak mah leng nang n’on hihhalh ding a; hondoute hehna sual ding in na khut na zak ding a, na khut taklam in n’on hondam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n ka tungtang a a hih ding a tangtun ding hi: Toupa aw, na chitna tangtawn in a om ding a; nangmah khut thilhihte tawpsan ken.
  </para>
  <chapter number="139" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, nang ngentel tak in n’on ensuak a, n’on theita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang ka tut leh ka din na thei a, Ka ngaihtuahna gamlapi a kipan in leng na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka pai leh ka lup n’on entel zel a, ka omdan tengteng na thei vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai in, Toupa aw, nang na theih siangvek louh, ka lei ah thu a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang ka nunglam leh ka malam ah n’on umsuak a, ka tung ah na khut na koihlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchitel a theihna kei ding in a lamdang lua a; a sang tel a, ka pha zou kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kha a pan in koi ah ka pai dia? Nang a pan koi ah ka taimang dia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Van ah kahtou ning chi leng, huai ah na om ngal a: Sheol ah lupna bawl ning chi leng, ngai in, huai ah leng na om zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zing kha zak in, tuipi tawp pek ah va om ning chi leng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huai ah leng na khut in n’on pi ding a, na khut taklam in honlen ding ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pellou in mial in honkhuh zouvek ding a, ka kim a vak zan ahi ding chi dek lengleng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mial in nang apan bangmah a liah kei a, zan lah sun bang in a vakzaw ahi: nang adin mial leh vak a kibang sapsap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangmah ngei in ka lungsim na nei a: ka nu gilsung ah n’on phankhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na kiang ah kipahthu k’on hilh ding a; lauhuai tak leh lamdang pi a bawl ka hih ziak in: na thilhihte lamdang tak ahi a; huai tuh ka hinna in a theitel mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A guk a bawl a ka om a, lei mun nuainungpen a kilawmtak a bawl a ka omlai in, ka guh ka tang nang apan sel in a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka lim kibawl kim nailou na mit in a mu a, na laibu ah ka hiangte teng gelhvek ahi, a nisim a bawl in a om zel a, khat leng a om nai louh lai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian aw, na ngaihtuahnate kei ading in manpha hina tel e! A gomkhawmna thupi hina tel e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sim dek mah leng, a tamdan piaunel sang in a tamzaw ding: ka khanloh leh, na kiang a om nilouh ka na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian aw, migilou saloute na that ngei ding a; huchi in sisan suahhatte’n hon paisan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amau gilou tak in nang a hon gensia un, nangmah doute’n na min a gen thanghuai nak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa aw, nangmah hawte ka haw kei ahia? Nangmah sualte tung ah ka lungkim ahia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amau huat petmah in ka hua a: hondoute ding in ka sep chiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian aw, ngentel tak in hon ensuak inla, ka lungtang thei in: honchian inla, ka ngaihtuahnate thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kei ah gilou salou lam mawngmawng a om hia omlou, en inla, tangtawn lampi ah honpi in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="140" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, migilou apan hon humbit inla; mi ngongtat apan honhum in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amau a lungtang uah thilhihkhelhte a ngaihtuah ua: dou din a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lei uh gul bang in a hiamsak ua; a kam sung uah thangtom gu a om hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa aw, migilou salou khut lak ah hon kem hoih inla; mi ngongtat lak ah honhum in: amau ka khe kalsuante sawnkawi a tum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi kisatheite’n ka awkna ding in thang a guk kam ua, khauhualte toh; lamsik ah len a phah ua; ka awkna ding in thangte a kam uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa kiang ah, nang zaw ka Pathian na hi: Toupa aw, hehpih ka ngetna awte na bil na doh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa Pathian aw, ka hotdamna hatna aw, nang kisual ni chiah ka lu n’on khuhsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa aw, migilou salou deihlamte zaw phal kenla; a ngaihtuahna gilou piching sak ken; huchi kei leh a kipahtawi kha ding uhi, ka chi a. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hon umsuakte lu amau muk a thuginalou a gen un khuh hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Meiamte a tung uah kia henla: mei a paih in om uhenla; a thoh taklouhna ding un kawkhuk thupitak ah paih in om uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu hoihlou genpa lei ah hihkip in a omkei ding a: mi ngongtat hihse ding in thil hoihlou in a zong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n gimthuakte a gum ding chih ka thei, tagahte adin diktak in vai a hawm ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pellou in mi diktatte’n na min a phat ding ua; midikte na ma ah a om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="141" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa , k’on sam hi, ka kiang ah hongpai meng inla: k’on sap in ka aw ah bil na doh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thumna gimnamtui bang in na ma ah hihkhiak in om henla; ka khutzak nitaklam kithoihna bang in om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa aw, ka kam bul ah vengmi tusak inla; ka muk kongkhak veng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gilou salou thil hihkhial mite hih bang in, thil hoihlou lam ah ka lungtang kiheisak kenla; a neklimte uh hon nesak ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi diktat in honsat hen, migitna ahi ding; hon taihilh hen; thau manpha ahi ding a, Mi gilou salou in ka lutang thaunilh ngeikei hen, a nasep giloute hua in ka thum gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amau mawhpaih dingte kiang a piakkhiak a hih chiang un, Toupa thu a dik chih a thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi’n lei a leh a, a hihzan bang in a guhte uh han gong ah thehdalh in a om ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa Pathian aw, ka mit in nang lam a en nak a: nangmah ah ka muanna ka nga a; ka hinna vuaktang in nuse ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka awkna ding a a thangkam lak uah hon hum in, thil hihkhialte thang lakte ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei ka suakta ding a, mi gilou salou amau len ah awk uhen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="142" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka aw in, Toupa ka sam a; ka aw in Toupa kiang ah hehpihna ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ma ah ka mangbat thu ka gen a; a ma ah ka buaina ka theisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kha ka sung a a bahlai in, nangmah in ka lampi na thei a. Ka paina lampi ah ka awkna ding in thang a guk kam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka taklam ah om inla, en dih, kuamah honthei a omkei ua; ka kihumbitna a omta kei a; kuamah himhim in ka hinna a limsakta kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa aw, k’on sam a; nang ka kihumbitna, mihing gam a ka tantuam na hi, ka chi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka kikou husa ngaikhia in; nakpitak a hihniam in ka om a. Hon simmohte lak ah hon humbit in; kei sang in a hat zaw ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na min ka phat theihna ding in, ka hinna suangkulh a kipan in pikhia in: mi diktatte’n hon umsuak ding ua; nang hoihtak a n’on hih ding ziak in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="143" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa aw, ka thumna ngaikhia inla; hehpih ka ngetna ah bildoh inla; na ginomna ziak leh na diktatna ziak in hon dawng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na sikha tung ah vaihawm ken; na mitmuh ah mihing himhim siamtang a om ding lah a om kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Melma in ka hinna a simmawh a; ka hinna lei ah a satpuk a: sawtpi a sisa bang in, mun mial te ah hon omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka kha ka gilsung ah a bah a: ka lungtang ka gilsung ah a mangbang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nidanglai nite ka theigige a; na thilhihte teng ka ngaihtuah zel a na khut nasepte ka sut zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka khutte nang lam ah ka zak zel a, ka hinna, gam zawngkhal tak bang in, nangmah ah a dangtak hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa aw, hon dawng meng in, ka kha a bah hi; kei apan na mai selken; huchilou in zaw kawkhuk a paisukte banglel in ka na om kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zingsang in na chitna thu hon theisak in; nang lah k’on muang ngal a, ka paina ding lampi hon theisak in; ka lungsim lah na kiang ah ka koih kip zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa aw hondoute lak ah hon humbit in; n’on na sel ding in na kiang ah k’ong tai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na deihlam hih hon kisinsak in; ka Pathian lah na hi ngal a: na kha hoih in lamphei ah honpi zel hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa aw, na min ziak in hon hihhalh inla: na diktatna ziak in ka hinna mangbatna a kipan pikhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na chitna ziak in hondoute hihmang inla, ka hinna hih mangbangte tengteng hihmang in; na sikha ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="144" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa ka suangpi phat in om hen, Aman ka khutte galdou a zilsak a, ka khutzungte dou ding in a chil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka chitna leh ka kulhpi, ka insang leh hon humbitpa, ka phaw leh ka muanna ngakna ka nuai a ka mite zouzelpa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa mihing bang ahia, huchitel a amah na theih naknak? Mihing tapa leng kua ahia a hih, Na ngaihtuah naknak?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihing zaw bangmahlou lel ahi a: a damsung nite lim mang zel bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa aw, na vante kunsak in hong paisuk inla: tangte khoih in, huchi in a khukhe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khua phesak inla, amau dalhsak in na thalte kapkhia inla, hih buaigawp in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tunglam a kipan in na khut in hon sawk inla; tuilian a kipan in: hon honkhia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kam un bangmahlou a gen ua, a khut taklam uh diklouhna khut taklam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian aw, nangmah pahtawi in la thak ka sa ding a: pekging gui sawm nei a nangmah phat in la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah ahi, kumpipate kiang a hotdamna pia a, namsau mi hihsethei lak a a sikha David honkhepa pen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hon honkhia inla, mikhualte khut a kipan hon humbit in, a kam un thu bangmahlou peuh a gen nak ua, a khut taklam uh khut taklam diklou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka tate uh a hong valnou ua sing nou dipdip bang a a om ua; ka tanute uleng Inpi omdan gel bang a a ning a suangkhuak bang a a om hun un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka buh innte uh a dim a, thil chichih a om phetphut a; ka belamte un leng nou a sang a sang a tam, a sing a sing a tam ka mun ua a neih chiang un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka bawngte uh a hong suanphat a; nou neihsiat himhim a omlouh a; inn sung loh hiam leh pawtkhia a omlouh a, ka kongzingte ua kikou husa a omlouh chiang in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchibang a om mite kipaktak in a om nak uhi: ahi, Toupa Pathian a nei mite kipaktak in a om nak uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="145" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa aw, ka Pathian, k’on pahtawi ding a; na min tangtawn tangtawn in ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Niteng in k’on phat ding a; na min tangtawn tangtawn in ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toupa a thupi a, nakpitak a phat ding ahi; a thupidan suikhiak vual ahi kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Suan khat in suandang kiang ah na thilhihte a phat sawnsawn ding a, na thilhih thupitakte a theisak ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah pahtawina kilawm dan thupitak leh na thillamdang hihte ka ngaihtuah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mite’n na thilhih mulkimhuaite hatdan a gen ding ua; ken leng na thupidan ka theisak sam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na hoihna thupitak a theih uh a gen ding ua, na diktatna nuamsatak in la in a sa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa mi hehpihthei, chitna a dim, lungnel, chitna thupitak nei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa bangkim tung ah leng a hoih hi; a chitnate a thilsiamte tung ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa aw, na thilsiam teng in na kiang ah kipahthu a honhilh ding ua; misiangthoute’n nang a honphat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na gam thupidan thu gen in, na thil hihtheihna thu houlimna in a zang ding ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing tate kiang a a thilhih thupitakte leh, a gam kilawmna thupidan theisak ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na gam tangtawn gam ding ahi a, na thuneihna suan omsung teng in a om gige ding hi. Toupa a thute ah a muanhuai a, a nasepte ah deihsak a siam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n a pukte a len gige a, kun kheukheu a omte a kaitang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amau tengteng mit nang tung ah a tu a; a hun tak ah a annek ding uh na pia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na khut na zak a, thil hing teng deih na hih taisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toupa a lampi tengteng ah a dik a, a nasep peuhmah a mi hehpihthei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa amah min lou tengteng kiang ah a nai hi, thudik a Amah lou peuhmahte kiang ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amah laute deihlam a hih tangtung ding a; a kahna uh a za ding a, a hondam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amah it tengteng Toupa’n a hawi a; himahleh migilou a hih mangthang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Toupa phatna ka kam in a gen ding a; sa peuhmah in a min siangthou tangtawn tangtawn in phat uhen!
  </para>
  <chapter number="146" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa phat un! Ka hinna aw, Toupa phat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka damsung teng in Toupa ka phat ding a; ka hin laiteng in ka Pathian phat in la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi liante gingta kei unla, mihing tapa panpihna himhim omlouhna gingta sam kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A nakna in a pawtsan a, amah lei ah a kiknawn a; huai ni mah in a ngaihtuahnate a mang pah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakob Pathian a panpih dia neimi in nuam a sa hi, a lametna Toupa a Pathian ah a om hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman van leh lei a bawl a, tuipi leh asung a om tengteng, aman thudik a vom gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nuaisiah a omte ding in vai a hawm sak a, gilkialte kiang ah an a pia. Hentate Toupa’n a suaktasak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toupa’n mittawte mit a hih vaksak a; kun kheukheute Toupa’n a kaitang a; Toupa’n mi diktatte a it hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toupa’n mikhualte a veng a; pabeite leh meithaite a khotuah a; himahleh gilou lampite a lumlehsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Toupa’n tangtawn in vai a hawm ding; Zion aw, na Pathian in suan tengteng tan in vai a hawm ding hi. Toupa phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="147" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa phat un! Pathian phat a lasak a hoih a; amah zaw mi deihsak a siam a, phat a kilawm him ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa’n Jerusalem a dingsak nawn a; Israel delh khiakte a pikhawm nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khasiate a hihdam a, a liamnate uh a tuam zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aksi tamdan a sim a; a min uh a sa chiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa a thupi a, thilhihtheihna ah leng hattak ahi; a pilna in tawpni a neikei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toupa’n thunuailutte a len gige a; migilou saloute lei ah a hihniam zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kipahthugen a Toupa pahtawi in lasa unla; kaihging toh i Pathian phat in lasa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman van meipi a khuhsak a, lei ading in vuah a sutuah a, tangte ah loupa a pousak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman sa kiang ah a nekding a pia a, va-aknou hamhamte kiang ah toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman sakol hatna ah a kipak kei a; mihing khe tungte ah leng kipahna himhim a neikei naknak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Toupa amah laute tung leh a chitna lamente tung ah a kipak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jerusalem aw, Toupa phat un; Zion aw, na Pathian phat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman na kulh kongkhakte kalhna singtawnte a khauhsak a; na sung a na tate om lah a vualzawl ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na gamgi sung ah lemna a bawl a; buh hoihpen in a hon hihdim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thupiak lei ah a sawl khia a: a thu hattak in a tai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vuk belam mul bang in a pia a; vuk kia vut bang in a theh zak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tui khal tanghou them bang in a paikhia: amah votna ma ah kua ahia ding thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thu a sawlkhia a, huaite a zulsak a, huih a nungsak a tuite a hongluang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thu Jakobte kiang ah a langsak a, a thusehte leh a vaihawmte Israelte kiang ah a langsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aman kua nam tung ah mah huchibang in a hih ngeikei a; a vaihawmte a thei sam kei uhi. Toupa phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="148" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa phat un! Van a kipante Toupa phat unla: tunglamte ah Amah phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A angel tengteng aw, amah phat unla; a sepaih tengteng aw amah phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni leh khate aw, amah phat unla; aksi vakte aw, amah phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vante, vante aw, amah phat unla, van tung a tui omte aw, amah phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huaite’n Toupa min phat uhen: aman thu a pia a, siam in a omta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman huaite tangtawn tangtawn a din a hihkip a: khen nawn theihlouh ding in a gite uh a khung kip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nou Dragonte leh thuknate aw! Lei a kipan Toupa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />mei leh gial, vuk leh tuihute aw, a thu zui zel huihpite:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tang lian leh tang neute, sing gah nuam leh sidar singte aw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />gamsate leh ganvulhte aw; ganhingte,tungleng vasate aw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />lei a kumpipate leh michih kumpi tate leh lei vaihawmte aw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nungak leh tangvalte, putek leh naupangte aw, Toupa phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaite’n Toupa min phat uhen; Amah min kia tawisang in a om ngal a: a thupina in lei leh van a khup tham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A mite adin ki a tungdingta, a misiangthou tengteng adin phatna mah; Amah kiang nai a om Israel mite ading. Toupa phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="149" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa phat un! Toupa pahtawi in la thak sa unla, misiangthoute kikhopna ah a phatna lasa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israelte amau siampa tung ah kipak uhenla; Zion tate a kumpipa uh tung ah nuam uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A min lou in phat uhenla; khuangta leh kaihging toh amah phat in lasa uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toupa a mite tung ah a kipak a; thunuailutte hotdamna in a zem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Misiangthoute thupina ah kipak tak in om uhenla: a lupna tungte uah nuam in Lasa uhen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian pahtawi a phatna a kam uah om henla, namsau hiam tuah a khut uah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Namchih tung a phu la a, michih tung a gawtna tungsak ding leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kumpipate uh khainiang a hen a, a mi hoihte uh sikkolte bunsak ding leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a tung ua vaihawm gelhsa tungsak ding in: huai kilawmna a misiangthou tengteng in a neichiat uhi, Toupa phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="150" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toupa phat un! Pathian a Mun Siangthou ah phat unla: A thilhihtheihna huihkhua zapi ah Amah phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thilhih thupitak ziak in Amah phat unla: A thupi mahmah dan bang in Amah phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pengkul ging in Amah phat unla: pekging leh kaihging in Amah phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuangta leh lam in Amah phat unla: Kaihging tuamtuam leh Tamngai in Amah phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dakkhutbet ngaihtak in Amah phat unla; dakkhutbet ngaihtak in Amah phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangkim, ha thei peuhmah in Toupa phat hen! Toupa phat un!
  </para>
</usx>
